msgstr "黑暗维克索"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:4
msgid "Clemon the Dead"
msgstr "亡者克莱蒙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:5
msgid "Saxar the Permanent"
msgstr "永恒者萨克萨"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:6
msgid "Morgrath the Grey"
msgstr "灰袍莫格拉斯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:7
msgid "Ulvane the Unrepentant"
msgstr "不悔者乌尔瓦内"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:8
msgid "Iron Vithnipravad"
msgstr "铁甲维斯尼普拉瓦德"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/place_mon.txt:9
msgid "Argonax"
msgstr "阿尔戈纳克斯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:10
msgid ""
"Artemus gave you the Pyramid Sigil, quietly. The old pyramids are said to lead to the land below the land."
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯悄悄交给你一枚金字塔印记。据说古老的金字塔通往地下之地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:100
msgid ""
"Heretics have cast Dreyfus, High Priest of Mok, out of his Western Tower. They haul their supplies up a rope on the north wall."
msgstr "异端分子把莫克的大祭司德赖弗斯赶出了他的西塔。他们用绳子沿北墙把补给吊上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:101
msgid ""
"The gemsmiths outside Castleview make gear from five rocks of their gem and a few gems. The rocks come from the Gemstone Mines."
msgstr "堡景镇外的宝石匠用五块他们那种宝石的原石和几颗宝石打造装备。原石来自宝石矿坑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:102
msgid ""
"Vespar the Wizard lost the emerald handle of his staff on the road back from Sandcaster. He can get you into the city."
msgstr "巫师维斯帕在从沙堡镇回来的路上丢了他法杖上的翡翠柄。他能让你进城。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:103
msgid ""
"Nibbler the monkeydog will trade the key to the Temple of Bark for Monga melons. The sweetest grow in Castleview Vale's southern meadows."
msgstr "猴犬啃啃愿用树皮神殿的钥匙交换蒙加瓜。最甜的瓜长在堡景谷南边的草地上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:104
msgid ""
"The Orcs have kidnapped Princess Sheewana, a sister of the Sprites, into the Temple of Bark. Sharla asks for help."
msgstr "兽人把精灵的姐妹希瓦娜公主绑架到了树皮神殿里。莎拉请求你的帮助。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:105
msgid ""
"Graalg's Ogres rob Kramer's caravans in Ogre Pass. Kramer pays to be rid of them; Graalg might be talked round."
msgstr "格拉尔格的食人妖在食人妖隘口抢劫克拉默的商队。克拉默出钱要除掉他们；格拉尔格或许可以说服。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:106
msgid ""
"Yog of the Sardaj barbarians asks whether you have come to his lands for battle."
msgstr "萨尔达蛮族的约格问你，是不是为了战斗来到他的领地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:107
msgid ""
"The Thieves' Guild says the trolls stole its gold. Hobstadt, the Troll King, sits at the bottom of the troll holes."
msgstr "盗贼公会说巨魔偷走了他们的金子。巨魔之王霍布施塔特坐镇在巨魔洞穴的最深处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:108
msgid ""
"Xenoc the Wizard and Morgana the Sorceress have seized Sandcaster's guilds. Astra the Good Sorceress wants them defeated."
msgstr "巫师克塞诺克和女巫摩根娜夺取了沙堡镇的各个公会。善良的女巫阿斯特拉希望打败他们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:109
msgid ""
"Caleb the Inventor at the Crossroads can't work without his magnifying glass. He saw gargoyles loitering by his tent."
msgstr "十字路口的发明家凯莱布没有放大镜就无法工作。他看到石像鬼在他的帐篷旁闲逛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:11
msgid ""
"You own the ruins of Newcastle. Emerson, the King's engineer at Castle Burlock, builds castles for King's Megacredits."
msgstr "你拥有纽卡斯尔的废墟。伯洛克城堡里国王的工程师爱默生用国王巨额币建造城堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:110
msgid ""
"You told Gurodel you want his hall. The giants are at war with you; two Energy Disks are said to lie on his throne."
msgstr "你告诉古罗德尔你想要他的大厅。巨人与你开战；据说两个能量盘就放在他的王座上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:111
msgid ""
"Bosco the Dwarf King wants the Chalice of Protection from the Voweless Knights' Northern Tower. The tower door is never locked; the knights fear nobody who cannot spell."
msgstr "矮人之王博斯科想要无元音骑士北塔里的守护圣杯。塔门从不上锁；骑士们不怕任何不会拼写的人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:112
msgid ""
"The Jewel of Ages was stolen from Thaddeus's fountain, and its waters turned to venom. Find the jewel."
msgstr "时代之宝从萨迪厄斯的喷泉中被偷走了，泉水变成了毒液。去找回那颗宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:113
msgid ""
"Thieves stole the Jewel of Ages and Luna's statuettes. Thaddeus gave you the key of their den, the Great Southern Tower."
msgstr "盗贼偷走了时代之宝和露娜的小雕像。萨迪厄斯给了你他们巢穴的钥匙，那是大南塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:114
msgid ""
"Luna the Druid's three golden statuettes were stolen from her altar: the Pegasus, the Dragon and the Griffin."
msgstr "德鲁伊露娜的三尊金色小雕像从她的祭坛上被偷走了：飞马、巨龙和狮鹫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:115
msgid "Ector the Woodsman lost his ring in a woodpile on Magic Mountain."
msgstr "樵夫埃克托把戒指丢在了魔法山的一堆木柴里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:116
msgid ""
"The coven rules Lakeside. Naomi, in the stocks on the square, wants the prisoners in its cells freed and the coven broken."
msgstr "女巫团统治着湖畔镇。广场枷锁里的娜奥米希望释放牢里的囚犯，并摧毁女巫团。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:117
msgid ""
"Sandro the Lich cannot die while his heart lies somewhere in the Necropolis Sewer."
msgstr "巫妖桑德罗死不了，因为他的心脏就在亡灵之城下水道的某处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:118
msgid ""
"You returned Sandro's heart. He is released, and his key opens the Dungeon of Death on the other side of the world."
msgstr "你把桑德罗的心脏还给了他。他得到解脱，他的钥匙能打开世界另一端的死亡地牢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:119
msgid ""
"Alister the Druid, in the Dragon Tower on Mount Firestone, wants a dragon egg from the tower's nest."
msgstr "火石山龙塔里的德鲁伊艾利斯特想要塔中巢穴里的一枚龙蛋。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:12
msgid "Emerson will build Newcastle's walls for 5 King's Megacredits."
msgstr "爱默生愿以5枚国王巨额币为纽卡斯尔修筑城墙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:120
msgid ""
"Sandro's key has opened his old home under the Dragon Tower, the Dungeon of Death. Something down there is still running."
msgstr "桑德罗的钥匙打开了他在龙塔下的旧居，也就是死亡地牢。下面仍有东西在运转。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:121
msgid ""
"Dimitri asks you to finish the liches locked in Castle Kalindra's dungeon. The guard never could."
msgstr "季米特里请你消灭关在卡琳德拉城堡地牢里的巫妖。卫兵一直没能做到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:122
msgid ""
"Shinobu, in the Ninja Pagoda's cellar, will make your Initiates Ninja once Queen Kalindra's walls are rising."
msgstr "忍者宝塔地窖里的忍丸，在卡琳德拉女王的城墙开始修建后，会把你的修士转职为忍者。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:123
msgid "The orcs took Oslo's son Tam to their caves in the north-east hills."
msgstr "兽人把奥斯陆的儿子塔姆抓到了东北山丘的洞穴里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:13
msgid ""
"Newcastle has walls. Ebenezer, at the site, has something the workers found."
msgstr "纽卡斯尔有城墙了。工地上的埃比尼泽手里有工人们发现的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:14
msgid ""
"Ebenezer's workers say the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors in the lagoon is full of Megacredits."
msgstr "埃比尼泽的工人说，泻湖里的千重恐怖之墓里堆满了巨额币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:15
msgid ""
"Megacredits lie in three evil places: the Temple of Yak, the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors and the Golem Dungeon."
msgstr "巨额币藏在三处邪恶之地：牦牛神庙、千重恐怖之墓和魔像地牢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:16
msgid "Emerson will build Newcastle's keep for 5 more Megacredits."
msgstr "爱默生愿再收5枚巨额币，为纽卡斯尔修建主堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:17
msgid "Newcastle has a keep. Ebenezer has news from his workers."
msgstr "纽卡斯尔有主堡了。埃比尼泽带来了工人们的消息。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:18
msgid ""
"Ebenezer's workers say the Golem Dungeon in the tundra, by the lagoon, is full of Megacredits."
msgstr "埃比尼泽的工人说，泻湖边冻原上的魔像地牢里堆满了巨额币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:19
msgid ""
"Darzog's tower opens to a Skeleton Key kept in the Archmage's study atop the Tower of High Magic. A talking skull in the Cave of Illusion sells the study's key for ten gems."
msgstr "达佐格之塔需要用万能钥匙开启，钥匙存放在高等魔法之塔顶层大法师的书房里。幻象洞穴里一个会说话的骷髅以十颗宝石出售书房的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:20
msgid ""
"A talking skull in the Cave of Illusion sold you the Enchanted Key to the Archmage's study atop the Tower of High Magic, in the lagoon."
msgstr "幻象洞穴里一个会说话的骷髅卖给了你通往大法师书房的魔法钥匙，书房位于泻湖中高等魔法之塔的顶层。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:21
msgid ""
"The Skeleton Key from the Tower of High Magic opens Darzog's Tower on Lake Darzog's island."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔里的万能钥匙可以打开达佐格湖岛上的达佐格之塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:22
msgid ""
"Castleview admits no strangers. Justine the Thief sells passes outside the gate, or the Mayor might let in whoever deals with his gremlins."
msgstr "堡景镇不接纳陌生人。盗贼贾斯汀在城门外出售通行证，或者镇长也许会放驱除了地精的人入城。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:23
msgid ""
"Zelda gave you a glowing orb she found in a crater. Madame Oorla the gypsy reads such things."
msgstr "泽尔达送给你一颗她在陨石坑里找到的发光宝珠。吉普赛人乌拉夫人能解读这类东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:24
msgid ""
"Madame Oorla: the orb belongs to the Dragon Pharaoh, but first it must see Ellinger, the Queen's wizard, in his tower in Castleview."
msgstr "乌拉夫人：这颗宝珠属于龙法老，但必须先让它去见女王的巫师埃林格，他住在堡景镇的塔里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:25
msgid ""
"The sewer rats under Castleview took Nadia's onyx necklace. She will pay for it."
msgstr "堡景镇下水道的老鼠偷走了娜迪亚的玛瑙项链。她愿意出钱赎回。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:26
msgid ""
"Ellinger, the Queen's wizard: the key to the Dragon Pharaoh's pyramid is in Castle Kalindra, which Alamar moved out of phase. Twenty Energy Disks bring it back, five at a time; Ellinger takes them."
msgstr "女王的巫师埃林格说：龙法老金字塔的钥匙在卡琳德拉城堡里，而阿拉玛把它移出了相位。二十个能量盘可以把它带回来，每次五个，埃林格负责收取。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:27
msgid ""
"Energy disks: the gremlins, the sprites, the ogres, the four towers, the Temple of Bark and Kalindra's own safes hold them. Ellinger takes them five at a time."
msgstr "能量盘：地精、精灵、食人妖、四座塔、树皮神殿以及卡琳德拉自己的保险柜里都有。埃林格每次收取五个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:28
msgid ""
"Five disks brought Castle Kalindra's gate and first floor back into the world."
msgstr "五个能量盘让卡琳德拉城堡的大门和一楼回到了现世。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:29
msgid ""
"Ten disks: Castle Kalindra's second floor is back. Someone up there is very sad."
msgstr "十个能量盘：卡琳德拉城堡的二楼回来了。楼上有人非常悲伤。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:3
msgid "Mayor Gunther wants Vertigo rid of its slimes and doom bugs."
msgstr "冈瑟镇长希望弗蒂戈镇清除史莱姆和厄运虫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:30
msgid ""
"Megan's father Dimitri, captain of the Queen's guard, has lost all hope. The Songbird of Serenity, caged in the Dungeon of Lost Souls on the lake isle, could lift it."
msgstr "梅根的父亲季米特里是女王卫队的队长，已经万念俱灰。关在湖心岛失魂地牢里的宁静之歌鸟也许能让他振作起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:31
msgid ""
"Crodo is free. The man at the King's side is Lord Xeen; only the sword under Newcastle can kill him, and Artemus can grant the leave to dig."
msgstr "克罗多自由了。国王身边的那个人是辛恩领主；只有纽卡斯尔地下的那把剑能杀死他，而阿尔忒弥斯可以批准你前去挖掘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:32
msgid ""
"Artemus granted an Excavation Permit for Newcastle's dungeon. Emerson digs for five more Megacredits."
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯颁发了纽卡斯尔地牢的挖掘许可。爱默生再收5枚巨额币便可动工挖掘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:33
msgid ""
"The sword that can kill Lord Xeen lies in a vault under Newcastle. Its door wants a word."
msgstr "能杀死辛恩领主的剑藏在纽卡斯尔地下的一座密室里。密室的门需要一个口令。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:34
msgid ""
"You have the Xeen Slayer Sword. Lord Xeen's hideout is in the clouds above Darzog's tower."
msgstr "你得到了辛恩斩杀之剑。辛恩领主的藏身处就在达佐格之塔上方的云端。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:35
msgid ""
"Dimitri is himself again. The Queen is Count Blackfang's prisoner and a vampire; only her crown can cure her. Ambrose, the Queen's Knight, has a way into Castle Blackfang."
msgstr "季米特里恢复了原样。女王是布莱克方伯爵的囚徒，已变成吸血鬼；只有她的王冠能治好她。女王的骑士安布罗斯知道进入布莱克方城堡的办法。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:36
msgid ""
"Dimitri sends you to Ambrose, the Queen's Knight, at Griffin Pass on the south edge of the Forbidden Zone."
msgstr "季米特里让你去找女王的骑士安布罗斯，他在禁区南缘的狮鹫关隘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:37
msgid ""
"Ambrose's griffin will not bear a plain bridle. Natasha the Enchantress, in Sandcaster, enchants things for a fee."
msgstr "安布罗斯的狮鹫不肯戴普通的缰绳。沙堡镇的女附魔师娜塔莎收费为物品附魔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:38
msgid "Natasha enchanted the bridle. Ambrose waits at Griffin Pass."
msgstr "娜塔莎为缰绳附了魔。安布罗斯正在狮鹫关隘等你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:39
msgid ""
"Ambrose's griffin will carry you onto the walls of Castle Blackfang, on Lakeside's north shore."
msgstr "安布罗斯的狮鹫会载你飞上布莱克方城堡的城墙，城堡位于湖畔镇的北岸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:4
msgid "A message in a bottle: \"Help! I'm in Darzog's tower!--Crodo\""
msgstr "瓶中信：“救命！我被困在达佐格的塔里！——克罗多”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:40
msgid ""
"Fifteen disks: Castle Kalindra's dungeon is back, with whoever was locked in it."
msgstr "十五个能量盘：卡琳德拉城堡的地牢回来了，连同被关在里面的那些人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:41
msgid ""
"Twenty disks: Castle Kalindra is whole again, and the Darkside's mirrors wake."
msgstr "二十个能量盘：卡琳德拉城堡完整如初，暗面的魔镜苏醒了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:42
msgid ""
"Queen Kalindra is herself again and home. The key to the Great Pyramid is yours; the Dragon Pharaoh is waiting for his orb."
msgstr "卡琳德拉女王恢复了原样，回到了家中。大金字塔的钥匙归你了；龙法老正在等他的宝珠。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:43
msgid ""
"The Queen is a vampire in Castle Blackfang's dungeon. Her crown, in her bedroom safe at Castle Kalindra (3-31-62), can cure her."
msgstr "女王是布莱克方城堡地牢里的吸血鬼。她的王冠放在卡琳德拉城堡她卧室的保险柜里（3-31-62），可以治好她。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:44
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh waits for his orb at the top of the Great Pyramid, in the Desert of Doom."
msgstr "龙法老在沙漠末日之地大金字塔的顶端等着他的宝珠。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:45
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh has his orb. Alamar is Sheltem, a rogue guardian. The Pharaoh has cooled the lava round the second meteor in the Forbidden Zone."
msgstr "龙法老拿回了他的宝珠。阿拉玛就是谢尔特姆，一个叛变的守护者。法老已将禁区第二颗陨石周围的熔岩冷却。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:46
msgid ""
"Something fell into the lava of the Forbidden Zone long ago. The Pharaoh has cooled it. He says to be polite to whoever wakes."
msgstr "很久以前有东西落入了禁区的熔岩中。法老已将其冷却。他说，无论是谁醒来，都要以礼相待。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:47
msgid ""
"Corak, the Ancients' guardian, is awake in his pod. He must hide from Sheltem's senses before he can face him."
msgstr "古人的守护者柯拉克已在他的舱中苏醒。他必须先躲过谢尔特姆的感应，才能面对他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:48
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh named you the Chosen Ones. Lucio's celestial boats sail to Olympus, where the Ancients kept a Soul Box."
msgstr "龙法老称你们为天选之人。卢西奥的天空之船驶往奥林匹斯，古人在那里保存着一个灵魂盒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:49
msgid ""
"The only Soul Box left on Xeen is in Soul Storage, in Olympus. Corak needs it to hide from Sheltem."
msgstr "辛恩上仅存的灵魂盒在奥林匹斯的灵魂存放处里。柯拉克需要它来躲避谢尔特姆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:5
msgid ""
"A drunk in Lady Geraldine's Tavern says Joe the Exterminator breeds the pests in his warehouse."
msgstr "贝杰拉丁夫人酒馆里的一个醉汉说，灭虫师乔在自己的仓库里饲养害虫。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:50
msgid ""
"You have the Soul Box. Take it to Corak in his pod in the Forbidden Zone."
msgstr "你拿到了灵魂盒。把它带给禁区里舱中的柯拉克。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:51
msgid ""
"Corak is hiding in the Soul Box. Take him to Sheltem's lair, Castle Alamar, and open the box there."
msgstr "柯拉克藏进了灵魂盒。把他带到谢尔特姆的巢穴阿拉玛城堡，在那里打开盒子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:52
msgid ""
"Corak has destroyed Sheltem with his castle. You carry the Cube of Power, and Darkside's sun is whole again."
msgstr "柯拉克用他的城堡摧毁了谢尔特姆。你带着力量魔方，暗面的太阳重新完整了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:53
msgid ""
"No one may enter Castle Xeen without a cupie doll. Slick the Gamemaster's four games each win one."
msgstr "没有丘比娃娃，任何人都不得进入辛恩城堡。游戏大师斯利克的四个游戏，每个都能赢得一个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:54
msgid ""
"You have a genuine Lord Xeen cupie doll. Castle Xeen's gate will let you in."
msgstr "你有了一个货真价实的辛恩领主丘比娃娃。辛恩城堡的大门会放你进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:55
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen holds his castle on the clouds. Only the Xeen Slayer Sword can harm him."
msgstr "辛恩领主把城堡建在云端。只有辛恩斩杀之剑能伤到他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:56
msgid ""
"Lord Xeen is dead and his Scepter is yours. The Sixth Mirror shattered with him. Tell King Burlock."
msgstr "辛恩领主死了，他的权杖归你了。第六面魔镜随他一同粉碎。去告诉伯洛克国王。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:57
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh's last task: wake the Reflectors and the four Sleepers, free Prince Roland, and bring the Cube and the Scepter to his shrine on the cloud above Darkstone Tower."
msgstr "龙法老的最后一项任务：唤醒反射器和四位沉睡者，解救罗兰王子，并把魔方和权杖带到暗石塔上方云端的他的神龛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:58
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Air Reflector at the north-west corner of the Desert of the Sphinx turned on."
msgstr "龙法老希望打开斯芬克斯沙漠西北角的空气反射器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:59
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Fire Reflector at the north-east corner of Mount Firestone turned on."
msgstr "龙法老希望打开火石山东北角的火焰反射器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:6
msgid "The dwarf mines are still being over-run. Please help them."
msgstr "矮人矿坑仍在遭受侵袭。请帮帮他们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:60
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Earth Reflector at the south-west corner of Winterkill Tundra turned on."
msgstr "龙法老希望打开冬杀冻原西南角的大地反射器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:61
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Water Reflector at the south-east corner of Vertigo Meadows turned on."
msgstr "龙法老希望打开弗蒂戈草甸东南角的水之反射器。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:62
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Fire Sleeper woken on the Plane of Fire, below the Skyroads' north-west corner."
msgstr "龙法老希望唤醒火之位面上的火焰沉睡者，它位于天路西北角的下方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:63
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Air Sleeper woken on the Plane of Air, below the Skyroads' north-east corner."
msgstr "龙法老希望唤醒空气位面上的空气沉睡者，它位于天路东北角的下方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:64
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Earth Sleeper woken on the Plane of Earth, below the Skyroads' south-east corner."
msgstr "龙法老希望唤醒大地位面上的大地沉睡者，它位于天路东南角的下方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:65
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh wants the Water Sleeper woken on the Plane of Water, below the Skyroads' south-west corner."
msgstr "龙法老希望唤醒水之位面上的水之沉睡者，它位于天路西南角的下方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:66
msgid ""
"Prince Roland is free and home with his brother. He gave you the Amulet of the Southern Sphinx: the key to the cloud above Darkstone Tower lies in the Southern Sphinx."
msgstr "罗兰王子自由了，已和他的兄弟回到家中。他给了你南方斯芬克斯护身符：暗石塔上方云端的钥匙就在南方斯芬克斯里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:67
msgid ""
"Picard the Aged traded you the Chime of Opening for Halon's widget. It breaks the seal on Darkstone Tower's roof."
msgstr "年迈的皮卡德用开启编钟与你交换了哈隆的小玩意。它能打破暗石塔屋顶的封印。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:68
msgid ""
"The seal on Darkstone Tower's roof is broken. The Clouds of the Ancients are above it."
msgstr "暗石塔屋顶的封印已被打破。古人之云就在它的上方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:69
msgid ""
"The four druids of the seasons pass the year from hand to hand: the Last Flower, Leaf, Snowflake and Raindrop."
msgstr "四季的四位德鲁伊把一年传来传去：最后一朵花、最后一片叶、最后一片雪花和最后一滴雨。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:7
msgid ""
"Old Valia of Toad Meadow wants the witches destroyed and the Alacorn of Falista brought back."
msgstr "蟾蜍草地的老瓦莉娅希望消灭女巫，并把法利斯塔的阿拉科恩带回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:70
msgid ""
"The sorceresses of Rivercity stole Barok's pendant. Barok wants it back."
msgstr "河城的女巫偷走了巴洛克的吊坠。巴洛克想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:71
msgid ""
"Princess Roxanne's tiara was stolen by the Rivercity robbers, who hide under the bridge."
msgstr "罗珊公主的冠冕被藏身桥下的河城强盗偷走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:72
msgid ""
"The Ninja clan drove Kai Wu the monk from his pagoda, due south of his monastery in the tundra. Rid it of them."
msgstr "忍者一族把僧人凯武赶出了他的宝塔，宝塔位于冻原上他的寺院正南方。把他们清除掉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:73
msgid ""
"The people of Asp are turning into snakes. Adam and Eve say the stones round the well know how to stop it."
msgstr "毒蛇镇的人们正在变成蛇。亚当和夏娃说，水井周围的石头知道如何阻止这一切。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:74
msgid ""
"A curse brought the dead of Winterkill back to haunt it. Mayor Randon wants them driven out."
msgstr "一个诅咒让冬杀镇的死者回来作祟。兰登镇长希望把它们赶走。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:75
msgid ""
"Nightshadow's signs say: set the dials, open the Count's coffin, and bid him farewell."
msgstr "夜影镇的标识写着：拨好转盘，打开伯爵的棺材，向他道别。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:76
msgid ""
"The wizards of Castle Basenji killed Arie's master. She wants his Scroll of Insight back."
msgstr "巴森吉城堡的巫师杀死了阿莉的主人。她想要拿回他的洞察卷轴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:77
msgid ""
"Arie gave you the Jewelled Amulet of the Northern Sphinx. It opens the Sphinx in the desert."
msgstr "阿莉给了你北方斯芬克斯的镶宝护身符。它能打开沙漠中的斯芬克斯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:78
msgid "The Northern Sphinx's door opened. The Sphinx asks its own name."
msgstr "北方斯芬克斯的门开了。斯芬克斯问你它自己的名字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:79
msgid ""
"Gargoyles stole Carlawna's Scarab of Imaging and carried it to their eyrie on the Gargoyle Range."
msgstr "石像鬼偷走了卡拉娜的成像圣甲虫，带回了石像鬼山脉上的巢穴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:8
msgid ""
"King Burlock wants the Sixth Mirror, last seen near the great volcano. He offers an earldom."
msgstr "伯洛克国王想要第六面魔镜，据说最后一次出现在大火山附近。他许诺封你为伯爵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:80
msgid ""
"Falagar the Wizard's Crystals of Piezoelectricity were taken. He thinks they power a machine under Asp."
msgstr "巫师法拉加的压电水晶被人偷走了。他认为它们为毒蛇镇地下的一台机器提供动力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:81
msgid ""
"Mirabeth wants the Elixir of Restoration from the Temple of Yak, in Rivercity's southern woods."
msgstr "米拉贝丝想要河城南面树林里牦牛神庙的复原灵药。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:82
msgid ""
"Medin the Fisherman says lake beasts are eating all the fish in Lake Darzog."
msgstr "渔夫梅丁说，湖中怪兽正在吃光达佐格湖里所有的鱼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:83
msgid ""
"Halon the Efficient's water clock freezes every winter. He wants magical lava from Mount Firestone."
msgstr "高效者哈隆的水钟每到冬天就会冻住。他想要火石山的魔法熔岩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:84
msgid ""
"The trolls gnaw Thickbark's bark and uproot saplings. The trees of the Troll Forest want them dead."
msgstr "巨魔啃咬厚树皮的树皮，还拔起树苗。巨魔森林的树木想要它们的命。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:85
msgid ""
"Cyclopes have built an outpost in the Land of the Giants and eat any gnome they catch. Glom wants it burnt."
msgstr "独眼巨人在巨人之地建了一座前哨站，抓到侏儒就吃。格洛姆想把它烧掉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:86
msgid ""
"Crazed sprites stole Danulf the Faery King's Wand of Faery Magic. They nest in the south woods."
msgstr "疯狂的精灵偷走了精灵王达努夫的精灵魔法杖。它们在南面的树林里筑巢。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:87
msgid ""
"Tito the Elf Priest dropped the Holy Book of Elvenkind in the Troll Forest when he was ambushed."
msgstr "精灵牧师蒂托遭到伏击时，把精灵圣书掉在了巨魔森林里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:88
msgid ""
"Ligono the Spirit is trapped in the surf. His skull lies near the edge of the world, to the south."
msgstr "灵魂利戈诺被困在浪涛中。他的头骨在南边世界的尽头附近。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:89
msgid ""
"Orothin the Hermit lost his bone whistle somewhere in Pitchfork Creek."
msgstr "隐士奥罗辛把他的骨哨丢在了干草叉溪的某个地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:9
msgid ""
"Artemus says Crodo, the King's old friend, vanished with Baron Darzog. Darzog's island tower has been sealed since."
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯说，国王的老友克罗多与达佐格男爵一同失踪了。自那以后，达佐格的岛上之塔便一直被封死。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:90
msgid ""
"Myra the Herbalist gives five potions for every Phirna root from Toad Meadow."
msgstr "草药师米拉每收到一株蟾蜍草地的菲尔娜根，就给五瓶药水。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:91
msgid ""
"Derek the Ranger's bride Celia was carried off by zombies into the Forest of the Walking Dead."
msgstr "游侠德里克的新娘西莉亚被僵尸掳进了行尸森林。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:92
msgid ""
"Ogres throw boulders at the boats around Rivercity. Captain Nystor wants them gone."
msgstr "食人妖向河城周围的船只投掷巨石。尼斯特船长希望除掉它们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:93
msgid ""
"Joe is on the Darkside, selling treasure maps. Jethro the mapmaker would like a look at one."
msgstr "乔在暗面贩卖藏宝图。制图师杰思罗想看看其中的一张。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:94
msgid ""
"Scaldrith, at the Dragon Tax Office in the Dragon Cave's mouth, wants 2,000 gold and 20 gems before the Dragon King will see you."
msgstr "斯卡尔德里斯在龙洞口的龙税办公室，要2,000金币和20颗宝石，龙王才会见你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:95
msgid ""
"Gremlins are sabotaging Castleview. Mayor Snarfblad pays to end it; their king Gettlewaithe holds court outside the walls."
msgstr "地精正在破坏堡景镇。斯纳夫布莱德镇长出钱要平息此事；他们的国王格特尔韦特在城墙外设朝。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:96
msgid ""
"Jethro's brother Jasper is in Castleview Jail, framed by Joe the map seller. Jethro wants him out."
msgstr "杰思罗的弟弟贾斯珀被乔这个卖地图的陷害，关在堡景镇监狱里。杰思罗希望救他出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:97
msgid ""
"The Drawkcab monks of Castleview teach in order, one lesson each. Brother Reger, outside the walls, asks for the word at the end."
msgstr "堡景镇的反向僧侣按次序教导，每人传授一课。城墙外的雷格修士在最后询问那个口令。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:98
msgid ""
"Dyson the puzzlemaster dares you to close every chest in Castleview's Public Storage, in the right order."
msgstr "谜题大师戴森向你挑战：按正确的顺序关上堡景镇公共仓库里的每一只箱子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/quests.txt:99
msgid ""
"Valio, who lives in the Castleview Sewer, wants Rooka the Queen Rat dead."
msgstr "住在堡景镇下水道的瓦利奥想要鼠后鲁卡死。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:10
msgid ""
"A tomb half sunk in the lagoon. Insanity is its fame, they say, and undead its game."
msgstr "半沉在潟湖里的一座坟墓。据说它以疯狂闻名，里面的游戏是亡灵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:11
msgid "A stone door in the tundra. Something heavy walks about inside."
msgstr "冻原上的一扇石门。里面有什么沉重的东西在走动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:12
msgid "The Cave of Illusion. It may or may not be there."
msgstr "幻象洞穴。它也许在，也许不在。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:13
msgid ""
"The Tower of High Magic. Where the lock should be there is only a faint shimmer."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔。本该是锁的地方，只有一缕微弱的微光。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:14
msgid ""
"Darzog's Tower. The door is black iron without a handle, and a keyhole shaped like a skull."
msgstr "达佐格之塔。门是没有把手的黑铁门，锁孔的形状像个骷髅头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:15
msgid ""
"A stair down into the foundations of Newcastle. Your foundations, now."
msgstr "一道通往纽卡斯尔地基的阶梯。现在，那也是你的地基了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:16
msgid ""
"Black oak doors under a pointed arch. Somewhere inside, a dog howls, then a man. Castle Basenji."
msgstr "尖拱下的黑橡木大门。里面某处，先是一只狗在嚎叫，接着是一个人。巴森吉城堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:17
msgid ""
"A door of sandstone between two paws the size of houses. The Sphinx asks its own name."
msgstr "两只房子般大的巨爪之间，立着一扇砂岩门。狮身人面像在问它自己的名字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:18
msgid ""
"A cave mouth breathing heat between a demon and a devil carved in black rock."
msgstr "一个洞口，在黑岩雕成的恶魔与魔鬼之间喷出热气。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:19
msgid ""
"Cool air and a smell of grass come up through the cleft, from a valley that should not be there."
msgstr "凉风夹着青草的气息，从裂缝里涌上来，来自一个本不该存在的山谷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:20
msgid ""
"Scorched rock, gnawed bones, and a smell of sulphur. The Dragon Cave smells pretty bad. Are you sure you wish to enter?"
msgstr "焦黑的岩石、啃过的骨头，还有硫磺味。龙洞闻起来相当糟糕。你确定要进去吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:21
msgid "Castle Xeen, sitting on its cloud as if it owned the sky. It does."
msgstr "辛恩城堡，端坐在它的云上，好像天空是它的。其实就是它的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:22
msgid ""
"An iron-bound gate cut into the cliff. Beyond it a crowd roars, and something roars back."
msgstr "悬崖上嵌着一扇铁箍大门。门后人群在咆哮，还有什么东西咆哮着回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:23
msgid ""
"A hidden door in the riverbank. Hidden, apart from the well-trodden path to it."
msgstr "河岸上的一扇暗门。说是暗门，却有一条被踩得很实的小路通到它跟前。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:24
msgid ""
"A pagoda in the snow, dark and silent. Nobody is watching you, very carefully."
msgstr "雪地里的一座宝塔，漆黑而寂静。没有人在看着你，而且看得非常仔细。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:25
msgid ""
"Frozen hides hang across a hole in the snow. Behind them, something snores."
msgstr "冻硬的兽皮挂在雪地里的一个洞口。皮后面，有什么东西在打呼噜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:26
msgid ""
"Count Draco's coffin, open. There are steps where the Count should be."
msgstr "德拉科伯爵的棺材，是开着的。本该躺着伯爵的地方，是一道台阶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:27
msgid "A stair under Asp, worn smooth by feet that no longer come back up."
msgstr "毒蛇镇下的一道阶梯，被脚步磨得光滑，而那些脚再也没有走回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:28
msgid ""
"The way up to the Gargoyle Eyrie. The statues on the ledges are all facing your way."
msgstr "通往石像鬼巢穴的路。崖壁上的雕像，全都面朝着你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:29
msgid ""
"A cave with a boulder rolled aside for a door. Ogres expect no visitors they cannot eat."
msgstr "一个洞穴，用一块滚到一边的巨石当门。食人妖不指望来访者，除非是吃不到的那种。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:3
msgid ""
"A warehouse with a sign on the door: KEEP OUT. THIS MEANS YOU, GUNTHER."
msgstr "一间仓库，门上挂着牌子：禁止入内。说的就是你，冈瑟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:30
msgid ""
"An iron hatch over Castleview's sewer. The smell comes up to meet you."
msgstr "堡景镇下水道上的一块铁盖。臭味迎面扑来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:31
msgid "Ellinger's Tower. A sign under the knocker reads: \"Not now.\""
msgstr "埃林格之塔。门环下的牌子写着：“现在不行。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:32
msgid "Castle Kalindra, back in phase and solid to the touch. Mostly."
msgstr "卡琳德拉城堡，又回到了现实，摸上去很实在。大部分是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:34
msgid ""
"The Western Tower, warded from both sides. The heretics inside like it that way."
msgstr "西塔，两边都设了防护。里面的异端们就喜欢这样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:35
msgid ""
"A rope hangs from a window near the tower's top. Nobody looks out of the arrow slits."
msgstr "一根绳子从塔顶附近的窗口垂下来。箭孔后面没有人探头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:36
msgid ""
"A brass plate on the door reads NO THIEVES. Under it, scratched: 'ha'."
msgstr "门上的黄铜牌写着“禁止盗贼”。下面有人刻了一句：“哈”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:37
msgid "The Great Eastern Tower. Its lock looks very smug about something."
msgstr "大东塔。它的锁看上去对什么事得意得很。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:38
msgid "The Northern Tower. Over the door: \"Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts\"."
msgstr "北塔。门上写着：“Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:39
msgid "A door in the trunk of the great tree: the Ancient Temple of Bark."
msgstr "巨树树干上的一扇门：树皮古庙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:4
msgid ""
"A dwarf adit propped with red-painted timbers. Somewhere below, a pick rings on stone and a dwarf swears."
msgstr "一条矮人的矿道，用红漆的木头撑着。下面某处，镐头敲在石头上叮当响，一个矮人在骂街。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:40 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:42
msgid "A timbered adit into the mountain."
msgstr "通向山里的一条木架矿道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:43
msgid ""
"Troll Hole. A rough shaft into the dark, with claw marks for a ladder."
msgstr "巨魔洞。一条粗糙的竖井通向黑暗，用爪痕当梯子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:45
msgid "as row 41"
msgstr ""

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:46
msgid ""
"The ruined tower on the Isle of Lost Souls. Two iron-bound leaves, and stairs going down."
msgstr "迷魂岛上的废塔。两扇铁箍门扇，还有向下的台阶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:47
msgid ""
"Graalg's fort: a stockade of whole tree trunks, sharpened at both ends."
msgstr "格拉尔格的堡寨：用整根树干围成的栅栏，两头都削尖了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:49
msgid ""
"The Great Pyramid. A door of green stone with the Pharaoh's sign on it."
msgstr "大金字塔。一扇绿石门，上面刻着法老的印记。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:50
msgid ""
"A strange craft of curved metal standing in cooled lava. Its hatch is open, as if it had been waiting."
msgstr "一艘弧形金属的奇怪飞行器，立在冷却的熔岩中。它的舱门开着，像是一直在等你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:51
msgid ""
"Castle Alamar. Every window is lit, and every one of them is looking at you."
msgstr "阿拉玛城堡。每扇窗都亮着灯，每一扇窗都在看着你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:52
msgid ""
"A hatch in the castle roof. Scratched on it: The Megadragon has the key!"
msgstr "城堡屋顶上的一个舱口。上面刻着：巨龙拿着钥匙！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:53
msgid ""
"An iron lid over Sandcaster's sewer. The sand has got in, as it gets into everything here."
msgstr "沙堡镇下水道上的一块铁盖。沙子已经钻了进去，就像它钻进这里的一切东西一样。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:54
msgid ""
"An iron grate in the sand, bolted on this side. Beyond it runs a long tunnel."
msgstr "沙地里的一道铁栅栏，在这一侧上了闩。栅栏后面是一条长长的隧道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:55
msgid ""
"The guild gate. Beyond it, the wizard quarter, and wizards who are sensitive to insults."
msgstr "行会大门。门后是巫师区，里面的巫师受不得侮辱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:56
msgid "The guild's back stair, down to the cellars. Members only."
msgstr "行会的后楼梯，通向地窖。仅限会员。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:57
msgid "A grated shaft down into Lakeside's sewer."
msgstr "通往湖畔镇下水道的一个带栅栏的竖井。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:58
msgid ""
"A crypt stair going down. The draught from below smells of drains and old graves."
msgstr "一道向下的墓穴阶梯。下面吹来的风，带着下水道和老坟的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:59
msgid ""
"A second strange craft, cold to the touch. Its hatch opens on a red-lit airlock."
msgstr "第二艘奇怪的飞行器，摸上去冰凉。它的舱门通向一间红光照着的气闸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:6
msgid ""
"A crooked tower on its rise. The witches fear nothing, and lock nothing. Something inside is bubbling."
msgstr "一座建在小山上的歪塔。女巫们什么都不怕，所以什么也不锁。里面有什么东西在冒泡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:60
msgid ""
"A cave in the crag, its mouth white with droppings. Something up there is watching, very still."
msgstr "峭壁上的一个洞穴，洞口被鸟粪染白。上面有什么东西在盯着你，一动不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:61
msgid ""
"Doors three times your height, with a handle you can reach by standing on each other."
msgstr "三倍于你身高的大门，把手要踩着彼此的肩膀才够得着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:62
msgid ""
"Bosco's Hall. The door stands open; Bosco is expecting company, or not worried about it."
msgstr "博斯科大厅。门开着；博斯科在等客人，或者根本不在乎。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:63
msgid "A marble grate in the road of the gods. Even their sewer is marble."
msgstr "众神之路上的一块大理石栅栏。连他们的下水道都是大理石的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:64
msgid "A stair down under the ruin, where Sheltem's mark has gone out."
msgstr "废墟下的一道阶梯，谢尔特姆的印记已经熄灭。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:65
msgid "The Sphinx's stone jaw stands open on a stair."
msgstr "狮身人面像的石颚张开着，露出一道阶梯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:66
msgid "A tower of black stone, polished like a mirror."
msgstr "一座黑石塔，被打磨得像镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:67
msgid ""
"The Dragon Tower. Two black leaves, warm to the touch, with a keyhole shaped like a dragon's eye."
msgstr "巨龙塔。两扇黑色的门扇，摸上去是温的，锁孔的形状像龙的眼睛。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:7
msgid ""
"A cave mouth reeking of smoke and orc. The bones outside are not all animal."
msgstr "一个洞口，散发着烟味和兽人的臭味。外面的骨头并不都是动物的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:8
msgid ""
"The Temple of Yak. Incense, old stone, and something underneath that the incense is there to hide."
msgstr "牦牛神庙。香火、古石，还有香火想要掩盖的、藏在底下的什么东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:9
msgid ""
"Castle Burlock, the King's seat. The banners are clean, and the guards are not smiling."
msgstr "伯洛克城堡，国王的居所。旗帜很干净，卫兵们都没有笑容。"

