msgstr "弗恩的家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:193
msgid "Mylo's Maps"
msgstr "迈洛地图店"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:195
msgid "Rialdo's Lodge"
msgstr "里亚尔多小屋"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:206
msgid "Joe's Exterminations"
msgstr "乔的灭虫服务"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid "Alacorn of Falista"
msgstr "法利斯塔的独角"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:10
msgid ""
"The horn of the unicorn Falista, stolen by the witches. Old Valia wants it back."
msgstr "独角兽法利斯塔的角，被女巫们偷走了。老瓦莉娅想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "Coven Key"
msgstr "女巫团钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:11
msgid "The key the witches of the tower carry."
msgstr "塔里的女巫们带着的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "Skeleton Key"
msgstr "万能钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:12
msgid "The key to Darzog's Tower."
msgstr "达佐格之塔的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid "Princess Roxanne's Tiara"
msgstr "罗珊公主的头冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:13
msgid ""
"Princess Roxanne's tiara, taken by the Rivercity robbers. She wants it back."
msgstr "罗珊公主的头冠，被河城的强盗拿走了。她想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "Robbers' Ring of Keys"
msgstr "强盗钥匙串"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:14
msgid "The robber boss's keys to the den's vault."
msgstr "强盗头子的钥匙，能打开巢穴的金库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid ""
"Barok the Sorcerer's pendant, stolen by the sorceresses. He wants it back."
msgstr "巫师巴洛克的吊坠，被女术士们偷走了。他想要拿回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:15
msgid "Barok's Pendant"
msgstr "巴洛克的吊坠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid "Larder Key"
msgstr "食品室钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:16
msgid "The Ogre Chieftain's key to his larder."
msgstr "食人妖酋长的食品室钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid "Elixir of Restoration"
msgstr "复原灵药"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:17
msgid "Mirabeth's cure, kept in the Temple of Yak."
msgstr "米拉贝丝的解药，存放在牦牛神庙里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:18
msgid "A King's Megacredit, worth a great deal to King Burlock's engineers."
msgstr "一枚国王的巨额币，对伯洛克国王的工程师们价值不菲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:18
msgid "King's Megacredit"
msgstr "国王巨额币"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:19
msgid "Library Key"
msgstr "图书馆钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:19
msgid "The key to Darzog's library."
msgstr "达佐格图书馆的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:193
msgid ""
"An impossibly light two-handed sword, the King's experiment, buried under Newcastle. It alone can harm Lord Xeen. (Effects: +15 Might, +15 Endurance, double damage against demons)"
msgstr "一把轻得不可思议的双手剑，是国王的实验品，埋在纽卡斯尔之下。只有它能伤到辛恩领主。（效果：+15 力量，+15 耐力，对恶魔伤害加倍）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:193
msgid "Xeen Slayer Sword"
msgstr "辛恩屠戮者之剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:194
msgid ""
"Ancient and light, it all but flies at the enemy's throat. One of the six Elder weapons; no one knows when or where they were forged. (Effects: +15 Might)"
msgstr "古老而轻盈，几乎是自己扑向敌人的咽喉。六件远古武器之一；没有人知道它们是何时何地锻造的。（效果：+15 力量）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:194
msgid "Elder Long Sword"
msgstr "远古长剑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:195
msgid ""
"A long blade with a gilded guard, one of the six Elder weapons. Its owners have all been quick, and most of them unknown. (Effects: +15 Speed)"
msgstr "一柄长刃，剑格镀金，是六件远古武器之一。它的主人都身手敏捷，而且大多数没有留下姓名。（效果：+15 速度）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:195
msgid "Elder Dagger"
msgstr "远古匕首"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:196
msgid "Elder Mace"
msgstr "远古硬头锤"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:196
msgid ""
"It looks like any cleric's mace, but it thrums in the hand. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Endurance)"
msgstr "看上去和任何牧师的硬头锤一样，但握在手里会嗡嗡作响。六件远古武器之一。（效果：+15 耐力）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:197
msgid ""
"A humourless weapon, one of the six Elder weapons. It goes missing for years and turns up in some monster's hoard. (Effects: +15 Accuracy)"
msgstr "一件不苟言笑的武器，六件远古武器之一。它一失踪就是好几年，又会在某个怪物的宝藏里冒出来。（效果：+15 准确）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:197
msgid "Elder Spear"
msgstr "远古长矛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:198
msgid "Elder Staff"
msgstr "远古法杖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:198
msgid ""
"Much more a tool than a weapon: a crystal on a golden shaft that magnifies the wielder's magic. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Intellect, +20 spell points)"
msgstr "与其说是武器，不如说是工具：金杖上嵌着一颗水晶，能放大持杖者的魔力。六件远古武器之一。（效果：+15 智力，+20 魔法值）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:199
msgid ""
"A green and gold bow of exotic woods that no bowyer can make again. One of the six Elder weapons. (Effects: +15 Accuracy)"
msgstr "一张用异木制成的绿金色弓，已经没有弓匠能再造出来。六件远古武器之一。（效果：+15 准确）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:199
msgid "Elder Long Bow"
msgstr "远古长弓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:20
msgid "Librarian's Key"
msgstr "图书管理员的钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:20
msgid "The Head Sorceress's key to the tower's library."
msgstr "女术士首领开启塔内图书馆的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:200
msgid ""
"A ring of gems set like a flower, the Summer druid's token, one of the four Seasons. (Effects: +10 Fire resistance)"
msgstr "一圈宝石排成花的样子，是夏之德鲁伊的信物，四季信物之一。（效果：+10 火系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:200
msgid "Last Flower of Summer"
msgstr "夏日最后一朵花"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:201
msgid ""
"A red and gold star on a chain, the Autumn druid's token. (Effects: +10 Earth resistance)"
msgstr "一颗红金色的星挂在链子上，是秋之德鲁伊的信物。（效果：+10 土系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:201
msgid "Leaf of Autumn"
msgstr "秋之叶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:202
msgid ""
"A belt set with ice-blue stones, the Winter druid's token. (Effects: +10 Water resistance)"
msgstr "一条镶着冰蓝色宝石的腰带，是冬之德鲁伊的信物。（效果：+10 水系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:202
msgid "Snowflake of Winter"
msgstr "冬之雪花"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:203
msgid ""
"A cloak the blue of a spring night, the Spring druid's token. (Effects: +10 Air resistance)"
msgstr "一件春夜般湛蓝的斗篷，是春之德鲁伊的信物。（效果：+10 风系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:203
msgid "Raindrop of Spring"
msgstr "春之雨滴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:204
msgid ""
"A copy of her tiara in gold leaf and amethysts, Princess Roxanne's thanks. (Effects: +10 Personality, +10 Intellect, +30 Mind resistance)"
msgstr "她的头冠的仿制品，用金箔和紫水晶做成，是罗珊公主的谢礼。（效果：+10 个性，+10 智力，+30 心智抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:204
msgid "Roxanne's Tiara"
msgstr "罗珊的头冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:205
msgid "Queen Kalindra's Crown"
msgstr "卡琳德拉女王的王冠"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:205
msgid ""
"The Queen's own crown, given after the wedding. Its jewels cast a reddish light on the wearer's face. (Effects: +20 Personality, +10 all resistances)"
msgstr "女王自己的王冠，是婚礼之后赠予的。宝石的光让佩戴者的脸泛着红光。（效果：+20 个性，+10 全部抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:206
msgid ""
"A ring made to rule and to endure, not inherently good or evil. Its wearer's wounds close by themselves. (Effects: +10 Might, +10 Endurance, regeneration)"
msgstr "一枚为统治与持久而造的戒指，本身无善无恶。佩戴者的伤口会自行愈合。（效果：+10 力量，+10 耐力，再生）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:206
msgid "Ector's Ring"
msgstr "埃克托之戒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:207
msgid "Holy Book of Elvenkind"
msgstr "精灵圣书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:207
msgid ""
"The elves' holy book, lost in the Troll Forest. It is not a spell book: carried, it blesses the party. (Effects: +5 Learning, +10 Spirit Magic)"
msgstr "精灵族的圣书，在巨魔森林里遗失了。它不是法术书：带在身上，能为队伍祈福。（效果：+5 学习术，+10 灵魂魔法）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:208
msgid ""
"A chalice of silver with white gold tracery. A faint, steady humming comes from its cup. Carried, it shields the party. (Effects: +10 all resistances)"
msgstr "一只银杯，带白金的花纹。杯中传来微弱而平稳的嗡鸣。带在身上，能护住队伍。（效果：+10 全部抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:208
msgid "Chalice of Protection"
msgstr "守护圣杯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:209
msgid ""
"A golden songbird, stylized and yet strangely lifelike. Its song lifts despair. (Effects: +20 Mind resistance, no fear)"
msgstr "一只金色的鸣禽，造型风格化，却又出奇地逼真。它的歌声能驱散绝望。（效果：+20 心智抗性，免疫恐惧）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:21
msgid "A great key of dark iron from the golem-makers' forge."
msgstr "魔像匠熔炉里打出的一把黑铁大钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:21
msgid "Iron Key"
msgstr "铁钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:210
msgid ""
"A flawless red jewel that pulses with a slow heartbeat, stolen from the youth-giving fountain. Carried, it keeps the party from aging. (Effects: +10 Endurance, no aging)"
msgstr "一颗无瑕的红宝石，像缓慢的心跳般搏动，取自青春之泉。带在身上，能让队伍不再衰老。（效果：+10 耐力，不衰老）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:211
msgid "Vespar's Staff"
msgstr "维斯帕的法杖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:211
msgid ""
"Vespar's staff, rehilted with its emerald handle. A reservoir of power for the wielder. (Effects: +10 Intellect, +20 Air resistance)"
msgstr "维斯帕的法杖，重新装上了翡翠柄。持杖者的力量之库。（效果：+10 智力，+20 风系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:212
msgid "Dead Paladin's Armour"
msgstr "亡故圣武士的护甲"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:212
msgid ""
"The golden plate of a paladin who died in it. It fortifies its wearer with an unnatural health. (Effects: +15 Endurance)"
msgstr "一位圣武士穿着它死去的金甲。它赋予穿戴者一种不自然的健壮。（效果：+15 耐力）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:213
msgid ""
"A wavy two-handed sword, the finest piece of the Megadragon's hoard. Its red stone is warm to the touch. (Effects: +25 Might, +20 Fire resistance)"
msgstr "一把波浪形的双手剑，是巨龙宝藏里最精美的一件。上面的红宝石摸上去是温的。（效果：+25 力量，+20 火系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:213
msgid "Wyrmfang"
msgstr "蛇龙之牙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:22
msgid "A heavy key from the fence's lockbox, cut for the strongroom door."
msgstr "从销赃人保险箱里找出来的一把沉重钥匙，是为保险库的门配的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:22
msgid "Strongroom Key"
msgstr "保险库钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:23
msgid "A bottle with a note inside."
msgstr "一只瓶子，里面有一张字条。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:23 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:15
msgid "Crodo's Bottle"
msgstr "克罗多的瓶子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:24
msgid "Mirabeth's stone. It opens the Temple of Yak."
msgstr "米拉贝丝的石头。它能打开牦牛神庙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:24
msgid "Yak Stone of Opening"
msgstr "牛神开启之石"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:25
msgid "Artemus's sigil. The old pyramids answer to it."
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯的徽记。古老的金字塔听从它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:25
msgid "Pyramid Sigil"
msgstr "金字塔徽记"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:26 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:16
msgid "Deed to Newcastle"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔地契"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:26
msgid "The deed to the ruins of Newcastle."
msgstr "纽卡斯尔废墟的地契。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:27
msgid "Stone of a Thousand Terrors"
msgstr "千重恐怖之石"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:27
msgid "The stone that opens the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors."
msgstr "能打开千重恐怖之墓的石头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:28
msgid "Golem Stone of Admittance"
msgstr "魔像准入之石"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:28
msgid "The stone that opens the Golem Dungeon."
msgstr "能打开魔像地牢的石头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:29
msgid "Enchanted Key"
msgstr "魔法钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:29
msgid "The key to the Tower of High Magic."
msgstr "高等魔法之塔的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:3
msgid "Joe's key, found under the rain barrel in his yard."
msgstr "乔的钥匙，在他院子的雨水桶下面找到的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:3
msgid "Warehouse Key"
msgstr "仓库钥匙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:30
msgid "Artemus's permit to dig under Newcastle."
msgstr "阿尔忒弥斯颁发的、在纽卡斯尔地下挖掘的许可证。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:30 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:18
msgid "Excavation Permit"
msgstr "挖掘许可证"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:31
msgid "Orothin's Bone Whistle"
msgstr "奥罗辛的骨哨"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:31
msgid "The hermit Orothin's whistle, lost in Pitchfork Creek."
msgstr "隐士奥罗辛的哨子，掉在了干草叉溪里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:32
msgid "A root from Toad Meadow. Myra the Herbalist pays for these."
msgstr "蟾蜍草地的一根草根。草药师米拉会出钱收购。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:33
msgid "Danulf the Faery King's wand, taken by the killer sprites."
msgstr "精灵王达努夫的魔杖，被杀手小精灵拿走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:33
msgid "Wand of Faery Magic"
msgstr "精灵魔法杖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:34
msgid "Ligono's Skull"
msgstr "利戈诺的头骨"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:34
msgid "The skull of Ligono, whose spirit waits in the surf."
msgstr "利戈诺的头骨，他的灵魂还在海浪里等着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:35
msgid "Carlawna's scarab, stolen by the gargoyles."
msgstr "卡拉娜的圣甲虫，被石像鬼偷走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:35
msgid "Scarab of Imaging"
msgstr "成像圣甲虫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:36
msgid "Crystals from Asp. Falagar the Wizard wants them."
msgstr "毒蛇镇的水晶。巫师法拉加想要它们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:36
msgid "Crystals of Piezoelectricity"
msgstr "压电水晶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:37
msgid "A rock from Mount Firestone that never cools."
msgstr "火石山上一块永远不会冷却的岩石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:37
msgid "Ever-Hot Lava Rock"
msgstr "永热熔岩石"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:38
msgid "Halon's widget. Someone will want it."
msgstr "哈隆的小玩意儿。总会有人想要它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:38
msgid "Widget"
msgstr "小玩意儿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:39
msgid "Arie's master's scroll, taken by the wizard cult of Castle Basenji."
msgstr "阿里的师父的卷轴，被巴森吉城堡的巫师教团拿走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:20
msgid "Scroll of Insight"
msgstr "洞察卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:4
msgid "A crumpled invoice from Joe's warehouse."
msgstr "一张皱巴巴的发货单，来自乔的仓库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:4 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/readable_items.txt:11
msgid "Joe's Invoice"
msgstr "乔的发货单"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:40
msgid "Jewelled Amulet of the Northern Sphinx"
msgstr "北方狮身人面像的珠宝护身符"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:40
msgid "The amulet the Northern Sphinx gives to those who answer it."
msgstr "北方狮身人面像送给回答出它问题的人的护身符。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:41
