msgstr "天空强盗：“站住！走这段路的过路费是 10,000 金币！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:768
msgid "Draw steel, knave!"
msgstr "拔剑吧，恶棍！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:768
msgid "Here you go"
msgstr "拿去"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:808
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Fire and Air I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr "元素商人：“我总在火与风之间来往，一个简单的谜题等你解开。我运的是什么货？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:809
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Air and Earth I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr "元素商人：“我总在风与土之间来往，一个简单的谜题等你解开。我运的是什么货？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:810
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Fire and Water I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr "元素商人：“我总在火与水之间来往，一个简单的谜题等你解开。我运的是什么货？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:811
msgid ""
"Merchant of the Elements: \"Between Water and Earth I constantly travel, a simple clue to unravel. What's my cargo?\""
msgstr "元素商人：“我总在水与土之间来往，一个简单的谜题等你解开。我运的是什么货？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:843
msgid "A disembodied voice booms, \"What's the password?\""
msgstr "一个没有形体的声音轰然响起：“口令是什么？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_common.lua:905
msgid ""
"The book is blank but for one page with the letters: \"Lt slpng dgs l\" So say the Voweless Knights. A blank line underneath awaits your answer."
