#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:44
msgid "Might and Magic"
msgstr "Might and Magic"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:485 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7711 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:47
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:49 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:54
msgid "Nuclear War"
msgstr "Nuclear War"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:486 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7717 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:67
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:72 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:74
msgid "Planets Edge"
msgstr "Planets Edge"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:480 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7723 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:77
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:82 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:84
msgid "Spaceward Ho!"
msgstr "Spaceward Ho!"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:484 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7729 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:87
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:92 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:94
msgid "Tunnels and Trolls"
msgstr "Tunnels and Trolls"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:481 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7735 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:102
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:97 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:99
msgid "Vegas Games"
msgstr "Vegas Games"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:490 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7743
msgid ""
"The Dragon Pharaoh sets the Cube of Power in one hand of the shrine and the Scepter in the other. \"Let the two faces of Xeen be one world again.\" Far off, four sleepers answer at once. The sky turns over, and for a moment you see both faces of Xeen together: a whole world, close to its sun. When you can see again there is a pavilion on the cloud, Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra under it, and the Pharaoh, looking pleased with himself, reading the vows."
msgstr ""
"龙法老把力量魔方放在神龛的一只手中，把权杖放在另一只手中。“愿辛恩的两面再次合为一个世界。”远方，四位沉睡者同时回应。天空翻转，有那么一刻，你们同时看到了辛恩的两面：一个完整的世界，靠近它的太阳。当你们重新能看见时，云上有一座凉亭，罗兰王子和卡琳德拉女王站在其下，法老得意洋洋地宣读着誓词。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:491 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7750
msgid ""
"You step onto the disc. It drifts back along the cloud road and sets you down by the stair house."
msgstr "你踏上圆盘。它沿着云路漂回，把你放在楼梯屋旁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:487 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7756
msgid "The observatory is closed."
msgstr "天文台关闭了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:475 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7762
msgid ""
"A message reads: It's a long road ahead so rest where you can. But don't forget to recast your spells. Signed, The Dragon Pharaoh"
msgstr "一条信息写着：前路漫长，有地方就歇一歇。但别忘了重新施放你的法术。签名：龙法老"

