#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:155 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:157
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:165
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:172
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:180
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:187
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p5.lua:192
msgid "Rest Stop"
msgstr "休息站"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:28 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:777
msgid ""
"The Alacorn! But the Head Witch still lives, and she will come for it. Finish what you started."
msgstr "阿拉科恩！但首领女巫还活着，她会来夺回它。把你开始的事做完。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:488 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7775
msgid ""
"The shrine is quiet. The pavilion is still there; somebody has left cake."
msgstr "神龛静悄悄的。凉亭还在；有人留下了蛋糕。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:489 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7776
msgid ""
"Dragon Pharaoh, Guardian of Xeen: In order for me to commence the unification ceremony, you must have the Cube of Power and the Scepter of Temporal Distortion. Also, the four Elemental Sleepers must be awakened."
msgstr "龙法老，辛恩的守护者：为了让我开始统一仪式，你们必须拥有力量魔方和时间扭曲权杖。此外，四位元素沉睡者必须已被唤醒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:51 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7791
msgid ""
"Only Crusaders are allowed to enter Castle Burlock. Old Valia of Toad Meadow names Crusaders."
msgstr "只有十字军才能进入伯洛克城堡。蟾蜍草地的老瓦莉娅会任命十字军。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:29 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:781
msgid "I am waiting for you to destroy the witches and return the Alacorn."
msgstr "我在等你们消灭女巫，并把独角兽角送回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1326 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7824
msgid "Sand, and more sand."
msgstr "沙子，更多的沙子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1327 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7825
msgid ""
"A mound of sand between the paws. Without knowing where to dig, you could dig all week."
msgstr "爪子之间的一堆沙子。不知道往哪挖，你可以挖上一整周。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7831
msgid ""
"You dig where the seven words said. An iron box lies under the sand, left for a Sphinx that never came for it."
msgstr "你们按七个词所说的地方挖掘。沙子下躺着一个铁盒，留给一只从未来取它的斯芬克斯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:30 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:784
msgid ""
"I am just an old woman but before I die I wish to see the witches of Toad Meadow destroyed. You see, when I was still a young maiden, I fell asleep in Toad Meadow. When I awoke I found a unicorn laying down beside me. Her name was Falista and she was fleeing from a band of witches who were trying to capture her. Since that day I have kept Falista safely hidden. But now she has disappeared. I fear the worst has happened and the witches have killed her for her Alacorn's magic. The witches fear nothing, and lock nothing. Their tower stands south-east of the meadow. Go quickly."
msgstr ""
"我只是个老妇人，但在我死之前，我希望看到蟾蜍草地的女巫被消灭。你瞧，我还是年轻姑娘时，在蟾蜍草地睡着了。醒来时我发现一头独角兽躺在我身边。她名叫法利斯塔，正在逃避一伙想要抓住她的女巫。从那天起，我一直把法利斯塔安全地藏起来。但现在她失踪了。我担心最坏的事情发生了，女巫为了她阿拉科恩的魔力杀了她。女巫什么都不怕，什么都不锁。她们的塔在草甸东南方。快去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1328 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7840
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of six words: DIG."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第一个：DIG。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1329 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7849
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of six words: BENEATH."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第二个：BENEATH。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1330 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7858
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of six words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第三个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1331 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7867
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of six words: BROKEN."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第四个：BROKEN。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1332 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7876
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of six words: TRAVEL."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的第五个：TRAVEL。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7885
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of six words: PYRAMID."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，六个词中的最后一个：PYRAMID。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1335 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7892
msgid "The pyramid portal has been destroyed. Under its capstone: rubble."
msgstr "金字塔传送门已被摧毁。顶石下面：瓦砾。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1336 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7893
msgid "The pyramid portal has been destroyed."
msgstr "金字塔传送门已被摧毁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7899
msgid ""
"You dig beneath the broken pyramid's capstone. A chest of old Darkside coin waits there, dry as the day it was buried."
msgstr "你在破碎金字塔的顶石下挖掘。一箱古老的暗面钱币在那里等着，和它被埋下那天一样干燥。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1318 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7908
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the first of seven words: SEEK."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第一个：SEEK。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:13 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:791
msgid "Falista"
msgstr "法利斯塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1319 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7917
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the second of seven words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第二个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1320 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7926
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the third of seven words: HOARD."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第三个：HOARD。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:26 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:793
msgid ""
"Falista grazes behind my cottage again, Crusaders. She eats the roses. I let her."
msgstr "法利斯塔又在我的小屋后面吃草了，十字军们。她吃玫瑰。我由着她。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1321 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7935
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fourth of seven words: BURIED."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第四个：BURIED。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1322 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7944
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the fifth of seven words: FOR."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第五个：FOR。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7953
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the sixth of seven words: THE."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的第六个：THE。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1324 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7962
msgid "Carved into the obelisk, the last of seven words: SPHINX."
msgstr "方尖碑上刻着，七个词中的最后一个：SPHINX。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1452 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7968
msgid ""
"The balloonist's logbook, last entry: Wind fair. Balloon fairer. Balloon gone."
msgstr "热气球驾驶员的航海日志，最后一条：风顺。气球更顺。气球没了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1464 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7975
msgid "The bell tolls under the waves. Nobody comes."
msgstr "钟在波浪下鸣响。没有人来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1465 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7980
msgid ""
"The bell tolls under the waves. Something green rattles in its mouth: an emerald."
msgstr "钟声在海浪下鸣响。某种绿色的东西在它的口中咔嗒作响：一颗翡翠。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1453 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7987
msgid "Lightning has struck here. Often."
msgstr "这里遭过雷击。很多次。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1454 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7992
msgid ""
"Lightning has struck here. Often. In the fused glass, a blue stone has set like a fly in amber."
msgstr "闪电在这里劈过。经常。在熔融的玻璃中，一颗蓝色的石头像琥珀里的苍蝇一样凝固了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1446 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:7998
msgid "A note by the burnt bedroll: Day 3. The boots work. The feet do not."
msgstr "烧焦的铺盖卷旁有张字条：第三天。靴子管用。脚不管用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1459 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8005
msgid "You shout into the stone. The plane answers, slowly."
msgstr "你们对着石头大喊。位面缓缓地回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:14 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:801
msgid "Children"
msgstr "孩子们"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1460 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8010
msgid ""
"You shout into the stone. The plane answers, slowly, and something rolls out of the hollow: a sapphire."
msgstr "你对着石头大喊。位面缓慢地回答，有东西从凹陷处滚出来：一颗蓝宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1444 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8017
msgid "The fire is cool and refreshing. Nothing more happens."
msgstr "火焰清凉爽快。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1445 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8023
msgid "The fire is cool and refreshing. (+20 Fire resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "火焰清凉爽快。（休息之前 +20 火系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:803
msgid ""
"Every child is home. Their mothers have stopped crying. Their fathers have started."
msgstr "每个孩子都回家了。他们的母亲不再哭泣。他们的父亲开始了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1456 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8030
msgid "The stone is warm. That is all, today."
msgstr "石头是温的。今天也就这样了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1457 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8036
msgid "The stone is warm. (+20 Earth resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "石头是温的。（休息之前 +20 土系抗性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1458 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8042
msgid "A slate propped on the half-cut block: Nearly done. Back after lunch."
msgstr "半截石块上靠着一块石板：快做完了。午饭后回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1466 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8048
msgid ""
"The ship's log: Day 40. Still no land. Day 41. Found land. It was this."
msgstr "船的日志：第40天。仍未见陆地。第41天。发现了陆地。就是这个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1455 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8057
msgid "Rocks fall from above!"
msgstr "头顶落下了岩石！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1450 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8064
msgid "The stones are silent. They sang today already."
msgstr "石头们沉默着。它们今天已经唱过了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:807
msgid ""
"All four of them home, and not one of them a goblin! Take this. It is not much, but it is all the meadow could gather."
msgstr "四个孩子全都回了家，没有一个变成哥布林！拿着这个。不多，但这是草甸能凑出的全部了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1451 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8071
msgid ""
"The stones sing. You feel lighter. (+20 Air resistance and +10 Speed until you rest)"
msgstr "石头在歌唱。你觉得身体轻盈了。（空气抗性+20，速度+10，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1447 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8078
msgid "The spire hums. Nothing else happens."
msgstr "尖塔嗡嗡作响。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1448 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8083
msgid ""
"The spire hums, and a shard of red crystal drops from the seam: a ruby."
msgstr "尖塔嗡嗡作响，一块红色水晶碎片从缝隙里掉下来：一颗红宝石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8091
msgid "Lightning strikes from a clear sky!"
msgstr "晴空降下了雷击！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1462 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8098
msgid "The water is cool and refreshing. Nothing more happens."
msgstr "水清凉爽快。没有发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1463 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8104
msgid ""
"The water is cool and refreshing. For once, it is true. (+20 Water resistance until you rest)"
msgstr "水清凉爽口。这一次，是真的。（水系抗性+20，直到休息）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1443 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8112
msgid "A vent flares!"
msgstr "一个喷口喷发了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:33 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:812
msgid ""
"The witches catch children and turn them into goblins. They keep the ones they haven't turned yet in cages in the tower. Bring them home if you can."
msgstr "女巫抓走孩子，把他们变成哥布林。还没变的孩子她们关在塔里的笼子里。如果可以，把他们带回家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1461 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8120
msgid "A freezing wave breaks over you!"
msgstr "一道冰冷的浪头拍在你们身上！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:614 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8132
msgid ""
"Among the gargoyles' shiny things: a jewelled scarab, and a tag on a string: \"Deliver to Asp: one scarab.\""
msgstr "在石像鬼闪亮的收藏中：一只镶宝的圣甲虫，和一张系在绳子上的标签：“送往毒蛇镇：圣甲虫一只。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:621 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8139
msgid "The housing is empty."
msgstr "外壳是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:622 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8140
msgid "The crystal housing is shut tight while the machine hums."
msgstr "机器嗡嗡运转时，水晶外壳紧紧闭合。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8146
msgid ""
"In the housing, still warm: a cluster of blue crystals that crackle when you touch them. Falagar's, no doubt."
msgstr "在外壳里，还是温的：一簇蓝色水晶，一碰就噼啪作响。毫无疑问是法拉加的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:631 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:504
msgid "Medin rows you across to the island."
msgstr "梅丁划船把你们送到了岛上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:632 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8181
msgid ""
"Medin's boat is tied up. \"Not while those beasts circle the island,\" says Medin."
msgstr "梅丁的船系着。“那些怪兽还在绕着岛转，就不行，”梅丁说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:641 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8196
msgid ""
"You burn everything you can, and what you cannot burn you throw outside. The warren fills with smoke, and the trolls that are left will not come back to it."
msgstr "你烧掉了所有能烧的东西，烧不掉的就扔到外面。巢穴里充满了烟雾，剩下的巨魔不会再回来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:45 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:820
msgid "The Sixth Mirror. In pieces. It is a pity about the mirror, though."
msgstr "第六面镜子。碎成了片。镜子碎了，真是可惜。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:646 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8204
msgid "You destroy the outpost. Glom will be pleased."
msgstr "你们摧毁了前哨站。格洛姆会很高兴的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:653 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8210
msgid "Broken eggshells and angry chirping."
msgstr "破碎的蛋壳和愤怒的啁啾声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:652 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8217
msgid ""
"A hollow full of blue speckled sprite eggs, and among them a slim wand of white wood: Danulf's Wand of Faery Magic."
msgstr "一个满是蓝色斑点精灵蛋的洼地，其中有一根白木的纤细魔杖：达努夫的精灵魔法杖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:659 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8223
msgid "The torn pack is empty now."
msgstr "撕破的背包现在空了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:658 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8229
msgid ""
"In the torn pack, under the snow: a book bound in white leather. Tito's Holy Book."
msgstr "在撕破的背包里，积雪之下：一本白皮革装订的书。蒂托的圣书。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_greet.txt:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:825
msgid "NO MIRROR?!? Get out of my sight!"
msgstr "没有镜子？！滚出我的视线！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:508 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8251
msgid ""
"Under a heap of curse dolls and unpaid bills: a pendant on a silver chain, humming faintly."
msgstr "在一堆诅咒娃娃和未付账单下面：一条银链上的吊坠，微微嗡鸣着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:673 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8258
msgid "Orothin the Wise: 'What falls past the rim does not come back.'"
msgstr "智者奥罗辛：“越过边缘的东西不会回来。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:671 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:674 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8259
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8273
msgid "The statue repels you."
msgstr "雕像把你排斥开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:672 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8265
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Disease."
msgstr "雕像的石手张开了。手中躺着一本书：治疗疾病。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:670 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8272
msgid "Orothin the Wise: 'The world has an edge. Mind it.'"
msgstr "智者奥罗辛：“世界有边缘。当心它。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:669 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8279
msgid "The statue's stone hands open. In them lies a book: Cure Poison."
msgstr "雕像的石手张开了。手中躺着一本书：解毒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:47 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:829
msgid ""
"Ah, more adventurers! I charge you with the quest of finding the Sixth Mirror. My sources tell me that the mirror was last seen near the great volcano. Go forth, now, and bring it to me. I will reward the one who returns it to me with an Earldom."
msgstr ""
"啊，又来了冒险者！我委派你们寻找第六面魔镜。据我的消息来源，那面镜子最后一次出现在大火山附近。现在出发吧，把它带给我。将它归还给我的人，我会赐予伯爵领地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:668 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8290
msgid "Half buried in the creek mud: a whistle carved from bone."
msgstr "半埋在小溪的泥里：一只用骨头雕成的哨子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:680 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8296
msgid ""
"Sensing that you already have another Phirna root, the plant stubbornly resists your greedy fingers."
msgstr "你察觉到自己已经有另一株菲尔娜根，这株植物顽固地抗拒你贪婪的手指。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:679 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8301
msgid "You have found a Phirna plant. Ok, you dug it up."
msgstr "你们找到了一株菲尔娜植物。好吧，你们把它挖出来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:689 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8308
msgid "A cottage, newly thatched, the door locked. Nobody lives here yet."
msgstr "一座新铺了茅草的小屋，门锁着。还没有人住。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:688 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8313
msgid ""
"Celia opens the door with flour on her hands. \"It's you! Derek, look who it is!\""
msgstr "西莉亚手上沾着面粉打开了门。“是你们！德里克，看看是谁来了！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:694 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8330
msgid ""
"The ogres' lair, in the river bluff. Boulders stacked by the cliff edge, and a smell of cooking you would rather not ask about."
msgstr "食人妖的巢穴，在河岸悬崖上。巨石堆在崖边，还有一股你最好别问是什么在煮的味道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:696 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8336
msgid "Nothing is left to break."
msgstr "没有什么可打破的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:695 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8339
msgid "You break everything you can find in the lair."
msgstr "你们把巢穴里能找到的东西都砸了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:698 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8345
msgid "An empty rack."
msgstr "一个空架子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:697 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8348
msgid ""
"You knock the cross-beam out of the rack, and the whole heap of boulders goes thundering over the cliff into the river. That is the end of the ogres' ammunition."
msgstr "你把横梁从架子上撞掉，整堆巨石轰隆隆地滚下悬崖落入河中。这就是食人妖弹药的终结。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:16 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:835
msgid "Earldom"
msgstr "伯爵爵位"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:711 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8355
msgid "A hole two paces north of the cairn. Yours."
msgstr "石堆以北两步处的一个坑。归你们了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:712 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8356
msgid ""
"A cairn of five stones. Somebody built it on purpose, for some reason."
msgstr "一堆五块石头垒成的石堆。有人故意垒的，不知为何。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:48 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:836
msgid ""
"An Earldom. Land, a title, a seat at my table. Newcastle's ruins are for sale, I hear, if you can't wait. Ebenezer will sell you anything."
msgstr "伯爵领地。土地、头衔、我桌旁的一个座位。我听说纽卡斯尔的废墟在出售，如果你等不及的话。埃比尼泽什么都卖给你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:710 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8362
msgid ""
"Two paces north of the cairn, a strongbox. The map was honest. The ink runs in the damp and the map comes apart in your hands, its work done."
msgstr "石堆以北两步，有一个保险箱。地图是诚实的。墨水在潮气中化开，地图在你手中散开，任务完成了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:709 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8368
msgid "MAPS BY JOE! Genuine! Only one of its kind!"
msgstr "乔牌地图！正宗！独一无二！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:719 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8379
msgid "\"Tax first,\" says the door in Scaldrith's voice. It stays shut."
msgstr "“先交税，”门用斯卡尔德里斯的声音说。它依然紧闭。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:722 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8387
msgid ""
"Pinned under the strongbox, a slip from the Dragon Tax Office: \"Paid in full. Receipt no. 4,118. Valid for one entry.\" He had paid. He had also, it seems, argued."
msgstr "压在保险箱下面的是龙税办公室的一张字条：“已全额付清。收据编号4,118。限入场一次。”他确实付过钱。看来他也争论过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:734 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8394
msgid "The Art of Taxation. You know it by heart, regrettably."
msgstr "《税收的艺术》。你已经烂熟于心，很遗憾。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:735 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8395
msgid ""
"The Art of Taxation. The first page says: Read the Lore first. Then we'll talk money."
msgstr "《税收的艺术》。第一页写着：先读龙学。然后我们再谈钱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:733 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8402
msgid ""
"The Art of Taxation, by Scaldrith. \"Chapter One: Everyone pays. Chapter Two: See Chapter One.\""
msgstr "《税收的艺术》，斯卡尔德里斯著。“第一章：人人纳税。第二章：见第一章。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:720 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8409
msgid "The urn is empty and powerless."
msgstr "瓮是空的，没有任何力量。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:721 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8412
msgid ""
"A brass urn on the counter, lettered DRAGON TAX. It is empty, and it looks hungry. The collector is behind the office door."
msgstr "柜台上一只黄铜瓮，刻着“龙税”。它是空的，看起来很饿。收税人在办公室门后。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:724 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8418
msgid "Dragon Lore, volume 1. You have read it. It has not changed."
msgstr "《龙学》第一卷。你读过了。它没有变化。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:17 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:291 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:399
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4297 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:4753 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:842
msgid "The mirror"
msgstr "镜子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:723 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8425
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 1: Worms. \"A dragon begins as a worm and ends as a wyrm. The difference is a Y and about nine hundred years.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第一卷：蠕虫。“龙始于蠕虫，终于巨蠕。区别是一个Y和大约九百年。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:49 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:843
msgid ""
"My brother has wanted the Sixth Mirror since before I left. Find it, and he may even smile. I have not seen it myself."
msgstr "我哥哥在我离开之前就想要第六面魔镜了。找到它，他或许还会笑一笑。我自己没见过它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:726 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8431
msgid "Dragon Lore, volume 2. Read."
msgstr "《龙学》第二卷。已读。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:725 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8438
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 2: Lizards. \"A lizard is a dragon that has given up. Do not tell it so.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第二卷：蜥蜴。“蜥蜴是放弃了的龙。别告诉它。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:728 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8444
msgid "Dragon Lore, volume 3. Read."
msgstr "《龙学》第三卷。已读。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8451
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 3: Serpents. \"No legs, no wings, and no patience for reading. They will not have got this far.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第三卷：蛇。“没有腿，没有翅膀，也没有耐心读书。它们走不到这一步。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:730 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8457
msgid "Dragon Lore, volume 4. Read."
msgstr "《龙学》第四卷。已读。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:729 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8464
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 4: Drakes. \"A drake is a dragon that has not yet been taxed.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第四卷：幼龙。“幼龙是还没被收税的龙。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:732 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8470
msgid "Dragon Lore, volume 5. Read."
msgstr "《龙学》第五卷。已读。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:731 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8477
msgid ""
"Dragon Lore, volume 5: Dragons. \"There is only one. All the others are practice.\""
msgstr "《龙学》第五卷：龙。“只有一条。其余的都是练习。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:736 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8484
msgid "Splinters of horn and a scorch mark."
msgstr "角的碎片和一道焦痕。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:18 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:849
msgid "Travels"
msgstr "游历"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:737 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8493
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr "恶魔头骨像锤下的煤块一样炸开。前方某处，岩石摩擦着岩石：两个头骨封住的路开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:738 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8499
msgid ""
"The demon skull bursts like a coal under a hammer. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr "恶魔头骨像锤下的煤块一样炸开。洞穴仍在燃烧，但里面有什么东西不再注视你了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:850
msgid ""
"I was away a long time, further than most. The castle seems smaller now. Everything does."
msgstr "我离开了很久，比大多数人都远。城堡现在看起来小了。一切都是。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:739 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8506
msgid "Splinters of black bone and a smell of sulphur."
msgstr "黑色骨头的碎片和一股硫磺味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:740 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8515
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. Somewhere ahead, rock grinds on rock: the way the two skulls kept shut is open."
msgstr "魔鬼头骨裂成两半，两半都发出尖叫。前方某处，岩石摩擦着岩石：两个头骨封住的路开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:741 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8521
msgid ""
"The devil skull cracks in two and both halves scream. The cave goes on burning, but something in it has stopped watching you."
msgstr "魔鬼头骨裂成两半，两半都发出尖叫。洞穴仍在燃烧，但里面有什么东西不再注视你了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:744 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8527
msgid ""
"The lever stone drops into its socket. Down the gate run, a slab of black rock grinds into the floor."
msgstr "拉杆石落入凹槽。门的另一边，一块黑岩板磨着滑入地面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:745 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8533 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:318
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd04.lua:713
msgid "The lever is down."
msgstr "拉杆已拉下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:743 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8539
msgid ""
"Bare rock, hot to the touch. Two skulls in the cave behind you seem to be grinning about it."
msgstr "光秃秃的岩石，摸上去很烫。你身后洞里的两个头骨似乎正为此咧嘴笑着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:742 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8541
msgid "Beyond the last cave, cool air, and the smell of grass."
msgstr "最后一个洞穴之外，是清凉的空气和青草的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:513 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8547
msgid ""
"The robbers' den, under the great bridge. Somewhere in here the boss keeps Princess Roxanne's tiara. Dice on the tables, wet boots by the bunks, and the river loud overhead."
msgstr "强盗们的巢穴，在大桥下面。头目把罗珊公主的冠冕藏在这里的某处。桌上有骰子，铺位旁有湿靴子，河水在头顶轰鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:515 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8553
msgid ""
"The chest is locked with a little silver lock. The Princess's, and she hasn't said you may."
msgstr "箱子用一把小银锁锁着。那是公主的，而她没说你可以动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:514 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8561
msgid "The Robber Boss falls. A ring of heavy keys hangs at his belt."
msgstr "强盗老大倒下了。他腰间挂着一串沉重的钥匙。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:858
msgid ""
"Crodo is free. Good. The King was pleased for almost a minute, and then asked about the mirror."
msgstr "克罗多自由了。很好。国王高兴了将近一分钟，然后又问起了镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:521 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8590
msgid ""
"The clan master falls. You have dishonored the Ninjas by entering the Pagoda. They surely will not return to reclaim it."
msgstr "族长倒下了。你们进入宝塔，使忍者蒙羞。他们必定不会回来收复它了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:530 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8596
msgid ""
"A wall of coloured light hums across the passage. Somewhere above, the stones round the well decide whether it stays."
msgstr "一道彩色光墙嗡嗡地横在通道上。在上方某处，水井周围的石头决定它是否留下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:528 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8603
msgid ""
"A message appears in the stone: The southwest corner is where to start / Begin with red to tell them apart. Alternate the colors around the well / Then the machine can no longer repel."
msgstr "石头里浮现一条信息：西南角是起点/先从红色开始分辨。绕井交替着色/机器便无法再排斥。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:529 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8609 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:147
msgid "The pedestal is cool to the touch."
msgstr "基座摸上去冰凉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:53 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:862
msgid "You haven't found Crodo yet. Keep searching."
msgstr "你们还没找到克罗多。继续找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:532 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8622
msgid "The transformer is scrap. The crystal housing behind it hangs open."
msgstr "变形器成了废铁。它后面的水晶外壳敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:531 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8625
msgid ""
"The transformer sparks, shudders and dies. Far above, in a cellar in Asp, someone stops hissing in mid-word."
msgstr "变形器迸出火花，颤抖着停止了运转。远在上方，毒蛇镇的一间地窖里，有人说到一半停止了嘶嘶声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:544 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8631
msgid "Acme Ghost Visualization System."
msgstr "艾克米幽灵可视化系统。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:545 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8637
msgid "We have great treasure you can see. Bang the gong and set us free."
msgstr "我们有看得见的大宝藏。敲响铜锣，放我们自由。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:539 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8644
msgid "The gong booms over an empty, honest town. Nothing answers."
msgstr "铜锣声在空荡荡、老实巴交的小镇上空回响。没有任何回应。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:540 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8649
msgid ""
"The note rolls over the empty roofs, and the cold goes out of the air. Mayor Randon will want to hear of it."
msgstr "钟声滚过空荡荡的屋顶，空气中的寒意散去了。兰登镇长会想听听这个。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:541 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8652
msgid ""
"The note dies in the fog. Somewhere a ghost laughs: \"You'll never win this game of war. The dead shall rule forevermore.\""
msgstr "钟声在雾中消逝。某处，一只鬼笑道：“你们永远赢不了这场战争。亡者将永远统治。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:543 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8658
msgid ""
"Bang twice on each northern gong is all you have to do. The well can make you strong, but the order is up to you."
msgstr "每面北边的铜锣敲两下就行。水井能让你变强，但顺序由你决定。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:866
msgid ""
"Years ago King Burlock met Crodo, a kindly old sorcerer who became the King's friend. Baron Darzog, who was the King's master sorcerer, became very jealous of this friendship. I tried to warn the King that Darzog's jealousy would lead to no good, but he wouldn't listen to me. Now Crodo and Darzog have both disappeared and I fear that Crodo has been abducted. Perhaps Darzog has imprisoned him in his tower. If King Burlock were not so obsessed with the search for the Sixth Mirror, I'm sure he would have you search for him there."
msgstr ""
"多年前，伯洛克国王遇到了克罗多，一位和蔼的老巫师，成了国王的朋友。身为国王首席巫师的达佐格男爵对这份友谊非常嫉妒。我曾试图警告国王，达佐格的嫉妒不会有好结果，但他不听我的。现在克罗多和达佐格都失踪了，我担心克罗多被绑架了。也许达佐格把他囚禁在了他的塔里。如果伯洛克国王不是这么痴迷于寻找第六面魔镜，我相信他早就让你们去那里搜寻了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:542 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8664
msgid ""
"1) Destroy all ghosts. 2) Bang southern gong. 3) Re-visit Randon. 4) Repeat as necessary."
msgstr "1）消灭所有幽灵。2）敲响南边的铜锣。3）再去见兰登。4）必要时重复。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:554 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8670
msgid "Lives of a cat."
msgstr "猫有几条命。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:553 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8676
msgid "A stitch in time."
msgstr "及时的一针。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:556 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8683
msgid ""
"The lid refuses to budge. A symbol etched on the surface of the lid flashes pale blue whenever you try to move it. The signs on the square say how the dials should stand."
msgstr "棺盖纹丝不动。刻在盖子表面的符号，每当你试图移动它就闪起淡蓝色的光。广场上的标识说明了转盘该怎么拨。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:555 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8686
msgid ""
"The lid slides aside. There is no Count in the coffin: only a stair, going down, and the smell of old earth."
msgstr "棺盖滑开了。棺材里没有伯爵：只有一道向下的楼梯，和旧泥土的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:557 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8696
msgid ""
"Count Draco crumbles to dust, and his dust crumbles to less. Up in Nightshadow, shutters open for the first time in years."
msgstr "德拉科伯爵化为灰烬，他的灰烬又化为更少的东西。夜影镇上，百叶窗多年来第一次打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:549 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:550 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8702
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8705
msgid ""
"If the dials are properly set, the count will definitely be upset. Open his coffin and bid him farewell; only then can you use the magic of the well."
msgstr "如果转盘设置得当，伯爵肯定会不爽。打开他的棺材，向他道别；只有那样，你才能使用水井的魔力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:55 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:871
msgid ""
"See the King first. Everyone sees the King first. Then they come to me."
msgstr "先去见国王。每个人都先去见国王。然后他们才来找我。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:551 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8711
msgid "Only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr "只有夜里，你才能与他一战。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:552 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8717
msgid "The Count wakes at nine and sleeps at nine."
msgstr "伯爵九点醒来，九点入睡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:558 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8724
msgid ""
"The water is clear and cold, and tastes faintly of garlic. You feel healthier, and somehow more likeable."
msgstr "水清澈冰凉，隐约有大蒜的味道。你感觉更健康了，而且不知怎的更讨人喜欢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:559 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8727 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:305
msgid ""
"The water is black and tastes of iron. You decide you are not thirsty."
msgstr "水是黑色的，有铁的味道。你决定自己并不渴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:567 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8733
msgid "The door stands open."
msgstr "门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:566 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8736
msgid ""
"\"There wolf,\" you say. Something on the other side growls approvingly, and the bolts draw back."
msgstr "“There wolf，”你说。门的另一边有东西满意地低吼了一声，门闩缩了回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8742
msgid "\"Wrong,\" says the door, and something behind it laughs like a dog."
msgstr "“错了，”门说，门后有什么东西像狗一样笑了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:564 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8748
msgid ""
"A thin man rattles his chain. \"Upstairs door? 'There wolf.' I heard them say it a hundred times. And the Sphinx's name is Golux; they argue about it at dinner. Now get me out of here.\""
msgstr ""
"一个瘦削的男人摇着他的锁链。“楼上的门？‘There wolf’。我听他们说过一百遍。而且斯芬克斯的名字是戈卢克斯；他们晚餐时为此争论。现在带我离开这里。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:565 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8758
msgid ""
"\"Thank you for saving me!\" He is through the door and up the stairs before you can ask his name."
msgstr "“谢谢你们救了我！”他在你问他的名字之前就冲出门、跑上了楼梯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:56 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:876
msgid ""
"The pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo. Show it the sigil. Where it takes you, the King prefers not to know, so I don't tell him."
msgstr "弗蒂戈镇东边小丘上的金字塔。向它出示印记。它会带你去哪里，国王宁愿不知道，所以我没告诉他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:569 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8768
msgid ""
"A scroll bound in grey ribbon, labelled INSIGHT in a tidy hand. Someone has been reading it upside down."
msgstr "一卷用灰色丝带捆着的卷轴，上面用整齐的笔迹标着“洞察”。有人一直在倒着读它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:590 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8775
msgid ""
"Scroll of Aging. The ink is fresh. Your hands, as you put it down, are not. You have been aged ten years!"
msgstr "衰老卷轴。墨迹是新的。你放下它时，你的手却不是。你衰老了十岁！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:586 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8782
msgid ""
"Scroll of Confusion. The lines wander, and you wander after them. (Drunk)"
msgstr "混乱卷轴。字行游走，你跟着它们游走。（醉酒）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:589 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8789
msgid ""
"Scroll of Death. You read your own name on it, and the floor comes up to meet you. (Unconscious)"
msgstr "死亡卷轴。你在上面读到了自己的名字，地板向你迎了上来。（昏迷）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:57 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:879
msgid ""
"The old pyramids are said to lead to the land below the land. The Prince went there, they say, before he came home. The King will not hear of it. So, quietly: the Pyramid Sigil. Try the pyramid on the knoll east of Vertigo."
msgstr "据说古老的金字塔通往地下之地。他们说王子回家之前去过那里。国王不愿听这个。所以，悄悄告诉你：金字塔印记。试试弗蒂戈镇东边小丘上的金字塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:585 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8796
msgid ""
"Scroll of Depression. Halfway down the page you understand that nothing will ever be all right again. (Afraid)"
msgstr "沮丧卷轴。读到半页，你明白了一切再也不会好起来。（恐惧）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:570 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:572 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:574
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:576 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:578 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:580
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:582 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8803 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8815
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8833 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8852 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8864
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8876 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8888
msgid "You have read this scroll before. It has nothing more to give you."
msgstr "你们读过这卷轴了。它再没有什么能给你们的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:579 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8808
msgid ""
"Scroll of Electricity. Your hair stands up while you read, and stays wary after. (+5 Air resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "闪电卷轴。你读的时候头发竖了起来，之后依然保持警惕。（空气抗性+5，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:583 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8820
msgid ""
"Scroll of Energy. It hums in your hands, then in you, then stops. (+5 Earth resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "能量卷轴。它在你手里嗡鸣，然后在你体内嗡鸣，然后停了。（土系抗性+5，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:584 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8826
msgid "The writing has faded."
msgstr "字迹已经褪去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:577 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8838
msgid ""
"Scroll of Fire. The letters glow, then cool, and so does your skin. (+5 Fire resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "火焰卷轴。字母发光，然后冷却，你的皮肤也是。（火系抗性+5，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:587 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8845
msgid ""
"Scroll of Insanity. It makes perfect sense. That is the trouble. (Insane)"
msgstr "疯狂卷轴。它完全说得通。这就是麻烦所在。（疯狂）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:571 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8857
msgid ""
"Scroll of Intellect. You read it twice, and the second time it makes sense. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "智力卷轴。你读了两遍，第二遍才读懂。（智力+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:581 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8869
msgid ""
"Scroll of Magic. The spells written on it slide off you as you read. (+5 Mind resistance, permanent)"
msgstr "魔法卷轴。上面写的法术在你阅读时从你身上滑走。（心智抗性+5，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:573 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8881
msgid ""
"Scroll of Personality. You read it aloud, and the room seems to like you better for it. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr "个性卷轴。你大声读出来，房间似乎因此更喜欢你了。（个性+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic.txt:21 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/town_portal_switch.txt:9 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:889
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x3.lua:618
msgid "Newcastle"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:575 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8893
msgid ""
"Scroll of Speed. You finish it before you have quite started it. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "速度卷轴。你还没完全开始就读完了。（速度+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:588 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8900
msgid "Scroll of Weakness. Your arms forget what they were for. (Weak)"
msgstr "虚弱卷轴。你们的手臂忘了自己是干什么用的。（虚弱）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:592 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8906
msgid "The door between the paws stands open."
msgstr "前爪之间的门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:591 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8909
msgid ""
"The stone between the paws slides aside, as if it had been waiting for someone to knock."
msgstr "前爪之间的石头滑到一边，仿佛一直在等人敲门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:58 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:891
msgid ""
"If you want to make some improvements here you should see the King's engineers. Emerson, at Castle Burlock. I am sure he will be able to help you."
msgstr "如果你想在这里做些改进，应该去找国王的工程师。伯洛克城堡的爱默生。我相信他能帮你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8915
msgid ""
"Hieroglyphs, and under them the message reads: My first is in giant but not in defiant. My second is in mole but not in mule. My third is in lich but not in stitch. My fourth is in guard but not in Girard. My fifth is in XEEN but not in Queen."
msgstr ""
"象形文字，下面写着：我的第一个字母在 giant 里，不在 defiant 里。我的第二个字母在 mole 里，不在 mule 里。我的第三个字母在 lich 里，不在 stitch 里。我的第四个字母在 guard 里，不在 Girard 里。我的第五个字母在 XEEN 里，不在 Queen 里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:595 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8921
msgid "\"Golux. Yes. Still me.\""
msgstr "“戈卢克斯。是的。依然是我。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:594 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8928
msgid ""
"\"Golux,\" the Sphinx repeats, pleased. \"Nobody ever asks how I am. Sit where you like.\" The doors to the thrones open."
msgstr "“戈卢克斯，”斯芬克斯满意地重复道。“从来没人问我过得怎么样。随便坐吧。”通往王座的门打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:596 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8934
msgid "\"No,\" says the Sphinx, and the floor agrees with it."
msgstr "“不对，”狮身人面像说，地板也同意它的话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:59 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:894
msgid ""
"Wanna buy the land this lovely castle rests upon? Only twelve thousand gold! The rubble is included. So are the wood golems in the foundations."
msgstr "想买下这座可爱城堡所在的土地吗？只要一万二千金币！废墟包括在内。地基里的木傀儡也包括在内。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:593 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8940
msgid ""
"The message reads: You're looking for my name, it's five letters long. I think you'll like my name. Try not to get it wrong. A voice booms, \"What is my name?\""
msgstr "信息写着：你在找我的名字，它有五个字母。我想你会喜欢我的名字。别猜错了。一个声音轰鸣：“我的名字是什么？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:598 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:601 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:604
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:607 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8946 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8961
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8976 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8991
msgid "The throne is behind a sealed door. The Sphinx has not been named."
msgstr "王座在一扇封印的门后。斯芬克斯尚未被说出名字。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:599 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:602 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:605
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:608 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8950 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8965
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8980 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8995
msgid ""
"You have sat here before. The throne remembers, and is not impressed twice."
msgstr "你以前坐过这里。王座记得，并不为第二次所动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:600 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8955
msgid ""
"You sit on the King's throne. It fits better than it should. (+2 Might, permanent)"
msgstr "你坐在国王的王座上。它比应有的更合身。（力量+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:609 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8970
msgid ""
"The throne of legends. Old names are carved in it, and there is room for yours. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr "传奇王座。上面刻着古老的名字，还有你名字的位置。（耐力+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:603 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:8985
msgid ""
"You sit on the Queen's throne, and for a moment everyone in the hall looks at you. (+2 Personality, permanent)"
msgstr "你坐在女王的王座上，有那么一刻大厅里每个人都看着你。（个性+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:60 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:899
msgid ""
"Thanks a lot! You won't regret your decision. Sign here. And here. The golems are yours too, of course."
msgstr "多谢了！你不会后悔的。在这里签名。还有这里。傀儡当然也归你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:606 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9000
msgid ""
"The Prince of Thieves' throne. Your hands feel lighter, and somebody's purse feels closer. (+2 Accuracy, permanent)"
msgstr "盗贼王子的王座。你的双手感觉更轻了，而某人的钱包感觉更近了。（准确+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:33 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:764 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9006
msgid ""
"A burrow under the wall, with a tiny door and a tiny sign: THE COURT. KNOCK LOUDLY. WE WILL IGNORE YOU."
msgstr "城墙下的一个洞穴，有一扇小小的门和一块小小的牌子：朝廷。请大声敲门。我们不会理你。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:763 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9017
msgid "The Mayor's notice. Someone has drawn a gremlin on it, upside down."
msgstr "镇长的告示。有人在上面倒着画了一只地精。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:762 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9021
msgid ""
"BY ORDER OF THE MAYOR: the treasury will pay to end the Gremlins' mischief. Their court is the burrow under the wall, east of this gate. Pass holders apply within. Everyone else, apply to the gremlins."
msgstr "镇长令：国库将出资终结地精的恶作剧。他们的朝廷在这座城门以东城墙下的洞穴里。持通行证者进内申请。其他人，向地精申请。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:766 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9036
msgid "The guards are still dead."
msgstr "卫兵们还是死的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:765 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9039
msgid ""
"The last guard falls. On the throne, Gettlewaithe has gone a much paler shade of green."
msgstr "最后一个卫兵倒下。王座上，格特尔韦特的脸色变成了更苍白的绿色。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:905
msgid ""
"Twelve thousand gold, not a copper less. The King's tax is the King's tax."
msgstr "一万二千金币，少一个铜板都不行。国王的税就是国王的税。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:768 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9051
msgid ""
"Under the throne: crumbs. Above it, the Mayor's portrait, with a moustache added."
msgstr "王座下：面包屑。王座上方，是镇长的画像，被添上了一撇小胡子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:769 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9052
msgid "The throne is occupied. Mostly by a very nervous gremlin."
msgstr "王座上有人。大多是一只非常紧张的地精。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:767 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9057
msgid "You find 3 Energy Disks under the late Gettlewaithe's throne."
msgstr "你们在已故的格特尔韦特的王座下找到了 3 块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:905 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9063
msgid ""
"Only a scrap of the original text remains legible: ...set the Western dials to 1, Northern to 2, and Eastern to 3. To join the Way of Bark, pull lever and drink of the Crystal Water."
msgstr "原文只剩下一小片还能辨认：……把西边的转盘设为1，北边设为2，东边设为3。要加入树皮之道，拉动拉杆并饮下水晶之水。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:912 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9070
msgid "The cage is open and empty."
msgstr "笼子敞开着，空了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:913 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9071
msgid "A cage of woven roots, locked. The princess inside waves politely."
msgstr "一个用树根编织的笼子，锁着。里面的公主有礼貌地挥手。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:911 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9074
msgid ""
"Shaalth's key turns in the cage lock. The princess steps out and straightens her wings."
msgstr "沙尔斯的钥匙在笼锁里转动。公主走出来，整理好翅膀。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:906 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9086
msgid "You are hereby dubbed a Disciple of Bark!"
msgstr "特此封你们为树皮门徒！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:908 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9092
msgid ""
"The poisonous water burns your throat as you take a long drink. Violent tremors wrack your body. They pass, which is more than the water intended."
msgstr "有毒的水在你痛饮时灼烧你的喉咙。剧烈的震颤席卷你的身体。它们过去了，这已超出了水原本的意图。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:909 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9098
msgid ""
"Other beings say that we Orcs just aren't civilized. I now invite you in for a cup of tea to debate on this issue."
msgstr "别的生物说我们兽人不够文明。我现在请你们进来喝杯茶，就这个问题辩论一番。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:910 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9104
msgid ""
"The tea is hot, sweet and poisonous. The debate is over, and the Orcs won it."
msgstr "茶又热、又甜、又有毒。辩论结束了，兽人赢了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:904 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9110
msgid ""
"The limb swallows the gem. Deep in the trunk, something very large and very wooden wakes up."
msgstr "树枝吞下了宝石。树干深处，某种非常巨大而非常木质的东西醒了过来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:899 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:902 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9117
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9131
msgid "The root is fed."
msgstr "树根被喂饱了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:900 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:903 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9118
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9132
msgid "Feed me! Give gem? (You have no gem. The root sulks.)"
msgstr "喂我！给宝石吗？（你没有宝石。树根生起了闷气。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:898 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:901 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9124
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9138
msgid "The root drinks the gem. The bark parts on an Energy Disc."
msgstr "树根喝下了宝石。树皮裂开，露出一块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:62 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:913
msgid ""
"We want to make sure you approve of the work we have already done. Please go and take a look at your castle."
msgstr "我们想确认你对我们已完成的工作是否满意。请去看看你的城堡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:915 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9162
msgid "An empty chest in an empty tree."
msgstr "一棵空树里的一个空箱子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:916 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9163
msgid "A sprite's chest, with a sprite sitting on it."
msgstr "一个精灵的箱子，上面坐着一个精灵。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:914 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9168
msgid ""
"In this treehouse there once lived many sprites, but someone murdered the lot of them. You find two energy disks."
msgstr "这座树屋里曾住着很多精灵，但有人把它们全杀了。你们找到两个能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:82 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:917
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:974
msgid ""
"Thanks! We'll have the work done by the time you get back to the site."
msgstr "谢谢！等你回到工地时，工作就完成了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:897 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9174
msgid ""
"A voice bellows: 'Feed the roots and the tree shall bear fruit! Feed the limbs and suffer the wrath of BARKMAN!'"
msgstr "一个声音吼道：“喂养树根，树木才会结果！喂养树枝，就要承受巴克曼的愤怒！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:931 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:933 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9180
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9203
msgid "Ash, and a smell of burned ogre laundry."
msgstr "灰烬，还有一股烧焦的食人妖衣物的气味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:930 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:932 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9184
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9207
msgid "The fort collapses in a heap of burning timbers and smoldering ash."
msgstr "堡垒在燃烧的木料和阴燃的灰烬中塌成一堆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:936 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9192
msgid "Graalg's strongbox. Graalg is your friend. Graalg would notice."
msgstr "格拉尔格的保险箱。格拉尔格是你们的朋友。格拉尔格会注意到的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:934 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9197
msgid "You search the fort and find 2 energy disks."
msgstr "你们搜查了堡垒，找到了 2 块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:943 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9218
msgid "Ash and blackened tent poles."
msgstr "灰烬和烧黑的帐篷杆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:942 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9224
msgid ""
"Smoke rises into the sky as you put the camp to the torch. Among the ashes, the tribe's small hoard of gold."
msgstr "当你们放火烧营地时，烟升向天空。灰烬中，是部落的一小堆金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:961 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9236
msgid "Empty sacks. Labelled."
msgstr "空袋子。贴着标签的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:962 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9237
msgid ""
"A heap of sacks behind the throne. Hobstadt is sitting in front of it, and looking at you."
msgstr "王座后面一堆袋子。霍布施塔特坐在它前面，看着你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:960 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9243
msgid ""
"Sacks of gold, each stamped THIEVES' GUILD. Nobody else labels their gold."
msgstr "一袋袋金子，每袋都盖着“盗贼公会”的印。没有别人会给自己的金子贴标签。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:956 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9250 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:121
msgid "Hobstadt falls across the foot of his throne. The throne is vacant."
msgstr "霍布施塔特倒在他的王座脚下。王座空着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:955 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9256
msgid "The dead thief has nothing else to say."
msgstr "死去的盗贼没有别的话可说了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:954 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9260
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: The Trolls have stolen our gold. Get it back no matter the cost!"
msgstr "一张盗贼公会信笺上的信息写着：致全体成员：巨魔偷走了我们的金子。无论代价如何，把它夺回来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:958 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:959 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9266
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9267
msgid "The throne is vacant."
msgstr "王座空着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:957 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9271
msgid ""
"Your troll sits on the throne of Hobstadt. It fits. He stands up a War Troll."
msgstr "你的巨魔坐在霍布施塔特的王座上。很合适。他站起来时已是一个战争巨魔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:953 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9277
msgid "You let yourselves down into the troll hole."
msgstr "你们顺着巨魔洞下去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:963 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9283
msgid ""
"Troll Juice. This stuff is poisonous, but the experience improves you."
msgstr "巨魔汁。这东西有毒，但这段经历让你变得更好。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:964 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9289
msgid "You have had enough Troll Juice for one lifetime."
msgstr "你们这辈子喝的巨魔汁已经够多了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:64 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:930
msgid ""
"You don't have enough Megacredits. Five. Craftsmen don't count in gold."
msgstr "你的巨额币不够。要五枚。工匠不收金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:975 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9302
msgid "Morgana is dead. Her robes keep glowing for a while, out of habit."
msgstr "摩根娜死了。她的长袍出于习惯，还亮了好一阵子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1121
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:976 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:978 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9309
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9321 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9857 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9869
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9881 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d4.lua:445
msgid "You have had your fill."
msgstr "你们已经喝够了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:977 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9314
msgid ""
"Orange Potion. It tastes of marmalade and arithmetic. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "橙色药水。尝起来像橘子酱和算术。（智力+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:979 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9326
msgid ""
"Purple Potion. Your feet are already halfway to the next room. (+2 Speed, permanent)"
msgstr "紫色药水。你的脚已经走到了下一个房间的一半。（速度+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:974 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9334
msgid "Xenoc falls, still in the middle of a sentence about his betters."
msgstr "克塞诺克倒下了，话还停在一句关于他的上级的话中间。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:934
msgid ""
"Every defensible piece of land needs a wall around it. I can have craftsmen and laborers working on your land for 5 King's Megacredits. Bring them and we'll start."
msgstr "每一块可防守的土地都需要一圈城墙。只需5枚国王巨额币，我就能让工匠和劳工在你的土地上干活。带来吧，我们就开工。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:987 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9341
msgid "Spoons, buckles, broken mirrors."
msgstr "勺子、搭扣、碎镜子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:988 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9342
msgid ""
"A nest of shiny things under the roost. Every gargoyle on the rocks above turns its head as you reach for it."
msgstr "栖木下一窝闪亮的东西。当你伸手去拿时，岩石上方的每只石像鬼都转过了头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:986 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9348
msgid ""
"In a nest of spoons, buckles and broken mirrors: a magnifying glass, with 'CALEB' scratched on the handle. Very small."
msgstr "在一堆勺子、搭扣和碎镜子的巢里：一个放大镜，柄上刻着“CALEB”。非常小。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:985 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9354
msgid "Rock dust. The gargoyles will have to sit somewhere else."
msgstr "岩石粉尘。石像鬼只能坐到别处去了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:984 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9357
msgid ""
"With great effort, you pound roosting rocks to powder and scatter the dust to the wind."
msgstr "你费力地把栖息的岩石砸成粉末，把尘土撒向风中。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:998 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:999 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9365
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9380
msgid "The People turn on you as one."
msgstr "众人齐齐转而攻击你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1001 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9371
msgid ""
"The People's hoard, under a lid three of you could not lift without a reason. Gurodel would notice."
msgstr "“族人”的宝藏，在一个没有理由你们三个人都抬不起来的盖子下面。古罗德尔会注意到的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:66 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:938
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I cannot do any work on land that you do not own! Buy some land and we'll talk."
msgstr "抱歉，我不能在不属于你的土地上施工！买下一块地，我们再谈。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1002 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9386
msgid ""
"A standing stone cut with the People's law, in letters a hand deep: ALAMAR'S PLANS WILL DESTROY ALL CREATURES ON DARKSIDE. NO SANE PEOPLE SUPPORT A TYRANT."
msgstr "一块刻着“族人”律法的立石，字有一掌深：阿拉玛的计划将毁灭暗面所有的生灵。没有理智的人会支持暴君。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:994 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9393
msgid "The bloody throne. Nothing left on it but the blood."
msgstr "血腥王座。上面什么都不剩了，只有血。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:995 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9397
msgid ""
"A throne of black wood, big enough for four of you. Gurodel would notice."
msgstr "一把黑木王座，大得能坐下你们四个。古罗德尔会注意到的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:996 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9402
msgid ""
"The bloody throne. Whatever the People had to give, they gave you in friendship."
msgstr "血腥王座。“族人”所能给的，他们都以友谊赠予了你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:997 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9410
msgid "You search the bloody throne and find two energy disks."
msgstr "你们搜查了血腥王座，找到了两块能量盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1000 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9419
msgid "We recognize you as enemies! Prepare to defend yourselves!"
msgstr "我们认出你们是敌人！准备自卫吧！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1031 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9426
msgid ""
"\"A fool and his money are soon parted.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“傻瓜和他的钱很快就会分开。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:67 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:943
msgid ""
"While building the rest of your castle, a worker came back from the tundra white as a sheet. The Golem Dungeon, by the lagoon, is stuffed with Megacredits, he says. And golems. Mostly golems."
msgstr "在修建你城堡的其余部分时，一个工人从冻原回来，脸白得像纸。他说，泻湖边的魔像地牢里塞满了巨额币。还有傀儡。主要是傀儡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1032 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9430
msgid ""
"\"A fool and his money are soon parted.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and you feel a little less of a fool. (+1 Intellect, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“傻瓜和他的钱很快就会分开。”书页自己填上了元音，你觉得自己没那么傻了。（智力+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1029 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9437
msgid ""
"\"Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“别去看赠马的牙口。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1030 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9441
msgid ""
"\"Don't look a gift horse in the mouth.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your eye settles on what matters. (+1 Accuracy, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“别去看赠马的牙口。”书页自己填上了元音，你的目光落在了重要的东西上。（准确+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1023 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9448
msgid ""
"\"He who laughs last, laughs best.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“笑到最后的人笑得最好。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1024 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9452
msgid ""
"\"He who laughs last, laughs best.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and somewhere below a knight laughs once, last. (+1 Personality, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“笑到最后的人笑得最好。”书页自己填上了元音，下面某处，一名骑士最后笑了一声。（个性+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1027 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9459
msgid ""
"\"Love of money is the root of all evil.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“爱财是万恶之根。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1028 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9463
msgid ""
"\"Love of money is the root of all evil.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and you feel fortune look kindly on a purse held loosely. (+1 Luck, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“爱财是万恶之根。”书页自己填上了元音，你感到命运善待松松握着的钱包。（运气+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1025 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9470
msgid ""
"\"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“多数人的需要胜过少数人的需要。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1026 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9474
msgid ""
"\"The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your arms feel ready to carry the many. (+1 Might, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“多数人的需要胜过少数人的需要。”书页自己填上了元音，你的手臂感觉准备好承担多数人了。（力量+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:948
msgid ""
"The workers have finished cleaning out the rubble and patching up the stone work. You should go inside and have a look around. Oh, one more thing. One of the workers swears the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors, out in the lagoon, is full of Megacredits. He won't go back for them. I thought you might."
msgstr ""
"工人们已经清理完废墟，并修补了石工。你们应该进去四处看看。哦，还有一件事。一个工人发誓，泻湖里的千重恐怖之墓里堆满了巨额币。他不肯再回去取。我想你们也许愿意。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1021 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9481
msgid ""
"\"Let sleeping dogs lie.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“让睡着的狗躺着。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1022 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9485
msgid ""
"\"Let sleeping dogs lie.\" The page fills in its own vowels as you watch, and you feel you could sleep through anything. (+1 Endurance, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“让睡着的狗躺着。”书页在你眼前自己填上了元音，你觉得自己能睡过任何事。（耐力+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1033 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9492
msgid ""
"\"If wishes were horses, beggars would ride.\" So say the Voweless Knights. You have all taken it to heart."
msgstr "“如果愿望是马，乞丐也会骑。”无元音骑士们这样说。你们都牢记在心。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1034 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9496
msgid ""
"\"If wishes were horses, beggars would ride.\" The page fills in its own vowels, and your feet feel like they have somewhere to be. (+1 Speed, permanent, for each of you new to the book)"
msgstr "“如果愿望是马，乞丐也会骑。”书页自己填上了元音，你的脚感觉有了去处。（速度+1，永久，对每个第一次读这本书的人）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1035 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9502
msgid "The book slams shut in disgust...your answer must have been wrong."
msgstr "书厌恶地啪地合上了……你们的答案一定错了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1016 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9509
msgid "An empty stand."
msgstr "一个空的底座。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1015 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9515
msgid ""
"A chalice of silver with white gold tracery, humming faintly. Nobody stops you taking it. Nobody says anything at all."
msgstr "一只银质圣杯，镶着白金花纹，微微嗡鸣。没人阻止你拿走它。没人说话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:952
msgid ""
"If you have enough Megacredits you should think about building up your castle. The King's engineers should be able to help you."
msgstr "如果你有足够的巨额币，应该考虑扩建你的城堡。国王的工程师应该能帮你。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1042 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1043 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9522
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9600
msgid "You're not worthy!"
msgstr "你不配！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1040 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9529
msgid "It feels so good!"
msgstr "感觉真好！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1041 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9534
msgid "You feel euphoric! (+1 to every statistic, permanent)"
msgstr "你们感到欣喜若狂！（所有属性 +1，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1018 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9541
msgid "The plaque of the Voweless Knights. Th nth s swrn."
msgstr "无元音骑士的牌匾。Th nth s swrn."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1019 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9542
msgid ""
"A plaque reads: \"In honor of the Grand Order of Voweless Knights\". The knights swear on the Chalice, and you have not got it."
msgstr "一块牌匾写着：“谨以此致敬无元音骑士大团”。骑士们对着圣杯起誓，而你们没有它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1017 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9552
msgid ""
"You set the Chalice before the plaque and say the oath, every word without a vowel. The knights come out of the walls. They say nothing, which you now understand as approval, and hand you two humming disks. The warriors among you leave as Black Knights and Villains."
msgstr ""
"你把圣杯放在牌匾前，念出誓言，每个词都不带元音。骑士们从墙里走出来。他们什么也没说，你现在明白这就是认可，并交给你们两个嗡鸣的能量盘。你们当中的战士离开时成为黑骑士和恶棍。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1020 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9560
msgid "The new member says the oath without a vowel, and the knights nod."
msgstr "新成员说出了无元音的誓言，骑士们点了点头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1037 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9567
msgid "You feel confused. (Drunk)"
msgstr "你们觉得头晕目眩。（醉酒）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1036 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9574
msgid "You feel depressed. (Afraid)"
msgstr "你们觉得郁闷。（恐惧）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1038 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9581
msgid "You feel heart broken. (Weak)"
msgstr "你们觉得心碎。（虚弱）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1039 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9588
msgid "You feel insane. (Insane)"
msgstr "你们觉得发疯。（疯狂）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1011 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9594
msgid "Over the door: \"Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts\"."
msgstr "门上写着：“Grnd rdr f Vwlss Knghts”。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:960
msgid ""
"Three places. The Temple of Yak in Rivercity's south woods. The Tomb of a Thousand Terrors in the lagoon. The Golem Dungeon in the tundra, by the lagoon. Evil people hoard Megacredits. Don't ask me why."
msgstr "三个地方。河城南面树林里的牦牛神庙。泻湖里的千重恐怖之墓。泻湖边冻原上的魔像地牢。邪恶之人囤积巨额币。别问我为什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1012 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9607
msgid "\"Very Good! Lv Lng nd prspr!\" The iron door beside you swings open."
msgstr "“Very Good! Lv Lng nd prspr!”你们身边的铁门荡开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1014 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9613
msgid "That's not why you are here! Study your lessons."
msgstr "你们来这里不是为了这个！去研习你们的功课。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1013 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9619
msgid "Have you learned nothing of the Voweless Knights? Begone!"
msgstr "你们对无元音骑士团一无所知吗？滚！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1059 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9626
msgid "Your intellect is already fantastic!"
msgstr "你们的智力已经很惊人了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:71 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:963
msgid ""
"King's Megacredits. The King mints them for his engineers, and somehow they all end up in evil places: the Temple of Yak, the Tomb of a Thousand Terrors and the Golem Dungeon. Fetch them; I build. Walls, keep and dungeon, five each."
msgstr ""
"国王巨额币。国王为他的工程师铸造，而它们不知怎么全都流落到邪恶之地：牦牛神庙、千重恐怖之墓和魔像地牢。去取来；我来建造。城墙、主堡和地牢，各五枚。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1060 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9631
msgid ""
"The Book of Fantastic Knowledge. You close it knowing a little more than you did, and suspecting a great deal more. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "《奇妙知识之书》。你合上它时知道得比之前多一点，怀疑得更多。（智力+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1055 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9640
msgid "The fountain removes all effects of unnatural aging."
msgstr "喷泉消除了一切非自然衰老的影响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1056 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9643
msgid ""
"The water is venom-green and smells of it. Thaddeus shakes his head at you from his door."
msgstr "水是毒绿色的，闻起来也是。萨迪厄斯从门口对你们摇头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1061 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9649
msgid ""
"A magic aura around the book pushes you back. The book answers to no one living."
msgstr "书周围的魔法光环把你推开。这本书不听任何活人的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1053 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9662
msgid "Loose wires where the disks were."
msgstr "圆盘原来所在的地方只剩下松散的电线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1052 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9667
msgid ""
"Disc. Two Energy Disks, wired into a mage's experiment that no longer needs them."
msgstr "圆盘。两个能量盘，接在一个法师不再需要它们的实验装置上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1054 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9678
msgid ""
"A letter sealed with Ellinger's mark, addressed 'To the Guildmaster of Sandcaster'. He left it where only those who could climb this tower would find it."
msgstr "一封盖着埃林格印记的信，收件人是“沙堡镇公会会长”。他把它放在只有能爬上这座塔的人才能找到的地方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1058 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9690
msgid ""
"Fountain of Minimal Abilities. Your statistics have increased! (+1 to every statistic, permanent)"
msgstr "最小能力之泉。你们的属性提升了！（所有属性+1，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:81 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:970
msgid ""
"The keep's up. Smith on the ground floor, a training hall above. Ebenezer says the workers have news. They're always finding something."
msgstr "主堡建成了。一楼是铁匠铺，楼上是训练厅。埃比尼泽说工人们有消息。他们总是在发现什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1070 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9705
msgid ""
"The lid swings up. Among the thieves' takings, a receipt: 'Paid in full. One jewel. Delivered to the Eastern Tower.'"
msgstr "盖子向上掀开。在盗贼的赃物中，有一张收据：“已全额付清。宝石一颗。已送往东塔。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1069 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9711
msgid "The gong booms three times and a door grinds open somewhere."
msgstr "铜锣响了三声，某处一扇门嘎吱打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1068 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9717
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: Ring each gong three times. Three's the charm. The Ali Baba chest's word is 'open sesame'. Do NOT write this down."
msgstr "一张盗贼公会信笺上的信息写着：致全体成员：每面铜锣敲三下。三是吉数。阿里巴巴箱子的口令是“open sesame”。千万别写下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1074 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9723
msgid "The strongroom is empty."
msgstr "金库是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1073 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9728
msgid ""
"Energy Disc. Two, wrapped in a thieves' guild invoice made out to nobody."
msgstr "能量盘。两个，用一张开给“无人”的盗贼公会发票包着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1072 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9734
msgid "The ledger. The prices are obscene."
msgstr "账本。价格高得离谱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1071 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9738
msgid ""
"Ledger. One (1) Griffin Statuette, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower. One (1) Dragon Statuette, sold to Head Witch of Lakeside. One (1) Pegasus Statuette, sold to Head Heretical Cleric. One (1) Jewel of Ages, sold to Mages of the Great Eastern Tower."
msgstr ""
"账本。狮鹫小雕像一尊（1），卖给大东塔的法师。巨龙小雕像一尊（1），卖给湖畔镇首领女巫。飞马小雕像一尊（1），卖给异端牧师头目。时代之宝一颗（1），卖给大东塔的法师。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1077 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9751
msgid "For the eyes of the prince only!"
msgstr "仅供王子过目！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1078 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9755
msgid "You know the Prince Book by heart. You learn nothing new."
msgstr "你已把王子之书背得滚瓜烂熟。没学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1079 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9760
msgid ""
"The Prince Book: the private rules of the Prince of Thieves, written for one reader. You read them, and your luck seems to read over your shoulder. (+2 Luck, permanent)"
msgstr "《王子之书》：盗贼王子的私人规则，只为一位读者而写。你读了，你的运气似乎在你肩头一起读。（运气+2，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1075 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9766
msgid ""
"The Manual of Master Thievery. Locks, lures, ledgers, and how to leave a room so that nobody remembers you were in it. You will remember it."
msgstr "《盗贼大师手册》。锁、诱饵、账本，以及如何离开一个房间而不让任何人记得你来过。你会记住它的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1076 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9772
msgid "You learn nothing new."
msgstr "你们没学到新东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:780 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9784
msgid "The bars lie in the alley. Nobody has put them back."
msgstr "铁栏躺在小巷里。没人把它们放回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:781 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9785
msgid "Old bars in old mortar. Someone inside is snoring."
msgstr "旧灰浆里的旧铁栏。里面有人在打鼾。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:779 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9790
msgid ""
"You wrench the bars out of the old mortar. Jasper squeezes through, says something grateful and muffled, and runs for his brother's house."
msgstr "你把铁栏从旧灰浆里拔出来。贾斯珀挤出去，说了句感激而含糊的话，跑向他哥哥的家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1087 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9807
msgid ""
"Statuette. A golden griffin in a mage's curio cabinet, labelled in a neat hand: 'Griffin, gold. Thaumic value: none. Bought anyway.'"
msgstr "小雕像。一尊金色狮鹫，放在法师的珍品柜里，用整齐的字迹标注：“狮鹫，金质。奥术价值：无。照买不误。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1093 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1094 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9821
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9822
msgid "Firewood, stacked by someone who cared about stacking."
msgstr "木柴，被一个在意堆放的人堆好了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1092 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/common/xeen_quests.lua:9828
msgid "Under the third log you find a heavy iron ring, warm to the touch."
msgstr "在第三根原木下面，你们找到一只沉重的铁环，摸上去是温的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/npc_topic_text.txt:1109
