#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d7.lua:763 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_d7.lua:776
msgid ""
"Wardoz the Blue: \"What would you pay for a powerful scarab that will protect you from electricity? 3 gems? 5? Nay, you are a customer of fine, discerning taste. For you, 8 gems! A customer of your quality would never pay less!\""
msgstr ""
"蓝衣瓦尔多兹：“你愿意为一只能防电击的强力圣甲虫付多少？3 颗宝石？5 颗？不，你是品味高雅、眼光挑剔的顾客。给你，8 颗宝石！你这样的顾客绝不会少付！”"

