#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:138
msgid ""
"You draw the rusty bolt. The grate above the ladder scrapes aside onto the drain's walk."
msgstr "你们拉开生锈的闩。梯子上方的栅栏刮擦着滑向一边，落在排水口的步道上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:150
