#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:149
msgid "+2 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr "+2 耐力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:160
msgid ""
"A gate guard who fell through the grate long ago. His purse is still on his belt: 150 gold."
msgstr "一名很久以前掉进栅栏的城门卫兵。他的钱袋还挂在腰带上：150 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:175
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:180
msgid "The grate is bolted from above. You hear the town over your head."
msgstr "栅栏从上面被闩住了。你们能听到头顶上小镇的声音。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:17
msgid ""
"THE CASTLEVIEW SEWER. The ladder from the square ends ankle-deep in something you decide is water. Down here the town's rats keep what they steal, Nadia's onyx necklace among it, in the nest of the Queen Rat they call Rooka. Four more shafts come down from the streets, their grates bolted from above: this hatch is the way back up."
msgstr ""
"堡景镇下水道。从广场下来的梯子在没过脚踝的某种东西里到了头，你们决定那是水。在这下面，镇上的老鼠把偷来的东西藏起来，娜迪亚的缟玛瑙项链也在其中，就在人称鲁卡的鼠后的窝里。街上还有四条竖井通下来，栅栏都从上面闩住了：这个舱口是回去的路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:187
msgid "Iron bar"
msgstr "铁闩"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:186
