msgstr "你们把铁闩放回栅栏上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:186
msgid ""
"You lift the iron bar out of its brackets. The grate swings free on the mill gorge."
msgstr "你们把铁闩从托架里抬出来。栅栏朝磨坊峡谷荡开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd01.lua:198
msgid "Red Liquid"
msgstr "红色液体"

