#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:76
msgid "Iron door"
msgstr "铁门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:299
msgid "The iron door is locked. The keyhole is cut for a heavy key."
msgstr "铁门锁着。锁孔是为一把沉重的钥匙开的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:307 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:312
msgid ""
"Tapestry. A procession of Mok priests winds round the tower, faded almost to grey. At its north end, half hidden by the cloth, a button."
msgstr "挂毯。一队莫克的祭司沿着塔绕了一圈，褪色得几乎成了灰色。在它的北端，被布半遮着，有一个按钮。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:317
msgid ""
"Click. A pressure plate, disarmed. Somebody here trusts you less than that."
msgstr "咔嗒。一块压力板，已解除。这里有人对你们的信任比这还少。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:32
msgid ""
"The Great Southern Tower. Someone has chalked a fresh mark on the inside of the door: the guild's sign."
msgstr "大南塔。有人在门内侧用粉笔画了一个新标记：公会的标志。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:322
msgid "Click. Another pressure plate. Nothing happens, this time."
msgstr "咔嗒。又一块压力板。这次什么也没发生。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:337 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:342 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:290
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:295
msgid "Roof trapdoor"
msgstr "屋顶活板门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:77
msgid "Click. The wall beside the tapestry is gone. An illusion!"
msgstr "咔嗒。挂毯旁的墙不见了。是幻象！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:81 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:83
msgid "Card table"
msgstr "牌桌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd06.lua:82
msgid "A card game left in the middle of a hand. Every hand holds five aces."
msgstr "一局打到一半的牌。每一手牌里都有五张 A。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:15
msgid ""
"The Great Eastern Tower. Far above, light falls down an open well; something hums up there."
msgstr "大东塔。高处，光线沿着一口敞开的井落下来；上面有什么东西在嗡鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:174
msgid "Fountain of Life"
msgstr "生命之泉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:173
msgid "Fountain of Life. The water closes your wounds."
msgstr "生命之泉。水合上了你们的伤口。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:180
msgid "Fountain of Minimal Abilities"
msgstr "最低能力之泉"

