msgid "Crystal ball"
msgstr "水晶球"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:196
msgid ""
"Lore books: 'On the Floating of Persons', 'Wells and their Uses', 'Against Stairs'."
msgstr "学问书：《论人的漂浮》《井及其用途》《反对楼梯》。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:20
msgid "Clouds, and under them a desert going on for ever."
msgstr "云层，云下是一片无穷无尽的沙漠。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:212 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:229
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:236
msgid "Ward pylon"
msgstr "结界塔柱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:207
msgid "The east pylon's crystal lies in shards."
msgstr "东塔柱的水晶碎成了片。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:234
msgid "You strike the crystal with all your strength."
msgstr "你们用尽全力击打水晶。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:225
msgid "The east pylon shatters. Its beam goes out."
msgstr "东塔柱碎裂了。它的光束熄灭了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:231
msgid "The west pylon's crystal lies in shards."
msgstr "西塔柱的水晶碎成了片。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:249
msgid "The west pylon shatters. Its beam goes out."
msgstr "西塔柱碎裂了。它的光束熄灭了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:25
msgid "A dark sun over a dark land."
msgstr "黑暗大地上的一轮黑暗太阳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:56
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:64
msgid "Bubbling Vat"
msgstr "冒泡的大缸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:254
msgid ""
"The Bubbling Vat. It smells of copper and burnt sugar. Nobody is drinking from it."
msgstr "冒泡的大缸。它有铜和烧焦糖的气味。没人从里面喝。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:264
msgid "Door of light"
msgstr "光之门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:260
msgid ""
"A wall of light hums in the doorway. Two beams feed it, from the west and from the east."
msgstr "一堵光墙在门口嗡鸣。两道光束供给着它，一道来自西边，一道来自东边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:277
msgid "In the vault's doorway the wall of light flickers and fades."
msgstr "在金库门口，光墙闪烁着消退了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:30
msgid "Your own faces, looking back, a little older."
msgstr "你们自己的脸，回望着你们，老了一点点。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:56
msgid "Book of Fantastic Knowledge"
msgstr "奇妙知识之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:59 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:61
msgid "Book of Great Power"
msgstr "大能之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:65
msgid ""
"Labels in a neat hand: 'Toad, two-headed. Thaumic value: considerable.' The toad is long gone."
msgstr "整洁字迹的标签：“蟾蜍，双头。魔法价值：可观。”蟾蜍早就没了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:70
msgid ""
"Labels: 'Feather, phoenix (doubtful).' 'Tooth, unknown.' 'Rock.' Nothing worth taking."
msgstr "标签：“羽毛，凤凰的（存疑）。”“牙齿，不明。”“石头。”没什么值得拿的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:92
msgid "The disc does not answer from below."
msgstr "圆盘不回应下方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd07.lua:97
msgid "The disc hums and drifts along the well."
msgstr "圆盘嗡鸣着，沿着井漂移。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:182
msgid "Chapter hall"
msgstr "会议厅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:19
msgid ""
"The Northern Tower of the Voweless Knights. Bosco's Chalice is kept at the top, where a voice asks what you seek."
msgstr "无元音骑士团的北塔。博斯科圣杯收藏在塔顶，那里有个声音会问你们寻找什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:202
msgid "An iron door with no handle and no lock. Beside it, the mask waits."
msgstr "一道没有把手也没有锁的铁门。旁边，面具在等待。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:241
msgid "Exit the Knight's Tower"
msgstr "离开骑士塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:259
msgid "You take the helm from its peg."
msgstr "你们从挂钩上取下了头盔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:279
msgid "You take the black plate from its stand."
msgstr "你们从架子上取下了黑色铠甲。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:29
msgid ""
"A note under the pillow reads:  In life, to appreciate the highs one must experience the lows."
msgstr "枕头下的一张字条写着：人生在世，要欣赏高处，就必须经历低处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:316
msgid "Swear the Voweless oath?"
msgstr "立下无元音誓言？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:320 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:322
msgid "Pulpit"
msgstr "讲坛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:321
msgid "The silent reader's pulpit. Nobody reads here: the book is gone."
msgstr "沉默读者的讲坛。这里没人读书：书不见了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:340
msgid "You lift the shield from its hooks."
msgstr "你们把盾牌从挂钩上取下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:345
msgid ""
"A plaque reads:\n"
"\"In honor of the Grand Order of Voweless Knights\""
msgstr ""
"一块牌匾写着：\n"
"“谨以此纪念无元音骑士团大团”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:349 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:351 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:354
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:356 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:369 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:371
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:376
msgid "Emotion Throne"
msgstr "情绪王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:361
msgid "Throne of the Dunce"
msgstr "蠢材王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:366
msgid "Euphoria Throne"
msgstr "欣快王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:379 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:397
msgid "Mask"
msgstr "面具"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:382
msgid "The mask is silent."
msgstr "面具默不作声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd08.lua:395
msgid ""
"A disembodied voice thunders through your brain, \"What do you seek?\"\n"
"Wht d y sk?"
msgstr ""
"一个没有形体的声音在你们脑中轰鸣：“你们寻求什么？”\n"
"Wht d y sk?"

