#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd09.lua:19
msgid ""
"THE TEMPLE OF BARK. The round door shuts behind you on the bark glade. Inside the great tree the air is warm and smells of sap and orc. Shaalth's orcs hold the old temple, and somewhere in it Princess Sheewana, the sprites' sister. This door is the way back out."
msgstr ""
"树皮神庙。圆门在你们身后关上，把树皮林间空地隔在外面。大树里面空气温暖，有树汁和兽人的味道。沙尔斯的兽人占据着古老的神庙，神庙里某处还有希瓦娜公主，小精灵们的姐妹。这扇门是回去的路。"

