#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10a.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE GEMSTONE MINES. Old timber, cart rails and the smell of wet stone. The gemsmiths in the vale make gear from five rocks of a kind, and the west pocket's veins still show red and green: one rock to a vein. Mind the far drift. Something has been spinning there."
msgstr ""
"宝石矿。老木头、矿车轨道和湿石头的气味。山谷里的宝石匠用五块同种的矿石打造装备，西边矿袋的矿脉仍然泛着红和绿：一条矿脉一块矿石。当心远处的岔道。那里有什么东西一直在织网。"

