#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE GEMSTONE MINES, EAST POCKET. Timber, rails and, somewhere deep down, a hum in the rock. Toby the sapphire smith wants five rocks; the veins give one each. They say the God of Minerals lives at the bottom, and that he likes gold."
msgstr "宝石矿，东矿袋。木头、轨道，还有深处岩石里传来的嗡鸣声。蓝宝石匠托比要五块矿石；矿脉每条只给一块。据说矿物之神住在底下，而且他喜欢金子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:166
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:173
msgid "Gem maker's throne"
msgstr "造宝石者的王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:167 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:172
msgid "The throne hums. It was not made for you."
msgstr "王座嗡嗡作响。它不是为你们造的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:21
msgid "An ore cart heaped with spoil. Somebody meant to come back for it."
msgstr "一辆堆满废料的矿车。有人本打算回来取它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:51
msgid "Cold air, old timber, a hum in the rock."
msgstr "冷空气、老木头，还有岩石里的嗡鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:113
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:134
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:149
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:60 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:68
msgid "Sapphire vein"
msgstr "蓝宝石矿脉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:67 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:112
msgid "A gem exploded!"
msgstr "一颗宝石爆炸了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:71
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:73
msgid "God of Minerals"
msgstr "矿物之神"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10b.lua:81
msgid ""
"A voice like grinding stone: \"I am the god of these mountains. If you give me 10,000 of your gold pieces, I will use them to replenish the gems inside the mountains.\""
msgstr "一个像磨石摩擦的声音：“我是这些山的神。如果你们给我 10,000 金币，我就用它们补充山里的宝石。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:101
msgid "Hot air, black rock, the tick of cooling lava."
msgstr "热空气、黑岩石，还有熔岩冷却时的滴答声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:133
msgid "Rubble from a fallen roof. Nothing under it but more rock."
msgstr "塌落屋顶的碎石。下面除了更多石头什么也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:144
msgid "Empty egg cases"
msgstr "空蛋壳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE GEMSTONE MINES, NORTH POCKET. Heat breathes out of the rock, and somewhere ahead lava ticks as it cools. Hector the diamond smith wants five diamond rocks; the veins give one each. Few who come here go back, they say."
msgstr ""
"宝石矿，北矿袋。热气从岩石里呼出，前方某处熔岩在冷却时滴答作响。钻石匠赫克托要五块钻石矿石；矿脉每条只给一块。据说来到这里的人很少有回去的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:25
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:37 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:46
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:49 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:58 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:61
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:73 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:82
msgid "Diamond vein"
msgstr "钻石矿脉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:33 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:45 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:57
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd10c.lua:81
msgid "You work a diamond rock out of the vein."
msgstr "你们从矿脉里撬出一块钻石矿石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:12
msgid ""
"You land on a mound of earth and old bones. Daylight is far above, and the pit's walls are too sheer to climb."
msgstr "你们落在一堆泥土和旧骨头上。日光远在上方，坑壁太陡，爬不上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:18
msgid "You put your shoulders to the boulder, and it rolls aside."
msgstr "你们用肩膀顶住巨石，它滚到了一边。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:29 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd18.lua:50
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd18.lua:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:48
msgid "Bag"
msgstr "袋子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:16
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:18
msgid "Log door"
msgstr "原木门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:37 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:100
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:83 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:85 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:88
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:93 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:95
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:98
msgid "Expired Adventurer"
msgstr "死去的冒险者"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:45
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:47 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:99
msgid "Sod hatch"
msgstr "草皮舱口"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:52
msgid ""
"Carcasses hang from root hooks: a deer, a wolf, and something with too many legs."
msgstr "尸体挂在根钩上：一只鹿、一匹狼，还有一个腿太多的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:61
msgid ""
"Bones, dented helms, a single boot: everything the trolls have eaten, heaped up the wall."
msgstr "骨头、凹陷的头盔、一只靴子：巨魔吃掉的所有东西，沿着墙堆了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:67
msgid "Dead thief"
msgstr "死去的盗贼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11a.lua:72
msgid "Wicker gate"
msgstr "柳条门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:108
msgid ""
"A sunken vat of fungus, grubs and water bubbles in the cave. Skulls lie about for cups."
msgstr "洞穴里，一口下沉的大缸里，菌类、蛆和水在冒泡。头骨散落四处当杯子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:12
msgid ""
"You land on a heap of torn packs and a snapped rope. Others fell in here before you."
msgstr "你们落在一堆撕破的背包和一根断绳上。在你们之前还有别人掉进过这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:33 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:76
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:78 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:128
msgid "Hide flap"
msgstr "兽皮门帘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:41
msgid ""
"Tooth marks score the roots. Far ahead the floor turns to wet clay and falls away into the dark."
msgstr "牙印刻满了树根。前方不远，地面变成湿黏土，坠入黑暗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:60
msgid "Troll Juice"
msgstr "巨魔汁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:59
msgid "+2 Endurance (permanent). You are poisoned."
msgstr "+2 耐力（永久）。你们中毒了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:68
msgid ""
"You slide down the wet clay onto a ledge. There is no climbing back up that way."
msgstr "你们顺着湿黏土滑到一块岩架上。那条路没法再爬回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:72 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:75
msgid "Fallen root"
msgstr "倒下的树根"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:74
msgid "You heave the fallen root up out of the way."
msgstr "你们把倒下的树根举起来挪开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:78 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:80
msgid "Thief's satchel"
msgstr "盗贼的挎包"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11b.lua:79
msgid ""
"A message on thieves' guild letterhead reads: To all members: Troll holes located by the Forbidden Fruit hut, by the dead adventurer's pack, and the wide one near the rim. The wide one is the King's."
msgstr "盗贼公会信笺上的一条信息写着：致全体会员：巨魔洞位于禁果小屋旁、死去冒险者的背包旁，还有边缘附近那个宽的。宽的那个是国王的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:127
msgid "Sacks"
msgstr "麻袋"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:466
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:468 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:499 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:501
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:572 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:586
msgid "Throne"
msgstr "王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:134
msgid ""
"Hobstadt stands before his throne with his club raised. He is done talking."
msgstr "霍布施塔特举着棍棒站在他的王座前。他不想再说话了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:136
msgid ""
"A throne of stacked boulders. Hobstadt stands before it and watches you."
msgstr "一把巨石垒成的王座。霍布施塔特站在它前面，注视着你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:143
msgid "Trophies"
msgstr "战利品"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:142
msgid "Hides, dented shields and helms of the fallen, nailed to the roots."
msgstr "兽皮、凹陷的盾牌和阵亡者的头盔，钉在树根上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:31
msgid ""
"You land in the widest of the pits. Ahead, two great log doors carved with troll faces stand open."
msgstr "你们落在最宽的那个坑里。前方，两扇刻着巨魔脸的大原木门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:59
msgid ""
"The air turns bitter. Through cracks in the floor you see stars, far below."
msgstr "空气变得苦涩。透过地板的裂缝，你们看见远在下方的星星。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:72
msgid "The court roars. Every troll under the forest is your enemy now."
msgstr "朝堂怒吼起来。森林之下所有巨魔现在都是你们的敌人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:89
msgid ""
"The two trolls at the doors lean on their clubs and watch you pass. Nobody stops you."
msgstr "门口的两个巨魔拄着棍棒，看着你们走过。没人拦你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:11 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:9
msgid "Antler door"
msgstr "鹿角门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:93 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd11c.lua:96
msgid "Log doors"
msgstr "原木门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:109
msgid "Sparrow of Speed"
msgstr "疾速麻雀"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:108
msgid ""
"Sparrow of Speed. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Speed (permanent)."
msgstr "疾速麻雀。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 速度（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:119
msgid "Parrot of Prophecy"
msgstr "预言鹦鹉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:118
msgid ""
"Parrot of Prophecy. You set it free, and it sings from the rafters: His nights were filled with evil dreams, his days were spent in wicked schemes. You must destroy that wicked fiend before he controls all of XEEN!"
msgstr "预言鹦鹉。你们放了它，它在椽子上唱道：他的夜晚充满恶梦，他的白昼耗于阴谋。你们必须在他控制整个辛恩之前，消灭那个邪恶的恶魔！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:131
msgid "Parakeet of Personality"
msgstr "个性长尾鹦鹉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:130
msgid ""
"Parakeet of Personality. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Personality (permanent)."
msgstr "个性长尾鹦鹉。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 个性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:143
msgid "Magpie of Might"
msgstr "力量喜鹊"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:14
msgid ""
"The statue reads: This dungeon stand as tribute to me, my name in walls for all to see."
msgstr "雕像上写着：这座地牢是对我的致敬，我的名字刻在墙里，人人可见。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:142
msgid ""
"Magpie of Might. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Might (permanent)."
msgstr "力量喜鹊。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 力量（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:155
msgid "Albatross of Accuracy"
msgstr "准确信天翁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:154
msgid ""
"Albatross of Accuracy. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Accuracy (permanent)."
msgstr "准确信天翁。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 准确（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/items.txt:209 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:160
msgid "Songbird of Serenity"
msgstr "宁静之歌鸟"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:761
msgid "The cage does not move. The Songbird is still caged."
msgstr "笼子纹丝不动。歌鸟还关在笼子里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:179
msgid "The cage does not move. Far below, something sings."
msgstr "笼子纹丝不动。远在下方，有什么东西在歌唱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:187
msgid "The cage climbs the long shaft to you."
msgstr "笼子沿着长长的竖井升到你们这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:19
msgid ""
"The statue reads: The Soul Maze inside is dark, dreary, and vast. The name found within is the clue to my past."
msgstr "雕像上写着：里面的灵魂迷宫黑暗、阴郁而辽阔。在其中发现的名字，就是我过去的线索。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:220 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:832
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:836
msgid "Horned throne"
msgstr "长角王座"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:237 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:273
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:291
msgid "The dial turns. It is set at 1."
msgstr "转盘转动了。它设在 1。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:24
msgid ""
"The statue reads: Long have I traveled through deep, dark space, only to land and take over this place."
msgstr "雕像上写着：我在深邃黑暗的太空中长久旅行，只为降落并占领此地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:240 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:258 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:276
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:294
msgid "The dial turns. It is set at 4."
msgstr "转盘转动了。它设在 4。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:243 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:261 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:279
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:297
msgid "The dial turns. It is set at 3."
msgstr "转盘转动了。它设在 3。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:246 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:264 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:282
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:300
msgid "The dial turns. It is set at 2."
msgstr "转盘转动了。它设在 2。"

