#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:707
msgid "The lever moves. Iron grinds: the Reserve's portcullis rises."
msgstr "拉杆动了。铁器磨响：私藏的吊闸升起来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:736 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:742
msgid "Minotaur's Private Reserve"
msgstr "牛头人私藏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:738
msgid "The portcullis does not budge."
msgstr "吊闸纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:747
msgid "The cage does not move."
msgstr "笼子纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:755
msgid "The cage sinks into the dark."
msgstr "笼子沉入黑暗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:85
msgid "Lark of Luck"
msgstr "运气云雀"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:769
msgid "The cage climbs the long shaft to the tower."
msgstr "笼子沿着长长的竖井升到塔里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:799
msgid "The lever moves! Water gushes into the basin."
msgstr "拉杆动了！水涌进水盆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:804 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:813
msgid ""
"The statue speaks: All of the lost souls in this dungeon have become lost because they did not think positively. If you wish to stay found... Think Positive!"
msgstr "雕像开口了：这座地牢里所有失魂的灵魂，之所以失魂，是因为他们不曾积极思考。如果你想保持不失魂……就积极思考！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:818
msgid ""
"The statue's plinth reads: Turn all dials up, pull lever & drink the souls of adventurers past!"
msgstr "雕像基座上写着：把所有转盘拨到上，拉动拉杆，饮下往昔冒险者的灵魂！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:823 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:828
msgid ""
"A plaque on the plinth reads: Start from the North and go to the South; third from the top and far to the East pull the lever you suspected least."
msgstr "基座上的牌匾写着：从北到南开始，从上数第三个，远在东边，拉动你最没想到的那根拉杆。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:84
msgid ""
"Lark of Luck. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Luck (permanent)."
msgstr "运气云雀。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 运气（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:853
msgid "Somewhere a panel grinds open."
msgstr "某处，一块嵌板磨响着打开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:88 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:97
msgid "Eagle of Endurance"
msgstr "耐力雄鹰"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd12.lua:96
msgid ""
"Eagle of Endurance. You set it free. In gratitude, the bird flutters around the party and sings its magic song. +2 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr "耐力雄鹰。你们放了它。出于感激，小鸟绕着队伍飞舞，唱起了它的魔法之歌。+2 耐力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:186
msgid "Broken disk case"
msgstr "破碎的盘盒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:185
msgid ""
"A disk case of Sardaj beadwork, smashed open and empty. Scratched into its lid in a big ogre hand: \"We are Ogres! We take what we want. Yesterday, we took the Sardaj's Energy disks!\""
msgstr ""
"一只萨尔达珠串工艺的盘盒，被砸开了，空空如也。盖子上用大大的食人妖笔迹划着：“我们是食人妖！我们想拿什么就拿什么。昨天，我们拿走了萨尔达的能量盘！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:248
msgid "Graalg's hall: a bigger fire, a seat of antlers. Nobody is home."
msgstr "格拉尔格的大厅：一堆更大的火，一把鹿角椅。没人在家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:257
msgid ""
"A timber hall round a fire pit, hides on the walls, a long table of stolen plates. Nobody is home."
msgstr "一座围着火坑的木厅，墙上挂着兽皮，一张长桌摆满偷来的盘子。没人在家。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:266
msgid "The ogres' kennel. Sabertooths lift their heads from the gnawed logs."
msgstr "食人妖的犬舍。剑齿虎从啃过的原木上抬起头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:270 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:305 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:308
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:351 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:56
msgid "Fire pit"
msgstr "火坑"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:296 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:342
msgid "You leave the fort standing, for now."
msgstr "你们暂且没动堡垒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:303 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:349
msgid "You've found an Ogre fort, but the Ogres are out hunting. Burn?"
msgstr "你们发现了一座食人妖堡垒，但食人妖们出去打猎了。要烧吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:304 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:350
msgid "Burn (Yes/No)?"
msgstr "烧（是/否）？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:359
msgid ""
"A long tunnel shored with timber. Cart wheels rumble overhead: the pass road runs above you."
msgstr "一条用木头加固的长隧道。头顶上传来车轮的隆隆声：山口路就在你们上方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:363 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:365
msgid "Graalg's seat"
msgstr "格拉尔格的座位"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:364
msgid ""
"Graalg's seat, a heap of antlers and bones. Above it a fat purse of Alamar's gold hangs on a hook, nailed there for every ogre to see."
msgstr "格拉尔格的座位，一堆鹿角和骨头。上方的挂钩上挂着一只鼓鼓的阿拉玛金币钱袋，钉在那里让每个食人妖都能看见。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd13.lua:594
msgid ""
"Ogre Pass: a fort of the ogres on its knoll, timber and hides inside a log palisade, and another across the road joined to it under the pass. Kramer pays for burned forts; Graalg keeps what he takes in his own quarters in the east fort."
msgstr ""
"食人妖山口：山丘上有一座食人妖的堡垒，原木栅栏里是木头和兽皮，路对面还有一座，在山口下与它相连。克拉默出钱烧堡垒；格拉尔格把抢来的东西放在东堡自己的住处。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:10
msgid ""
"The altar cloth is embroidered with a black bat. The altar faces the wrong way."
msgstr "祭坛布上绣着一只黑蝙蝠。祭坛的朝向不对。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:105
msgid "Countess Blackfang"
msgstr "布莱克方女伯爵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:118
msgid "Dutchess Blackfang"
msgstr "布莱克方公爵夫人"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:130
msgid ""
"The lid flies back and a vampire rises from the coffin! Grave goods: a purse of old coins. (+500 gold)"
msgstr "盖子弹开，一个吸血鬼从棺材里升起！陪葬品：一袋旧钱币。（+500 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:131
msgid "Lady Blackfang"
msgstr "布莱克方夫人"

