#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:50 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:52 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:55
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:57
msgid "Coffin"
msgstr "棺材"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:14 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:28
msgid "Griffin's perch"
msgstr "狮鹫栖木"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:141
msgid "A few coins pressed into the dead wood. (+200 gold)"
msgstr "几枚钱币压进枯木里。（+200 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:154
msgid ""
"The lid flies back and a vampire rises from the coffin! Under the sleeper, a purse. (+350 gold)"
msgstr "盖子弹开，一个吸血鬼从棺材里升起！沉睡者身下有一只钱袋。（+350 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:189
msgid "A purse of old coins under the shroud. (+250 gold)"
msgstr "裹尸布下有一袋旧钱币。（+250 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:202
msgid ""
"The lid flies back and a vampire rises from the coffin! Under the sleeper, a purse. (+300 gold)"
msgstr "盖子弹开，一个吸血鬼从棺材里升起！沉睡者身下有一只钱袋。（+300 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:24
msgid "A griffin's perch, empty."
msgstr "一根狮鹫栖木，空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:243
msgid "A purse of coins and a dried rose. (+400 gold)"
msgstr "一袋钱币和一朵干玫瑰。（+400 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:260
msgid "Loot hidden in a coffin: a heap of gold and a ring. (+1500 gold)"
msgstr "藏在棺材里的赃物：一堆金子和一枚戒指。（+1500 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:27
msgid "Are you ready to leave this awful place, friends?"
msgstr "朋友们，准备好离开这个可怕的地方了吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:282
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:284
msgid "Blackfang's arms"
msgstr "布莱克方的纹章"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:278 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:283
msgid "A black bat with one red fang on slate grey: the arms of Blackfang."
msgstr "石板灰底上一只黑蝙蝠，长着一颗红色尖牙：布莱克方的纹章。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:350
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:356
msgid "Fire leaps from a slit in the merlons!"
msgstr "火焰从垛口的缝隙里蹿出来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:375
msgid "The trapdoor lies open over a ladder."
msgstr "活板门敞开着，盖在梯子上方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:378
msgid "A trapdoor in the floor, bolted from below."
msgstr "地板上有一道活板门，从下面闩住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:384
msgid "The bolt is drawn; the trapdoor lies open."
msgstr "闩已拉开；活板门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:390
msgid "You draw the bolt. The trapdoor at the ladder's top falls open."
msgstr "你们拉开门闩。梯子顶端的活板门掉开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:394 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:402
msgid "Jewel box"
msgstr "珠宝盒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:396
msgid "The jewel box is empty."
msgstr "珠宝盒是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:401
msgid ""
"The Countess's jewel box: rings and a jet brooch. No mirror anywhere. (+800 gold)"
msgstr "女伯爵的珠宝盒：几枚戒指和一枚黑玉胸针。哪里都没有镜子。（+800 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:406
msgid ""
"You find a page of notes in the bones: Coffins contain treasure and vampires. Floor traps are regularly spaced. Remember to get Sorcerer to Jump us over them. The Count's magic keeps us from descending. Be sure to kill him when we get a chance."
msgstr ""
"你们在骨头里发现一页笔记：棺材里有宝藏也有吸血鬼。地板陷阱间隔均匀。记得让术士带我们跳过去。伯爵的魔法让我们没法下去。一有机会一定要杀了他。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:411
msgid ""
"The Count's ledger. The last entry reads: 'Received from Lord Xeen's man: one queen, crowned. Crown kept by her people. No matter.'"
msgstr "伯爵的账本。最后一条写着：“收到辛恩领主的手下送来：女王一名，已加冕。王冠由她的子民保管。无妨。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:415 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:417
msgid "The Blackfang Lineage"
msgstr "布莱克方家谱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:416
msgid ""
"The Blackfang Lineage, in a dry hand: four names are copied out large on the last page, with a line for each coffin in the family crypt: Dutchess Blackfang, Countess Blackfang, Count Blackfang, Lady Blackfang."
msgstr ""
"布莱克方家谱，字迹干涩：最后一页大大地抄着四个名字，每个名字对应家族墓室里的一口棺材：布莱克方公爵夫人、布莱克方女伯爵、布莱克方伯爵、布莱克方夫人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:420 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:422
msgid "Portraits"
msgstr "肖像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:421
msgid ""
"Four centuries of Blackfangs. In every portrait the mirror behind the sitter shows an empty chair."
msgstr "四个世纪的布莱克方。每幅肖像里，坐着的人身后的镜子里都是一把空椅子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:427
msgid "The cell is empty. The Queen has gone home."
msgstr "牢房是空的。女王回家了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:430
msgid "A stone bench."
msgstr "一条石凳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:435
msgid ""
"You find a diary in the bones, but it has mostly been devoured by rats. None of what remains is legible."
msgstr "你们在骨头里发现一本日记，但大部分被老鼠啃掉了。剩下的没有一处能辨认。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:50
msgid "Black iron bar"
msgstr "黑铁闩"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:440
msgid "A trapdoor in the roof, bolted from above. Wind howls over it."
msgstr "屋顶上有道活板门，从上面闩住了。风在上面呼啸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:454
msgid "The panel stands open."
msgstr "嵌板敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:457
msgid ""
"The panel is set fast in the wall. Somewhere above, something must move it."
msgstr "嵌板牢牢嵌在墙里。上面某处肯定有什么东西能移动它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:46
msgid "The bar is lifted; the stair lies open."
msgstr "铁闩抬起了；楼梯敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:461 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:463
msgid "Long table"
msgstr "长桌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:462
msgid "Goblets laid for a feast. They have never held wine."
msgstr "为盛宴摆好的高脚杯。它们从没盛过葡萄酒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:467
msgid "A throne of black stone. The seat is cold."
msgstr "一把黑石王座。座位是冷的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:473
msgid ""
"You find a diary in the bones: ...entering the black castle today. The Queen is captive somewhere within its walls, and we must remain inside the castle 'til nightfall or she would surely die once we brought her into the light. ..."
msgstr ""
"你们在骨头里发现一本日记：……今天要进入黑城堡了。女王被囚禁在城墙内的某处，我们必须待在城堡里直到夜幕降临，否则一旦把她带到光里，她必死无疑。……"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:478
msgid ""
"You find a diary in the bones: ...entering the black castle today. The Queen is captive somewhere within its walls, and we must remain inside the castle 'til nightfall or she would surely die once we brought her into the light. ... Beside it, a purse. (+300 gold)"
msgstr ""
"你们在骨头里发现一本日记：……今天要进入黑城堡了。女王被囚禁在城墙内的某处，我们必须待在城堡里直到夜幕降临，否则一旦把她带到光里，她必死无疑。……旁边有一只钱袋。（+300 金币）"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:482 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:491 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd07.lua:108
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd07.lua:98
msgid "Bar"
msgstr "横杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:484
msgid "The bar is lifted; the gate stands open."
msgstr "铁闩抬起了；大门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:490
msgid "You lift the bar. The gate swings up onto the landing."
msgstr "你们抬起铁闩。大门向上荡到平台上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:496 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd17.lua:322 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_p1.lua:21
msgid "The gate stands open."
msgstr "大门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:499
msgid "The gate is barred on the courtyard side."
msgstr "大门在庭院一侧被闩住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:504
msgid ""
"You find a diary in the bones: 1/9/753: Kloikus Thunbeard the Round came to a bad end today. He was struggling up a ladder in his ridiculous armor when one of those vampires grabbed for his ankles through a hole in the wall. He fell a good forty feet."
msgstr ""
"你们在骨头里发现一本日记：1/9/753：圆滚滚的克洛伊库斯·雷须今天死得很惨。他穿着可笑的盔甲费力地爬梯子，一只吸血鬼从墙洞里抓住了他的脚踝。他摔了足足四十英尺。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:64
msgid "Wine. The cask is nearly dry."
msgstr "葡萄酒。酒桶快空了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:69
msgid ""
"Wine. Real wine. Somebody here still drinks it. A purse is tucked behind the cask. (+150 gold)"
msgstr "葡萄酒。真正的葡萄酒。这里还有人喝。酒桶后面塞着一只钱袋。（+150 金币）"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:11 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:9 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:10
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:8
