msgid "Count Blackfang"
msgstr "布莱克方伯爵"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd14.lua:99
msgid ""
"Count Blackfang's own coffin, lined with black silk. His strongbox stands at its foot."
msgstr "布莱克方伯爵自己的棺材，铺着黑丝绸。他的保险箱立在棺脚。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:108
msgid "The gilded cage climbs the shaft to you."
msgstr "镀金吊笼升到你们这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:13 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:20 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:27
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:41
msgid "The pad sets you down in the pad hall."
msgstr "踏板把你们放在踏板大厅里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:147
msgid "Bedchamber"
msgstr "寝宫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:174
msgid "Information"
msgstr "问讯处"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:182 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:184
msgid "Overseer's Office"
msgstr "监工办公室"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:189
msgid "Reception"
msgstr "接待处"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:192 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:195
msgid "Visitor's Atrium"
msgstr "访客中庭"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd24.lua:32
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd24.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:93 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:96
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:135
msgid "Great doors"
msgstr "大门"

# imported from terms.mm7.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:232
msgid "Vault"
msgstr "金库"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:228
msgid "The vault door is locked. Eight numbers bolt it."
msgstr "金库门锁着。八个数字闩着它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:237
msgid "Exit the Great Pyramid"
msgstr "离开大金字塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:263 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:266 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:269
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:275 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:278
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:281 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:287
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:290 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:296
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:302 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:305
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:308 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd02.lua:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd02.lua:121
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd02.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_fd02.lua:132
msgid "Niche"
msgstr "壁龛"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:311 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:313
msgid "Note"
msgstr "纸条"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:318
msgid "The glyph of the bird flares beneath you, and the hall is gone."
msgstr "你们脚下鸟的符号亮起，大厅消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:325
msgid "The second bird flares beneath you."
msgstr "第二只鸟在你们脚下亮起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:332
msgid "The glyph of the eye flares beneath you, and the hall is gone."
msgstr "你们脚下眼睛的符号亮起，大厅消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:337 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:339
msgid "The Overseer's map"
msgstr "监工的地图"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:344
msgid "The glyph of the scarab flares beneath you, and the hall is gone."
msgstr "你们脚下圣甲虫的符号亮起，大厅消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:351
msgid "The glyph of the sun flares beneath you, and the hall is gone."
msgstr "你们脚下太阳的符号亮起，大厅消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:356 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:137
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:144
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:149
msgid "Weapon rack"
msgstr "武器架"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:363
msgid "Among the guards' rusted spears, one weapon is worth taking."
msgstr "守卫们生锈的长矛中，有一件武器值得拿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:367 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:383
msgid "Registry door"
msgstr "登记处的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:374
msgid "Incorrect!"
msgstr "错误！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:378
msgid "The registry door stands open."
msgstr "登记处的门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:381
msgid ""
"A bronze door with a lock of numbered keys. Above it, in raised letters: STARFLEET REGISTRY NUMBER NCC."
msgstr "一道青铜门，锁是编号按键的。上方凸起的字母：STARFLEET REGISTRY NUMBER NCC."

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:382
msgid "NCC 1701"
msgstr "NCC 1701"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:382
msgid "NCC-1701"
msgstr "NCC-1701"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:382
msgid "Registry?"
msgstr "注册号？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:410
msgid "The gilded cage sinks to the grand stair."
msgstr "镀金吊笼沉到大楼梯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:424
msgid "The gilded cage climbs to the Pharaoh's apartments."
msgstr "镀金吊笼升到法老的寝殿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:448 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:453
msgid "Wall Safe"
msgstr "墙内保险箱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:48
msgid "Ornate Bed"
msgstr "华丽的床"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd15.lua:463
msgid ""
"A jar of embalming salts, and a purse the embalmers hid under it. (+400 gold)"
msgstr "一罐防腐盐，还有防腐师藏在下面的一只钱袋。（+400 金币）"

