#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:19
msgid ""
"THE WIZARD QUARTER. Beyond the guild gate, a court of rose-coloured stone under a dimming sky. To the west, the Mirage Guild, where Xenoc the Wizard holds court; to the east, the Sorceress HQ, Morgana's house. Astra wants them both defeated. The gate behind you is the way back to Sandcaster."
msgstr ""
"巫师区。公会大门之外，是一座玫瑰色石头的庭院，天空渐暗。西边是幻影公会，巫师克塞诺克在那里开庭；东边是女术士总部，摩根娜的住所。阿斯特拉希望把两人都击败。你们身后的大门是回沙堡镇的路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd19.lua:334
