#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:277
msgid ""
"You find the last surviving page of this dead man's journal. It reads: ...witches won't find me under here. Maybe I can use one of the other exits from the sewer to pop up in the town and be gone before anyone can find me. All of this was so sudden. Who would have known that the witches were plotting to..."
msgstr ""
"你们找到这个死者日记幸存的最后一页。上面写着：……女巫在这下面找不到我。也许我可以用下水道的其他出口冒到镇上，在任何人找到我之前就走。这一切来得太突然了。谁能想到女巫们在密谋……"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:282
msgid ""
"You find the last surviving page of this dead man's journal. It reads: ...witches won't find me under here. Maybe I can use one of the other exits from the sewer to pop up in the town and be gone before anyone can find me. All of this was so sudden. Who would have known that the witches were plotting to... Beside him, his pack. (+400 gold)"
msgstr ""
"你们找到这个死者日记幸存的最后一页。上面写着：……女巫在这下面找不到我。也许我可以用下水道的其他出口冒到镇上，在任何人找到我之前就走。这一切来得太突然了。谁能想到女巫们在密谋……他旁边是他的背包。（+400 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:286 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:296
msgid "Initiation cauldron"
msgstr "入会大锅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:294
msgid "Initiation cauldron. The brew smells of toad and ambition. Drink?"
msgstr "入会大锅。药汤有蟾蜍和野心的味道。要喝吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:301
msgid "Bars"
msgstr "栏杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:300
msgid "The lake, beyond the bars. Something with too many arms is listening."
msgstr "栏杆外是湖。有个手太多的东西在听着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:305
msgid "A bodiless voice murmurs: \"You are the most beautiful one of all.\""
msgstr "一个没有身体的声音低语：“你是所有人中最美的一个。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:31
msgid ""
"LAKESIDE'S UNDERSIDE. Under the Guild the coven keeps house; half a storey below its hall are the cells, and under everything the town's sewer runs east to the lake. Naomi said four prisoners wait in the cells, and that the Head Witch keeps the coven's north-west corner."
msgstr ""
"湖畔镇地下。公会下面是巫团的住处；比大厅低半层是牢房，而在一切之下，镇上的下水道向东通向湖。娜奥米说牢房里关着四个囚犯，首领女巫占据着巫团的西北角。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:310
msgid ""
"You find the last surviving page of this dead man's journal. It reads: ...still haven't a clue where that statuette is. The sewer is infested with sewer monsters, and they seem to come out of nowhere. Got to watch my back."
msgstr "你们找到这个死者日记幸存的最后一页。上面写着：……仍然不知道雕像在哪里。下水道里满是下水道怪物，它们好像从天而降。得小心背后。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:322 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:330 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:283
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:285
msgid "Shelf"
msgstr "架子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:329
msgid "Behind the jars of newt eyes, a pouch of coins. (+200 gold)"
msgstr "在一罐罐蝾螈眼睛后面，有一小袋钱币。（+200 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:334 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:339
msgid ""
"A side drain, grilled. The grille has been pushed out from inside and set back."
msgstr "一条带栅栏的侧排水道。栅栏被人从里面推出去，又放了回去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:343 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:345
msgid "Sigil"
msgstr "印记"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:344
msgid "The coven's sigil, cut deep into the stone."
msgstr "巫团的印记，深深刻在石头里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:349
msgid ""
"Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a potion of endurance, gather together the poisoned entrails of a toad kept under a cold stone for thirty-one days, a slice of swamp snake, the eye of a newt, the toe of a frog, wool from a bat, tongue of a dog, a lizard's leg, an owlet's wing, and the forked tongue of a snake. Throw them all in a cauldron and let sit under the auspices of a full moon. Begin boiling just before sunrise. Keep warm until sunrise of the next day. If the mixture turns black, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving."
msgstr ""
"头骨没人问就开口了：要做耐力药水，需集齐在冷石下放了三十一天的蟾蜍毒内脏、一片沼泽蛇肉、蝾螈之眼、青蛙趾、蝙蝠毛、狗舌、蜥蜴腿、小猫头鹰的翅膀，还有蛇的分叉舌头。把它们全扔进大锅，在满月庇护下放置。日出前开始煮沸。保温到第二天日出。如果混合物变黑，药汤就是酸的，会把饮用者变成石头。可制一份。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:354
msgid ""
"Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a Potion of Personality, gather together the ground horn of a Unicorn, the tanned hide of an Ogre, and the blood of a monkeydog sacrificed 'neath the blackness of a new moon. Slowly pour a half part of the blood into a twenty gallon cauldron and mix in the horn powder. Heat to a low simmer and let sit for three days. At the stroke of midnight on the third night, drop the Ogre hide into the stew and stir rapidly. If the hide dissolves any sooner or later than three minutes, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving."
msgstr ""
"头骨没人问就开口了：要做个性药水，需集齐独角兽的角粉、食人妖的鞣制兽皮，还有在新月的黑暗下献祭的猴犬之血。把半份血慢慢倒进二十加仑的大锅，混入角粉。以小火慢炖，放置三天。第三夜午夜钟响时，把食人妖兽皮丢进炖汤，快速搅拌。如果兽皮溶解得比三分钟早或晚，药汤就是酸的，会把饮用者变成石头。可制一份。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:359
msgid ""
"Unprompted, the skull begins to speak: To make a potion of speed, gather together the claw of a roadrunner, the wing of a hummingbird, and the paw of a cheetah. Pound the claw to dust and sprinkle into briskly boiling salt water. Quickly drop in the wing, followed by the paw. Stir 100 times, rapidly. Remove the cauldron from the fire and pour the liquid through a strainer and into a second cauldron. If any material remains in the strainer, the brew is sour and will turn its drinkers to stone. Makes one serving."
msgstr ""
"头骨没人问就开口了：要做速度药水，需集齐走鹃的爪、蜂鸟的翅膀和猎豹的爪。把爪捣成粉，撒进剧烈沸腾的盐水。迅速丢进翅膀，再丢进爪。快速搅拌 100 下。把大锅从火上移开，把液体经过滤网倒进第二口大锅。如果滤网里还有残留物，药汤就是酸的，会把饮用者变成石头。可制一份。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:370
msgid "An earlier wrong answer. Its purse is still on it. (+250 gold)"
msgstr "一个早先答错的人。他的钱袋还在身上。（+250 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:381
msgid "The trapdoor is shut fast above you."
msgstr "活板门在你们头上紧紧关死了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:393
msgid "Under the pillow: a purse of the coven's dues. (+500 gold)"
msgstr "枕头下：一袋巫团会费。（+500 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd20.lua:53
msgid "A few coins in the straw. (+150 gold)"
msgstr "稻草里有几枚钱币。（+150 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:145
msgid "Dead Food"
msgstr "亡者食物"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:164 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:166
msgid "Mummy's Secret Treasure"
msgstr "木乃伊的秘密宝藏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:176
msgid "Wedged in the drain's bars, a purse. (+900 gold)"
msgstr "卡在排水道栏杆里：一只钱袋。（+900 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:192
msgid "Something glints in the muck behind the bars: a ring."
msgstr "栏杆后面的淤泥里有什么东西在闪光：一枚戒指。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:208
msgid "Caught in the drain's bars, a dead man's purse. (+1200 gold)"
msgstr "卡在排水道栏杆里：一个死人的钱袋。（+1200 金币）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:219 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:222
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:224
msgid "Climb up to the Necropolis"
msgstr "爬上去，回亡灵之城"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:241
msgid "Culvert gate"
msgstr "涵洞闸门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:237
