msgstr "涵洞闸门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:25
msgid ""
"Sandro's crypts under the Necropolis. Below them runs the sewer, where his heart is said to lie."
msgstr "亡灵之城下面桑德罗的地穴。再下面是下水道，据说他的心脏就在那里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:253 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:109
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd26.lua:111
msgid "Grille"
