msgstr "格栅敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:271 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:274
msgid "Jar of green glass"
msgstr "绿玻璃罐"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:312 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:314
msgid "Sandro's seal"
msgstr "桑德罗的印记"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:313
msgid "A heart pierced by a bone, carved in the dark stone over the doors."
msgstr "一颗被骨头刺穿的心，刻在门上方的黑石头里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:317 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:328
msgid "Sluice wheel"
msgstr "水闸转轮"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:92
msgid "Sandro's bier"
msgstr "桑德罗的灵台"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:57
msgid "Sandro's bier, empty. Grave dust lies over it."
msgstr "桑德罗的灵台，空的。坟土盖在上面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:61
msgid "Sandro's bier."
msgstr "桑德罗的灵台。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:66
msgid "Ask Sandro for his ritual first?"
msgstr "先向桑德罗问他的仪式？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd21.lua:90
msgid "Give Sandro his heart?"
msgstr "把心脏交给桑德罗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:111
msgid "Stasis generator"
msgstr "停滞发生器"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:110
msgid ""
"The stasis generator that carried Sheltem through the crash. It is cold."
msgstr "带着谢尔特姆撞击坠毁的停滞发生器。它是冷的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:116
msgid "Exit Escape Pod 2"
msgstr "离开逃生舱 2"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:16
msgid ""
"Escape Pod 2. Cold air, red light, and somewhere above, machines still on guard."
msgstr "逃生舱 2。冷空气，红光，上方某处，机器仍在警戒。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:180 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:182
msgid "Main Console"
msgstr "主控台"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:181
msgid "Main Console. The computer seems to be malfunctioning."
msgstr "主控台。计算机似乎出了故障。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:209
msgid "Fire anyway?"
msgstr "还是要开火？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:214
msgid "Scanning Console. The computer seems to be malfunctioning."
msgstr "扫描控制台。计算机似乎出了故障。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:235
msgid "Security Console"
msgstr "安保控制台"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:22
msgid "The blast door stands open."
msgstr "防爆门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:234
msgid "Security lockdown: bridge sealed. Release?"
msgstr "安全封锁：桥已封闭。解除？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:29 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:34
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:36
