msgid "Gun deck"
msgstr "炮甲板"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:86
msgid "Maintenance hatch"
msgstr "维修舱口"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:91
msgid "Security post"
msgstr "安保岗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:94 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:96
msgid "Stores"
msgstr "储藏室"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd22.lua:99
msgid "Tool rack"
msgstr "工具架"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:12
msgid ""
"The cave in the crag runs up into the mountain, its floor white with droppings. Somewhere above, claws scrape on rock."
msgstr "峭壁上的洞穴向上通入山中，地面被粪便染白。上方某处，爪子刮擦着岩石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:161
msgid "Leave the Gargoyle Lair"
msgstr "离开石像鬼巢穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:164 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:258
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:265
msgid "Nest"
msgstr "巢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:174
msgid ""
"Straw, and in it everything that glitters: spoons, buckles, broken mirrors. Gargoyles like shiny things."
msgstr "稻草，里面是一切闪光的东西：勺子、带扣、破镜子。石像鬼喜欢闪亮的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:183
msgid ""
"Perches worn smooth by claws stand out from the walls of a high cave. Ledges look down from the dark above."
msgstr "被爪子磨得光滑的栖木从一个高洞穴的墙上伸出来。上方的黑暗中，岩架向下俯视。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:21
msgid "A climber's bones lie in the cleft, still roped to his pack."
msgstr "一个攀岩者的骨头躺在岩缝里，背包还系在绳上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:307
msgid ""
"The roost: a tall cave under a crack of sky, snow sifted onto the droppings. Roosting rocks stand round it in a ring, worn smooth by claws."
msgstr "栖息地：一个高高的洞穴，顶上有一道天空的裂缝，雪筛落在粪便上。栖息石围成一圈，被爪子磨得光滑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:40
msgid ""
"Weathered pillars of rock stand about the gallery like statues. Some of the statues have wings."
msgstr "风化的岩柱像雕像一样立在长廊里。有些雕像长着翅膀。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:133
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:187
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_dd23.lua:230
