msgid "Captain Nystor"
msgstr "尼斯托船长"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:370
msgid ""
"Captain Nystor: \"I can give ya a boat ride to the Eastern shore for 100 gold pieces. Ask at the dock house.\""
msgstr "尼斯托船长：“我可以花 100 金币载你们坐船去东岸。去码头屋问问。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:376
msgid "Nystor's notice"
msgstr "尼斯托的告示"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:375
msgid ""
"Captain Nystor: \"Those Ogres are ruining me! For months they have been throwing boulders at the boats that ply the waters around here. I want those Ogres gone and I am willing to pay well for the service.\" Their lair is in the hills north-west, up the north river."
msgstr ""
"尼斯托船长：“那些食人妖要毁了我！几个月来他们一直向在这一带水域航行的船扔巨石。我要那些食人妖消失，愿意出高价。”他们的巢穴在西北方的山丘里，沿北河上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:387
msgid ""
"The fountain is dry: a brass plug stamped with a sorceress's sigil stops its spout."
msgstr "喷泉是干的：一只刻着女术士印记的黄铜塞子堵住了它的喷口。"

