#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:417
msgid ""
"Pray, pay, and be healed today. (Under it someone has scratched: \"I can't believe the cost of healing these days!\")"
msgstr "今天祈祷、付钱、得治愈。（下面有人划着：“真不敢相信现在治疗这么贵！”）"

