msgstr "强者阿诺德：“我看你苍白又虚弱。我来教你健身术，让你骨头上长点肉。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:432
msgid ""
"Flint the Armsmaster: \"Fighting is simple. I'll teach you to be an Armsmaster in one easy lesson.\""
msgstr "军械官弗林特：“战斗很简单。我一节课就教会你成为军械官。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x2.lua:437
