#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:389 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:392 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:394
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:397 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:399 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:402
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:404
msgid "Well of Fantastic Skill"
msgstr "奇妙技能之井"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:407 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_x9.lua:409
msgid "Sure-Eye Tonic"
msgstr "神眼补剂"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:10 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:13
msgid "Barn doors"
msgstr "谷仓门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:102
msgid ""
"JOE THE EXTERMINATOR. Pests gone or your money back! And, much smaller: (Money not back.)"
msgstr "灭虫师乔。虫害全消，否则退钱！还有小得多的一行：（钱不退。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:106 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:109
msgid "Office door"
msgstr "办公室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:122
msgid ""
"The pink candle gutters out. Mr and Mrs Wobbles are separated at last."
msgstr "粉红蜡烛熄灭了。沃布尔斯先生和夫人终于分开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:131
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:133 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:138
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:146
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:148 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:151 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:153
msgid "Barred gate"
msgstr "带栏杆的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:158
msgid "The riverbank"
msgstr "河岸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:165
msgid "River grate"
msgstr "河栅栏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:164
msgid ""
"You heave the grate up; it catches and stays. The riverbank lies beyond."
msgstr "你们把栅栏举起来；它卡住了，停在那里。河岸就在外面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:171
msgid "Shipping room door"
msgstr "发货间的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:17
msgid "JOE THE EXTERMINATOR - ALWAYS FIRST ON THE SCENE."
msgstr "灭虫师乔——永远第一个到场。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:174 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:180
msgid "Shuttered window"
msgstr "关着百叶窗的窗户"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:176
msgid "A shuttered window, nailed fast."
msgstr "一扇关着百叶窗的窗户，钉死了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:179
msgid ""
"One shutter is loose. Through the gap a hand can reach the bar of the loading doors."
msgstr "有一扇百叶窗松了。透过缝隙，一只手能够到装卸门的门闩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:189
msgid ""
"A bucket of slime tips over the doorway. Joe thanks you for your interest."
msgstr "一桶史莱姆倒翻在门口。乔感谢你们的关注。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:201
msgid "Sacks of JOE'S PREMIUM SLIME CHOW"
msgstr "一袋袋乔牌特级史莱姆饲料"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:200
msgid "The stack of sacks slides aside on a hidden runner."
msgstr "一摞袋子沿着一条隐藏的滑轨滑开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:204 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:212
msgid "Loading doors"
msgstr "装卸门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:206
msgid ""
"The loading doors are barred from inside. Joe's spare key would open them; so might a sharp eye on those shutters."
msgstr "装卸门从里面闩住了。乔的备用钥匙能开；盯着那些百叶窗看仔细点，也许也行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:211
msgid "The bar lifts, and the loading doors roll apart."
msgstr "门闩抬起，装卸门向两侧滚开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:230
msgid "Mr Wobbles bursts and splits in two!"
msgstr "沃布尔斯先生爆开，分成了两个！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:244
msgid "Mrs Wobbles bursts and splits in two!"
msgstr "沃布尔斯夫人爆开，分成了两个！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:249
msgid ""
"PEST OF THE MONTH: the Doom Bug. Last month: the Doom Bug. Next month: ask Joe."
msgstr "本月害虫：厄运虫。上月：厄运虫。下月：问乔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:254
msgid ""
"WAREHOUSE RULES. 1. No Gunther. 2. Do not feed the stock (Joe feeds the stock). 3. Do not pull the FEEDING TIME lever. 4. See rule 1."
msgstr "仓库规则。1. 不准贡瑟进来。2. 不要喂存货（乔负责喂存货）。3. 不要拉“喂食时间”拉杆。4. 见规则 1。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:26 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:28
msgid "Joe's desk"
msgstr "乔的桌子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:264
msgid ""
"You dig through the pair's nest of slime and straw and find the rival exterminator's purse: 75 gold."
msgstr "你们翻遍这对史莱姆的窝，里面全是黏液和稻草，找到了对手灭虫师的钱袋：75 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:27
msgid ""
"Bills, piled by customer. 'Mayor's cellar: doom bugs removed, 400 gold.' 'Mayor's cellar: doom bugs removed again, 400 gold.' 'Mayor's cellar: slimes, 400 gold.' Under them a list headed SUPPLIERS, with every line scratched out."
msgstr ""
"按客户堆放的账单。“镇长地窖：清除厄运虫，400 金币。”“镇长地窖：再次清除厄运虫，400 金币。”“镇长地窖：史莱姆，400 金币。”下面是一张标着“供应商”的清单，每一行都被划掉了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:273 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:275 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:278
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:285
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:290 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:293
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:298 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:300
msgid "Bug tank"
msgstr "虫缸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:274 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:284
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:294 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:299
msgid ""
"Doom bugs crawl over each other in green slime behind the dirty glass. A label: BREEDING STOCK. DO NOT TAP THE GLASS."
msgstr "厄运虫在脏玻璃后面的绿色黏液里互相爬来爬去。标签：繁殖用种虫。请勿敲打玻璃。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:289
msgid ""
"The glass of this tank is cracked low down, and it is empty but for slime. Whatever was in it is out."
msgstr "这个缸的玻璃下方裂了，里面除了黏液什么也没有。原来在里面的东西跑出去了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:303 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:305
msgid "Words daubed in slime"
msgstr "用黏液涂的字"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:304
msgid ""
"Daubed across the bricks in green slime, in big dripping letters: SLIME LORDS SHALL RULE. Under it, smaller, in another hand: The end is near."
msgstr "砖墙上用绿色黏液涂着大大的、滴淌的字：史莱姆领主将称王。下面是另一个人的笔迹，字更小：末日将近。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:313
msgid ""
"Joe's warehouse. A wet, sour smell hangs over the place, and somewhere inside something squelches."
msgstr "乔的仓库。一股湿漉漉的酸臭味笼罩着这地方，里面某处有什么东西在咕叽作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:36 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:51
msgid "FEEDING TIME"
msgstr "喂食时间"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:50
msgid ""
"FEEDING TIME! A red lamp flashes, and every set of bars in the cistern clanks up at once."
msgstr "喂食时间！红灯闪烁，蓄水池里每一道栏杆同时哐啷升起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:56
msgid "Heart-painted gate"
msgstr "画着心的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:60
msgid "MR & MRS WOBBLES - DO NOT SEPARATE"
msgstr "沃布尔斯先生和夫人——请勿分开"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:70 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:78
msgid "KEEP OUT"
msgstr "禁止入内"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:72
msgid "KEEP OUT (THIS MEANS YOU, GUNTHER). The door is locked."
msgstr "禁止入内（说的就是你，贡瑟）。门锁着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:77
msgid "Joe's key turns in the lock."
msgstr "乔的钥匙在锁里转动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:82
msgid "KEEP OUT (THIS MEANS YOU, GUNTHER)"
msgstr "禁止入内（说的就是你，贡瑟）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:86 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:88
msgid "Warehouse Lane"
msgstr "仓库巷"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:91 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:93
msgid "Joe's ledgers"
msgstr "乔的账本"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd01.lua:92
msgid ""
"Pest removal, Mayor's cellar: 400 gold. Pest supply: 20 gold. Profit! The last line, underlined twice: Retirement fund - behind the Chow."
msgstr "清除害虫，镇长地窖：400 金币。害虫供应：20 金币。有赚头！最后一行，划了两道下划线：退休基金——在饲料后面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:459
msgid "The cart splashes off down the drowned line."
msgstr "矿车溅着水沿着淹没的轨道驶去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:121
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:437 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:447
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:450 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:460
msgid "Cart lever"
msgstr "矿车拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:130 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:446
msgid "The cart rumbles along the east line."
msgstr "矿车隆隆地沿着东线驶去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:141
msgid "The Deep Line"
msgstr "深线"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:136
msgid "The Deep Line cart is chained to its brake wheel."
msgstr "深线矿车被锁链拴在制动轮上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/english/trans.txt:5 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:424
msgid "The cart runs down the Deep Line into the dark."
msgstr "矿车沿着深线驶入黑暗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:146
msgid "Daylight: the hills north of Vertigo"
msgstr "日光：弗蒂戈镇以北的山丘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:15
msgid ""
"The clan's brake key opens the padlock. You spin the wheel: the chain drops off the Deep Line cart into the rail bed and the brake comes off. The cart is free: climb in at the buffer stop and it will run down the Deep Line to the Clan King's Deep Mine."
msgstr "氏族的制动钥匙打开了挂锁。你们转动轮子：锁链从深线矿车上掉进轨道床，制动解除了。矿车自由了：在缓冲挡处爬上去，它会沿深线驶向氏族王的深矿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:151
msgid "Rock fills the adit to the roof. The winch might drag it away."
msgstr "岩石把平巷堵到了顶。绞盘也许能把它拖开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:158 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:278
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:287
msgid "Hoist cage"
msgstr "升降笼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:162
msgid "The cage jerks and rides up the shaft on its creaking cable."
msgstr "吊笼猛地一颤，沿着竖井在吱嘎作响的缆绳上升起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:166 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:172 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:175
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:463 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:469
msgid "Hoist lever"
msgstr "升降杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:184
msgid "The hoist cable sings."
msgstr "升降缆绳嗡嗡作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:177
msgid ""
"The bell rings far below; nobody answers. The cage waits on the stope floor, braked: work it once from the floor and its brake comes off."
msgstr "铃声在远处下方响起；没人应答。吊笼停在采场底部，刹住了：从底部扳动一次，它的刹车就会松开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:202
msgid "Points lever"
msgstr "道岔拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:19 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:21
msgid "Chalk mark"
msgstr "粉笔记号"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:193
msgid "The turntable grinds round: the trestle line is live."
msgstr "转盘磨响着转了过来：栈桥线通了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:20
msgid ""
"An old Red Dwarf mark in chalk: a strongbox, and an arrow pointing into the wall."
msgstr "一个古老的红矮人粉笔记号：一只保险箱，还有一个指向墙里的箭头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:201
msgid "The turntable grinds round: the east line is live."
msgstr "转盘磨响着转了过来：东线通了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:213
msgid "Drink from the blue pool"
msgstr "从蓝池里喝水"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:207 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:229
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:240
msgid "The water tastes of nothing."
msgstr "水什么味道也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:212
msgid "The blue water is sweet and very clear. (+2 Intellect, permanent)"
msgstr "蓝色的水甘甜而清澈。（+2 智力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:216 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:224
msgid "Drink from the gold pool"
msgstr "从金池里喝水"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:223
msgid "The golden water tastes of metal. (+2 Accuracy, permanent)"
msgstr "金色的水有金属的味道。（+2 准确，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:235
msgid "Drink from the green pool"
msgstr "从绿池里喝水"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:234
msgid "The green water is cold as the deep rock. (+2 Endurance, permanent)"
msgstr "绿色的水像深层岩石一样冰冷。（+2 耐力，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:238 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:246
msgid "Drink from the red pool"
msgstr "从红池里喝水"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:245
msgid "The red water burns going down. (+2 Might, permanent)"
msgstr "红色的水下肚时火辣辣的。（+2 力量，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:257
msgid "A cave in! The rotten props give way and rock thunders down."
msgstr "塌方了！腐朽的支柱断裂，岩石轰然砸下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:261 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:264
msgid "Dry-stone wall"
msgstr "干砌石墙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:263
msgid "The old dry-stone wall slumps into the floor: a vault behind it."
msgstr "旧干砌石墙塌进了地板：后面有一座金库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:267 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:269
msgid "The Red Dwarves' tablet"
msgstr "红矮人的石板"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:268
msgid ""
"Carved in the old runes, the faces smashed above them: RED FOR THE ARM. GREEN FOR THE BACK. GOLD FOR THE EYE. BLUE FOR THE MIND. THE BLUE SLEEPS BEHIND THE SILK."
msgstr "用古老的符文刻着，上方的面孔被砸烂了：红为臂。绿为背。金为眼。蓝为心。蓝在丝绸后沉睡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:272 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:281
msgid "Trestle car"
msgstr "栈桥车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:274 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:300
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:484 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:497
msgid "The points at the Turntable are set for the east line."
msgstr "转盘处的道岔设向东线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:280 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:490
msgid "The car rolls out over the chasm."
msgstr "车滚到了深渊之上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:294 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:297
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:307 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:481 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:491
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:494 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:504
msgid "Car lever"
msgstr "车拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:293 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:306
msgid "The car rumbles along the trestle."
msgstr "车沿着栈桥隆隆驶去。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:310 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:320 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:338
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:348 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:351 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:361
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:364 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:377
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:387
msgid "Gold vein"
msgstr "金矿脉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:312 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:340
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:366 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:379
msgid "Only bare rock is left where the seam was."
msgstr "矿脉原来的位置只剩下光秃秃的岩石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:319
msgid "A seam of gold above the water line: you chip it out."
msgstr "水线上方的一条金矿脉：你们把它凿了出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:335
msgid "Rich gold vein"
msgstr "富金矿脉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:334
msgid "A fat seam of gold - and the rock beside it caves in!"
msgstr "一条粗壮的金矿脉——旁边的岩石塌了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:347
msgid "A thin seam of gold over the drop: you chip it out."
msgstr "悬崖上方的一条细金矿脉：你们把它凿了出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:360
msgid "Gold glints in the ramp wall: you chip out the seam."
msgstr "斜坡墙上有金子闪光：你们凿出了矿脉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:373
msgid "A glinting seam of gold: you chip out a handful of nuggets."
msgstr "一条闪光的金矿脉：你们凿出了一把金块。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:386
msgid "A seam of gold in the ramp wall: you chip it out."
msgstr "斜坡墙上的一条金矿脉：你们把它凿了出来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:390 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:393
msgid "Thick old web"
msgstr "厚厚的旧蛛网"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:392
msgid "You cut the web away; the rock screen behind it lifts."
msgstr "你们割开蛛网；后面的岩屏升了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:396 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:406 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:84
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:95
msgid "Winch"
msgstr "绞盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:398
msgid "The winch's rope hangs slack: the fall is gone."
msgstr "绞盘的绳子松垂着：塌方消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:405
msgid "The props come out and the whole fall slides away: daylight!"
msgstr "支柱被拔出，整堆塌方滑走了：日光！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:414
msgid ""
"Mayor Gunther of Vertigo sent you here. The Mad Dwarf Clan has taken the Red Dwarves' mine, and their Clan King holds the Deep Mine below it. The way down is the Deep Line cart at the bottom of the Open Stope, past the Turntable; the clan keeps it chained, and the brake key lies in their strongbox in the tally room, in the camp north of the Turntable."
msgstr ""
"弗蒂戈镇的贡瑟镇长派你们来这里。疯矮人氏族占了红矮人的矿，他们的氏族王控制着下面的深矿。下去的路是开放采场底部的深线矿车，经过转盘；氏族把它锁着，制动钥匙在他们的保险箱里，在转盘以北营地的计数室里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:425
msgid "Deep Line cart"
msgstr "深线矿车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:420
msgid "The mine car doesn't move: it is chained to the brake wheel."
msgstr "矿车纹丝不动：它被锁链拴在制动轮上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:433
msgid ""
"The Deep Line: the clan's cart stands at the buffer stop, chained to a brake wheel."
msgstr "深线：氏族的矿车停在缓冲挡处，被锁链拴在制动轮上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:468
msgid "The cage jerks and sinks down the shaft."
msgstr "吊笼猛地一颤，沿着竖井下沉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:477
msgid "The clan's tally room: its strongbox stands behind the tally table."
msgstr "氏族的计数室：保险箱就在计数桌后面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:503
msgid "The car rolls back up the trestle."
msgstr "车沿着栈桥滚了回来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:51
msgid ""
"Under the tally slates: the Deep Line's brake key, stamped with a cart wheel."
msgstr "在计数石板下：深线的制动钥匙，上面印着一个车轮。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:513
msgid ""
"Scribbled on a piece of parchment, a note reads: 1 bottle orc's milk, 2 boxes of Dwarf biscuits, 1 can of split toadsoup, and one everlasting stick of troll jerky."
msgstr "一张羊皮纸上潦草写着一条字条：1 瓶兽人奶，2 盒矮人饼干，1 罐豌豆蟾蜍汤，还有一根永远嚼不完的巨魔肉干。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:518
msgid ""
"Scribbled on a piece of parchment, a note reads: There are many DEEP mines."
msgstr "一张羊皮纸上潦草写着一条字条：有许多深矿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:332 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:527 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:533
msgid "Red Dwarf Smithy"
msgstr "红矮人铁匠铺"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:529
msgid ""
"The smithy is barred. Behind the door, someone is sharpening something and swearing at the Mad Clan."
msgstr "铁匠铺被闩住了。门后有人在磨着什么东西，一边咒骂疯狂氏族。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:55 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:57
msgid "Warning sign"
msgstr "警告牌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:56
msgid "Skulls daubed on a board: MAD DWARF CLAN. DIG ELSEWHERE."
msgstr "木板上涂着头骨：疯矮人氏族。请去别处挖。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:68
msgid "Carved stone doors"
msgstr "雕花石门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:16 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:7
msgid "Deep Line brake"
msgstr "深线刹车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:71 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:73 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:76
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:78
msgid "Plank door"
msgstr "木板门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:86 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:88 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:91
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:93
msgid "Ventilation door"
msgstr "通风门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:9
msgid ""
"The Deep Line cart is chained to this brake wheel, the chain padlocked through it. The padlock wants a heavy iron key: the clan keeps it in the strongbox of their tally room off the mess hall."
msgstr "深线矿车被锁链拴在这个制动轮上，锁链用挂锁穿过。挂锁需要一把沉重的铁钥匙：氏族把它放在饭厅旁计数室的保险箱里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:9
msgid "The chain lies slack in the rail bed: the cart is free."
msgstr "锁链松垂在轨道床上：矿车自由了。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:96
msgid "Mine cart"
msgstr "矿车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:111 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:440
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:453 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd02.lua:98
msgid "The points at the Turntable are set for the trestle."
msgstr "转盘处的道岔设向栈桥。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:108 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:133 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:158
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:183
msgid ""
"You prise a gem out of the cluster; the rest crumbles to glittering dust."
msgstr "你们从晶簇里撬下一颗宝石；其余的碎成了闪光的粉末。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:16
msgid ""
"Hot air rises up the Deep Line: below, the Mad Dwarf Clan's hold glows red."
msgstr "热空气顺着深线涌上来：下面，疯矮人氏族的据点红光闪闪。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:191
msgid "Crystal wall"
msgstr "水晶墙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:190
msgid ""
"The crystal wall hums under your hand, rings like a bell, and sinks into the floor."
msgstr "水晶墙在你们手下嗡鸣，像钟一样响起，沉进了地板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:196
msgid ""
"The cart lurches over the lip and rumbles along the Deep Line's last pitch."
msgstr "矿车猛地冲过边缘，沿着深线最后一段陡坡隆隆驶去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:203
msgid "Armoury door"
msgstr "军械库门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:217
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:220
msgid "Heavy doors"
msgstr "厚重的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:229
msgid "The King's door"
msgstr "国王之门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:225
msgid ""
"A stone door behind the throne with the King's own lock in it. It will not move. The Clan King carries its key on him."
msgstr "王座后的一道石门，带着国王自己的锁。它纹丝不动。氏族王把钥匙带在身上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:244 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:247
msgid "The Deep Line: up to the Red Dwarf Mines"
msgstr "深线：上至红矮人矿井"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:246
msgid ""
"You climb into a cart and haul on the brake rope: the Deep Line carries you back up to the Red Dwarf Mines."
msgstr "你们爬进一辆车，拉动刹车绳：深线载着你们回到红矮人矿井。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:250 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:257
msgid "The shaft head: the hills north of Vertigo"
msgstr "竖井口：弗蒂戈镇以北的山丘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:252
msgid ""
"The hatch is barred from outside until the shaft's counterweight runs free."
msgstr "舱口从外面被闩住，直到竖井的配重松脱。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:256
msgid "You push up the hatch: daylight, wind and the hills north of Vertigo."
msgstr "你们把舱口顶开：日光、风，还有弗蒂戈镇以北的山丘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:26
msgid "Leathery wings unfold in the geode's crown!"
msgstr "皮质的翅膀在晶洞顶部展开了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:268 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:271
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:279
msgid "The King's Gate"
msgstr "国王之门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:262 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:273
msgid ""
"The King's Gate is barred from within: two iron bars lie across its leaves in their brackets. The clan lifts them with levers, one for each bar: one hangs in the barracks behind the bunks, the other in the furnace tower beyond the far bank."
msgstr "国王之门从里面被闩住：两根铁闩横在门扇上的托架里。氏族用拉杆抬起它们，每根闩一根拉杆：一根挂在兵营的床铺后面，另一根在远岸之外的熔炉塔里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:267 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:278
msgid "The King's Gate swings open."
msgstr "国王之门荡开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:282 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:296 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:483
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:497 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:500 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:514
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:517 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:531 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:534
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:548 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:551 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:565
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:582 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:585
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:599
msgid "The great gong"
msgstr "大铜锣"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:485 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:502
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:519 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:536 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:553
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:570 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:587
msgid "The gong still hums."
msgstr "铜锣仍在嗡鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:295 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:496 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:513
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:530 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:547 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:564
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:581 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:598
msgid ""
"BOOM! The great gong rolls through the hold. Doors crash open in the barracks."
msgstr "咚！大铜锣的声音滚过据点。兵营里的门砰砰撞开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:30 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:37
msgid "Counterweight cage"
msgstr "配重吊笼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:304
msgid "The slag in the gutter burns!"
msgstr "排水沟里的矿渣着火了！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:32
msgid ""
"The cage will not move: its counterweight is chained fast. The chain's lever must be near, in the King's hoard."
msgstr "吊笼纹丝不动：它的配重被锁链拴死了。链子的拉杆应该就在附近，在国王的宝藏里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:327
msgid "The Clan King falls across his anvil. The Mad Dwarf Clan is broken."
msgstr "氏族王倒在他的铁砧上。疯矮人氏族被击溃了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:349
msgid ""
"The Clan King roars and kicks over the forge braziers: slag pours hissing into the gutters!"
msgstr "氏族王怒吼着踢翻了锻炉的火盆：矿渣嘶嘶作响地涌进排水沟！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:356
msgid "Stone lectern"
msgstr "石讲台"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:354
msgid ""
"Cut in the old runes of the Red Dwarves: HERE BRAKKA THE FIRST CUT THE DEEP GALLERY. KEEP THE FIRE, KEEP THE SEAM."
msgstr "用红矮人的古符文刻着：此处布拉卡首次开凿深坑道。守住火，守住矿脉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:36
msgid ""
"The counterweight drops past you in the dark and the cage creaks up the shaft."
msgstr "配重在黑暗中从你们身边落下，吊笼吱嘎作响地升上竖井。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:363
msgid "The lever is down; the King's Gate's lower bar stays up."
msgstr "拉杆已拉下；国王之门的下闩仍然抬着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:365
msgid ""
"The lever drops with a clank; far off, the King's Gate's lower bar grinds upward."
msgstr "拉杆咣当一声落下；远处，国王之门的下闩磨响着向上抬起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:375
msgid "The lever is down; the King's Gate's upper bar stays up."
msgstr "拉杆已拉下；国王之门的上闩仍然抬着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:377
msgid ""
"The lever drops with a clank; far off, the King's Gate's upper bar grinds upward."
msgstr "拉杆咣当一声落下；远处，国王之门的上闩磨响着向上抬起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:40 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:48 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:51
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:59
msgid "Cage lever"
msgstr "吊笼拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:403
msgid "The sentry hammers the great gong! Doors crash open in the barracks."
msgstr "哨兵敲响了大铜锣！兵营里的门砰砰撞开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:416 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:425
msgid "Shaft lever"
msgstr "竖井拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:419
msgid "The lever is over; the cage in the shaft runs free."
msgstr "拉杆扳了过去；竖井里的吊笼自由了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:53
msgid ""
"A bell rings far above, but the cage does not come: its counterweight is chained fast."
msgstr "上面远处铃声响起，但吊笼没有来：它的配重被锁链拴死了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:421
msgid ""
"The lever comes over: a chain runs out with a roar somewhere above. The cage in the shaft is free."
msgstr "拉杆扳了过去：上方某处，一条链子轰鸣着放出去。竖井里的吊笼自由了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:428 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:430 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:433
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:435
msgid "Statue of a Red Dwarf king"
msgstr "红矮人国王的雕像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:429 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:434
msgid ""
"A Red Dwarf king carved in stone, older than the clan. Fresh axe marks scar his plinth: the Mad Dwarves have no love for the old kings."
msgstr "一尊石刻的红矮人国王，比氏族还要古老。新的斧痕划伤了他的基座：疯矮人对旧国王没有好感。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:443
msgid ""
"A faint hum, like a bell struck long ago, comes from the crystal in the west wall."
msgstr "西墙的水晶里传来微弱的嗡鸣，像很久以前敲响的钟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:447 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:456 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:459
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:468 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:471 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:480
msgid "Heap of gold"
msgstr "一堆金子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:455
msgid "You shovel the King's coins into your packs: 150 gold."
msgstr "你们把国王的钱币铲进背包：150 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:467 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:479
msgid "You shovel the King's coins into your packs: 100 gold."
msgstr "你们把国王的钱币铲进背包：100 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:47
msgid "The cage comes down the shaft."
msgstr "吊笼沿着竖井降下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:58
msgid "The cage comes up the shaft."
msgstr "吊笼沿着竖井升上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:603
msgid "Dead men tell no tales."
msgstr "死人不会说话。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:608
msgid ""
"Scribbled on a piece of parchment, a note reads: Robbers and thieves take a good look at your fate, should you decide to steal from these mines!"
msgstr "一张羊皮纸上潦草写着一条字条：强盗和盗贼们，若你们想偷这些矿，好好看看自己的下场！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:613
msgid "Nothing here but bones."
msgstr "这里只有骨头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:134
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:162
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd03.lua:87
msgid "Crystal cluster"
msgstr "晶簇"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:109
msgid ""
"The cage is locked. The sobbing child sniffs: 'The warden's ring opens it. It's in his strongbox, in his lodge on the ground floor.'"
msgstr "笼子锁着。抽泣的孩子吸着鼻子说：“典狱长的戒指能打开它。在他的保险箱里，在一楼他的小屋里。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:121
msgid ""
"The cage is locked. The child inside whispers: 'The warden downstairs keeps the ring of keys in his strongbox. Hurry, before they come back!'"
msgstr "笼子锁着。里面的孩子小声说：“楼下的典狱长把钥匙环放在他的保险箱里。快，趁他们还没回来！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:142 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:145
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:156
msgid "Hoist call"
msgstr "呼叫升降机"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:133
msgid ""
"You press the button. Far above, something clanks - but nothing moves: the hoist's rope is held fast somewhere above. (The hoist's brake must be in the hoist room, by the coven's sanctum.)"
msgstr ""
"你们按下按钮。远在上方有什么东西哐当一响——但没有东西动：升降机的绳子在上面某处被卡死了。（升降机的刹车一定在升降机室里，靠近巫团的圣所。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:522
msgid "The cage comes down the slot."
msgstr "吊笼沿着槽降下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:147
msgid ""
"The cage is here, held fast by its brake. The brake lever is on this room's north wall."
msgstr "吊笼在这里，被刹车卡住了。刹车拉杆在这个房间的北墙上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:155
msgid "The cage comes up the slot."
msgstr "吊笼沿着槽升上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:162
msgid "The brew scalds and stings: you flounder out of the cauldron."
msgstr "药汤烫得刺痛：你们挣扎着爬出了大锅。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:182
msgid "The cloud stair"
msgstr "云梯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:177
msgid ""
"The clouds answer to the Head Witch. While she lives, they will not bear you."
msgstr "云听命于首领女巫。只要她还活着，它们就不会托起你们。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:181
msgid "You climb the stair of cloud into the sky."
msgstr "你们爬上云梯，升入天空。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:190
msgid "Somewhere behind the bookcase, a child is crying."
msgstr "书柜后面某处，有个孩子在哭。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:197
msgid "Wainscot"
msgstr "护墙板"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:196
msgid ""
"A panel of the wainscot is loose: behind it, a goblin's hoard in a cupboard."
msgstr "一块护墙板松了：后面的橱柜里藏着一个地精的宝藏。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:200 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:196
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:199
msgid "Bedchamber door"
msgstr "卧室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:205 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:208
msgid "Dormitory door"
msgstr "宿舍门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:142
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:148
msgid "Larder door"
msgstr "储藏室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:220
msgid "The mistress's door"
msgstr "女主人的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:223 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:226
msgid "Pen door"
msgstr "围栏门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:232
msgid "Schoolroom doors"
msgstr "教室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:238
msgid "Warden's door"
msgstr "典狱长的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:244
msgid "The tower door: out to Toad Meadow"
msgstr "塔门：通往蟾蜍草地"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:243
msgid "You push the tower door open into the meadow air."
msgstr "你们把塔门推开，通向草地的空气。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:256
msgid ""
"The Head Witch shrieks a word: the witch-marks split, and her familiars crawl out of the floor!"
msgstr "首领女巫尖叫了一个词：女巫印记裂开，她的魔宠从地板里爬了出来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:262
msgid "Roof hatch"
msgstr "屋顶舱口"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:274
msgid "The Head Witch shrieks, shrivels and is still."
msgstr "首领女巫尖叫着萎缩，不动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:280
msgid ""
"The hoist cage is held fast by its brake. The brake lever is on the hoist room's north wall."
msgstr "升降笼被刹车卡住了。刹车拉杆在升降机室的北墙上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:286
msgid "The winch creaks and the cage moves."
msgstr "绞盘吱嘎作响，吊笼动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:302
msgid "A recipe card"
msgstr "一张配方卡"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:301
msgid ""
"Strength brew - the vat with the TOAD on its lid. NOT the bubbling one (Agnes). NOT the green one, unless you want to be green."
msgstr "力量药汤——盖子上有蟾蜍的那只缸。不是冒泡的那只（艾格尼丝的）。也不是绿的那只，除非你想变绿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:310
msgid ""
"Wind, and the whole of Toad Meadow below. Beyond the meadows the world simply ends, and the stars shine under it. Above you, a stair of cloud climbs into the sky."
msgstr "风，还有蟾蜍草地的全貌在下方。草地之外，世界就这么到头了，星星在它下面闪耀。你们上方，一道云梯爬向天空。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:314 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:323
msgid "The sleeping face"
msgstr "沉睡的脸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:316
msgid ""
"A face of an old witch is carved in the door, fast asleep and smiling in her sleep. The door will not move. Under her chin, in a carved rosebud, is a keyhole: the coven's own key would fit it."
msgstr "门上刻着一张老女巫的脸，睡得很沉，睡梦中还在微笑。门纹丝不动。她下巴下面的一朵雕刻玫瑰蕾里有个锁孔：巫团自己的钥匙正好能插进去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:322
msgid ""
"The coven's key turns in the carved rosebud. The face sighs in her sleep, and the door parts down the middle."
msgstr "巫团的钥匙在雕刻的玫瑰蕾里转动。那张脸在睡梦中叹了口气，门从中间裂开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:326 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:349
msgid "Talking skull (Mind)"
msgstr "会说话的头骨（心智）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:337
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Mind Blast. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出一卷心灵冲击卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:365 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:391
msgid ""
"'No gems, no scroll,' clacks the skull. 'Come back richer and prettier.'"
msgstr "“没宝石，没卷轴，”头骨咔嗒着说。“发了财、变漂亮了再来。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:344 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:370 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:396
msgid "'Cheapskate,' says the skull."
msgstr "“小气鬼，”头骨说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:347
msgid ""
"\"Feed me!\" the skull demands, and clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Mind Blast for it, dearie. One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "“喂我！”头骨要求道，咔嗒咔嗒地动着下颚。“换一卷心灵冲击卷轴，亲爱的。一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:348
msgid "Toss a gem (Yes/No)?"
msgstr "扔一颗宝石（是/否）？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:35
msgid ""
"Green light flickers on black timber, and somewhere above, a cauldron bubbles."
msgstr "绿光在黑木上闪烁，上方某处，一口大锅在冒泡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:352 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:375
msgid "Talking skull (Body)"
msgstr "会说话的头骨（体魄）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:363
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Heal. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出一卷治疗卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:373
msgid ""
"The skull clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Heal, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "头骨咔嗒动着下颚。“一卷治疗卷轴吗，亲爱的？一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:400
msgid "Pay a gem (Yes/No)?"
msgstr "付一颗宝石（是/否）？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:401
msgid "Talking skull (Air)"
msgstr "会说话的头骨（风）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:389
msgid ""
"The skull spits out a scroll of Sparks. 'Pleasure doing business. Your nose is crooked.'"
msgstr "头骨吐出一卷火花卷轴。“合作愉快。你的鼻子是歪的。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:399
msgid ""
"The skull clacks its jaw. 'A scroll of Sparks, dearie? One gem. A shiny one. And do something about that face.'"
msgstr "头骨咔嗒动着下颚。“一卷火花卷轴吗，亲爱的？一颗宝石。要闪亮的。还有，把那张脸收拾收拾。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:404 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:406
msgid "The slate"
msgstr "石板"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:405
msgid ""
"HOW TO BE A PROPER GOBLIN.  1. Never say please.  2. Never wash.  3. Forget your name.  --  In the corner, small and half rubbed out, a child has scratched her own name: Rosebud. She has not forgotten it."
msgstr ""
"如何做个合格的地精。1. 永远不说“请”。2. 永远不洗澡。3. 忘掉你的名字。——角落里，又小又半被擦掉：一个孩子划下了自己的名字：玫瑰蕾。她没有忘记。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:414
msgid "The steam scalds you!"
msgstr "蒸汽烫伤了你们！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:422
msgid "Bubbling vat"
msgstr "冒泡的缸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:421
msgid "Agnes's brew burns all the way down. You are poisoned."
msgstr "艾格尼丝的药汤一路烧到底。你们中毒了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:425 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:428
msgid "Green vat"
msgstr "绿缸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:427
msgid "Your skin turns green, and your knees turn to water. (Weak)"
msgstr "你们的皮肤变绿，膝盖发软。（虚弱）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:431 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:446
msgid "Vat with a toad on its lid"
msgstr "盖子上有蟾蜍的缸"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:433
msgid "The brew tastes of mud and does nothing more for you."
msgstr "药汤有泥巴味，对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:445
msgid ""
"It tastes of mud and nettles, and something in you grows stronger. (+2 to one stat, permanent)"
msgstr "它有泥巴和荨麻的味道，你们体内有什么东西变强了。（+2 某项属性，永久）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:449 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:456
msgid "A shimmering ward"
msgstr "一道闪烁的结界"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:451
msgid ""
"A web of green witch-light bars the stair to the roof, the coven's moon-eye burning in it. It is the Head Witch's ward: it holds while she lives."
msgstr "一张绿色女巫之光织成的网挡住了通往屋顶的楼梯，巫团的月眼在其中燃烧。这是首领女巫的结界：她活着，它就撑着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:455
msgid ""
"With the Head Witch dead, her ward gutters out and sinks hissing into the floor."
msgstr "首领女巫死后，她的结界摇曳熄灭，嘶嘶地沉进了地板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:491 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:493
msgid "Winch drum"
msgstr "绞盘滚筒"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:492
msgid ""
"The hoist's rope is wound on this drum. The brake lever is on the north wall."
msgstr "升降机的绳子缠在这个滚筒上。刹车拉杆在北墙上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:501
msgid ""
"In a cage by the west wall, a boy rattles the bars and points at the warden's strongbox: 'The keys! He keeps the keys in there!'"
msgstr "西墙边的笼子里，一个男孩摇着栏杆，指着典狱长的保险箱：“钥匙！他把钥匙放在那里面！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:510
msgid ""
"From a cage by the north wall, a girl hisses: 'Psst! Let me out and I'll tell you a secret!'"
msgstr "北墙边的笼子里，一个女孩嘘声说：“嘘！放我出去，我告诉你们一个秘密！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:514 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:523
msgid "Hoist gate"
msgstr "升降机门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:516
msgid ""
"A plank gate closes the witches' hoist. Far above, something clanks - but nothing moves: the hoist's rope is held fast somewhere above. (The hoist's brake must be in the hoist room, by the coven's sanctum.)"
msgstr ""
"一道木板门封住了女巫的升降机。远在上方，什么东西哐当一响——但没有东西动：升降机的绳子在上面某处被卡死了。（升降机的刹车一定在升降机室里，靠近巫团的圣所。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:57
msgid "Far below, the cauldron settles to a simmer."
msgstr "远在下方，大锅平静成了文火。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:64
msgid "Bookcase"
msgstr "书柜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:610 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:612 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:615
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:617 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:620 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:622
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:625 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:627
msgid "Talking skull"
msgstr "会说话的头骨"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:611
msgid ""
"\"Don't forget to use the levitate spell before you enter the cloud world!\" the skull says."
msgstr "“进入云界之前，别忘了使用悬浮术！”头骨说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:616
msgid ""
"\"Goblins back to work!\" the skull shouts. In the straw below, nobody moves any faster."
msgstr "“地精们回去干活！”头骨喊道。下面稻草里，没人动得更快。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:621
msgid "\"You are the fairest one of all,\" the skull says."
msgstr "“你是所有人中最美的一个，”头骨说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:626
msgid ""
"\"You are the most beautiful creature in all the land,\" the skull says."
msgstr "“你是全国最美丽的生灵，”头骨说。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:63
msgid ""
"The bookcase rises into the wall with a groan. Behind it, a cage, and a sobbing child."
msgstr "书柜呻吟着升进墙里。后面是一只笼子，和一个抽泣的孩子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:67 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:79
msgid "Hoist brake"
msgstr "升降机刹车"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:69
msgid ""
"The brake is off: the hoist runs free. Ride the cage, or call it with the button beside either gate."
msgstr "刹车松开了：升降机自由运行。乘吊笼，或者按任一道门旁的按钮呼叫它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:78
msgid ""
"The brake comes off with a bang: the cage rattles away down the slot to the cauldron floor."
msgstr "刹车砰地松开：吊笼哗啦啦地沿着槽落到大锅层。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:116
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:82
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:92 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:95
msgid "Locked cage"
msgstr "上锁的笼子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:84
msgid ""
"The cage is locked fast. Inside, a boy with pointed goblin ears grips the bars: 'The warden's keys! The big ring - he keeps it in his strongbox there. Get it and let me out!'"
msgstr "笼子锁得死死的。里面一个长着地精尖耳朵的男孩抓着栏杆：“典狱长的钥匙！那一大串——他放在那边的保险箱里。拿到它，放我出去！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd04.lua:97
msgid ""
"The cage is locked. The girl inside whispers: 'The warden's got the keys - a big ring, in the strongbox in his lodge off the gallery downstairs. Please let me out!'"
msgstr "笼子锁着。里面的女孩小声说：“典狱长有钥匙——一大串，放在楼下走廊旁他小屋的保险箱里。求你们放我出去！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:197
msgid "The drum collapses in a heap of ashes, smoke, and smoldering timber."
msgstr "鼓塌成一堆灰烬、浓烟和阴燃的木头。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:123
msgid ""
"The Drum-Master falls and the great drum's beat breaks off. The drum itself still stands on the scaffold: burn it."
msgstr "鼓手长倒下了，大鼓的节拍中断了。鼓本身还立在脚手架上：把它烧掉。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:149
msgid "Signal drum"
msgstr "信号鼓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:136
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the signal drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr "干兽皮立刻着了火：信号鼓烧了起来，它的节拍从喧嚣中消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:144
msgid "Nothing is left of the signal drum but a charred frame."
msgstr "信号鼓只剩下一个烧焦的框架。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:164 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:186
msgid "Spirit drum"
msgstr "灵鼓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:17
msgid ""
"Vertigo has not slept for a week: war drums boom out of the north hills every night, and every night orc raiders fall on another farm. The drums are in these caves: burn all three (the signal drum on the palisade's firing step, the shaman's spirit drum in the warren, and the great drum in the Drum Hall, where the Drum-Master beats it), and look for Tam, Oslo's boy, whom they carried off from his father's farm."
msgstr ""
"弗蒂戈镇一个星期没睡了：每天夜里战鼓从北边的山丘里轰鸣，每天夜里兽人突袭队都扑向另一座农场。鼓就在这些洞穴里：把三面都烧了（栅栏射击台上的信号鼓、巢穴里萨满的灵鼓，还有鼓厅里由鼓手长敲响的大鼓），并找找塔姆，奥斯陆的儿子，他们从他父亲的农场把他掳走了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:173
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the spirit drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr "干兽皮立刻着了火：灵鼓烧了起来，它的节拍从喧嚣中消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:181
msgid "Nothing is left of the spirit drum but a charred frame."
msgstr "灵鼓只剩下一个烧焦的框架。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:213 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:215
msgid "Leave the Orc Caves"
msgstr "离开兽人洞穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:218 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:224
msgid "Back gate"
msgstr "后门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:220
msgid ""
"The gate is barred from inside: a heavy timber bar lies across it in two iron brackets. Lift the bar first."
msgstr "大门从里面闩住了：一根沉重的木闩横在两个铁托架里。先把闩抬起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:227 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:235 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:87
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:95
msgid "Gate bar"
msgstr "门闩"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:229
msgid "The bar is up; the back gate is free."
msgstr "门闩已抬起；后门自由了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:23
msgid ""
"You put your shoulders to the boulder: it grinds aside and down into a hollow, and a low cave opens behind it."
msgstr "你们用肩膀顶住巨石：它磨响着滚到一边，落进一个凹坑，后面露出一个低矮的洞穴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:234
msgid ""
"You heave the heavy bar up out of its brackets. The back gate is free."
msgstr "你们把沉重的闩从托架里抬了出来。后门自由了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:238 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:241 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:244
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:247
msgid "Palisade gate"
msgstr "栅栏门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:255
msgid ""
"Across the hall, on a timber scaffold, the Drum-Master pounds the great war drum. Its gangway climbs from the west shelf."
msgstr "大厅对面，在木头脚手架上，鼓手长正在猛擂大战鼓。它的栈道从西边的岩架爬上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:264
msgid ""
"Crude furnishings and filthy bedding tell you that orcs have been living in this cave. From a pit by the south wall a thin voice calls: \"Help! Please, get me out of here!\""
msgstr "粗糙的家具和肮脏的铺盖告诉你们，兽人一直住在这个洞里。南墙边的一个坑里传来一个微弱的声音：“救命！请把我弄出去！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:104
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:109 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:117
msgid "Cage gate"
msgstr "笼门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:273
msgid "A palisade of logs blocks the cave. Orc archers on its firing steps!"
msgstr "一道原木栅栏堵住了洞穴。栅栏射击台上有兽人弓箭手！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:29
msgid "The cage gate is up; the rope ladder hangs down into the pit."
msgstr "笼门已升起；绳梯垂进坑里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:34
msgid ""
"You cut the lashings and heave the pole gate up. A rope ladder hangs down into the pit."
msgstr "你们割断绑绳，把木杆门举了起来。一架绳梯垂进坑里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:63
msgid ""
"Behind a curtain of hides a smaller drum rattles: the shaman's spirit drum."
msgstr "一道兽皮帘后面，一面较小的鼓在响：萨满的灵鼓。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:72
msgid ""
"Fresh drag marks run across the straw to a big boulder by the west wall."
msgstr "新鲜的拖痕穿过稻草，通向西墙边的一块大巨石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:98
msgid "Great war drum"
msgstr "大战鼓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:85
msgid ""
"The dry hide catches at once: the great war drum goes up in flames, and its beat drops out of the din."
msgstr "干兽皮立刻着了火：大战鼓烧了起来，它的节拍从喧嚣中消失了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:177 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:89
msgid "You leave the drum as it is, for now."
msgstr "你们暂且没动这面鼓。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:93
msgid "Nothing is left of the great war drum but a charred frame."
msgstr "大战鼓只剩下一个烧焦的框架。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:184 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd05.lua:96
msgid "You have found a war drum of the Orcs!  Destroy?"
msgstr "你们发现了兽人的一面战鼓！要摧毁吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd08.lua:122
msgid "You are not strong enough to open the coffin."
msgstr "你们不够强壮，打不开棺材。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:140
msgid "Leave the Temple of Yak"
msgstr "离开牦牛神庙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:148
msgid "West of the idol stands a barred gate: the clerics' treasury."
msgstr "偶像西边立着一道有栏杆的门：神职者的宝库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:154
msgid "A block of the wall gives under your hand and sinks: a hidden cell!"
msgstr "墙上的一块石头在你们手下沉了下去：一个暗室！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:259
msgid "There is nothing in the coffin."
msgstr "棺材里什么也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:184
msgid ""
"The Yak Master falls, and the slab behind the altar grinds up: the reliquary is open."
msgstr "牦牛大师倒下了，祭坛后的石板磨响着升起：圣物箱开了。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:192 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:195
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:201
msgid "Stone door"
msgstr "石门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:191
msgid ""
"The slab grinds up: beyond lies the temple's vestry. The way out is short from here."
msgstr "石板磨响着升起：后面是神庙的圣器室。从这里出去的路很短。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:197
msgid "The slab stands open."
msgstr "石板敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:200
msgid ""
"A plain slab without ring or handle. It is meant to be opened from the other side."
msgstr "一块平整的石板，没有环也没有把手。它是要从另一侧打开的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:287
msgid "The pool makes you ill."
msgstr "水池让你们生病了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:226
msgid ""
"Green water fills the cave below, bubbling and stinking of rot; bones lie at its rim. Three stone blocks lie in a line under the surface toward the far shore, and three stone buttons are set in a kerb at the edge."
msgstr "下方的洞穴里灌满了绿水，冒着泡，散发着腐臭；池边躺着骨头。三块石头沿一条线在水面下延伸向对岸，三个石按钮嵌在边缘的路缘上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:23
msgid "The button is pressed in. The treasury gate's east bar is sunk."
msgstr "按钮已按下。宝库门的东闩已沉下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:230 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:236
msgid "Reliquary"
msgstr "圣物箱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:232
msgid "The reliquary stands open."
msgstr "圣物箱敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:235
msgid "The slab will not move while the Yak Master lives."
msgstr "牦牛大师活着时，石板纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:249
msgid ""
"The Yak Master turns from his altar. Behind it a slab seals the reliquary; it will hold while he lives."
msgstr "牦牛大师从祭坛转过身来。它后面一块石板封住了圣物箱；他活着，它就撑着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:263 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:276
msgid "Treasury gate"
msgstr "宝库门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:271
msgid "The treasury gate is barred."
msgstr "宝库门被闩住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:275
msgid "With both bars sunk, the treasury gate lifts."
msgstr "两根闩都沉下，宝库门升起来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:284 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:294
msgid "Yak Pool"
msgstr "牦牛池"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:293
msgid ""
"You drink from the Yak Pool. Strength runs through your limbs (+2 Endurance, permanent), and then the sickness takes you: the pool makes you ill."
msgstr "你们从牦牛池里喝水。力量涌过你们的四肢（+2 耐力，永久），然后疾病抓住了你们：水池让你们生病了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd06.lua:298
msgid "There is nothing in the crate."
msgstr "箱子里什么也没有。"

