msgstr "还剩四根树枝。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:210 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:244
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:278
msgid "You hack through the living bough, and it falls. {remaining}"
msgstr "你们砍断了这根活着的大树枝，它掉了下来。{remaining}"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:18
msgid ""
"The slab door grinds open at a push, and shut again behind you. Emerson's King's Megacredits for Newcastle lie somewhere below, the golems' hoard; the golems that keep this place were never told to stop."
msgstr "石板门一推就磨响着打开，在你们身后又关上。爱默生要给纽卡斯尔的国王巨额币就在下面某处，是魔像们的宝藏；守着这地方的魔像从没被告知该停下。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:192 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:260
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:294
msgid "The bough falls. {remaining}"
msgstr "大树枝掉了下来。{remaining}"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:23
msgid "Chisels, mallets and stone dust: the golem-makers' bench."
msgstr "凿子、木槌和石粉：魔像匠的工作台。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:117
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:125 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:142
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:27
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:41 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:44 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:58
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:72
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:86 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:97
msgid "Stone Block"
msgstr "石块"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:130
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:29 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:46
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:74 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:91
msgid "The block sits in its recess."
msgstr "石块嵌在它的凹槽里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:322
msgid ""
"The Diamond door swings up: beyond it is the entry stair, by the Hall of the Plaque."
msgstr "钻石门荡了起来：后面是入口楼梯，在牌匾大厅旁边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:336
msgid "The Diamond Golem shatters, and the vault door grinds up."
msgstr "钻石魔像碎裂了，金库门磨响着升起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:346
msgid "Home of the Diamond"
msgstr "钻石之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:342
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Diamond"
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：钻石之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:345
msgid ""
"A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Diamond. The door has no ring or keyhole on this side."
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：钻石之家。这一侧门上没有环也没有锁孔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:354
msgid "A golem of living diamond turns its head. Behind it, the vault door."
msgstr "一个活钻石魔像转过头来。它后面是金库门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:358 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:360
msgid "Exit Golem Dungeon"
msgstr "离开魔像地牢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:368
msgid ""
"Below the rail, nine great stone blocks stand on the quarry floor, each beside an empty recess."
msgstr "栏杆下方，采石场地面上立着九块大石块，每块旁边都有一个空凹槽。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:377 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:394
msgid "Great lock"
msgstr "大锁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:380
msgid ""
"A lock as big as a door is set in the floor, held by three bolts. Its keyhole is cut for a great iron key."
msgstr "一把门一样大的锁嵌在地板里，用三根闩固定着。锁孔是为一把大铁钥匙开的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:386
msgid "The great lock lies open."
msgstr "大锁敞开着。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:387
msgid ""
"The Iron Key will not turn: {count} of the three bolts still hold the lock. Their levers are in this hall and in the rooms north and east."
msgstr "铁钥匙转不动：三道门闩中还有{count}道锁着。它们的拉杆在这座大厅里，以及北边和东边的房间里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:393
msgid ""
"The Iron Key turns. All is set: the great lock slides aside, and a stair goes down into a cold light."
msgstr "铁钥匙转动了。一切就位：大锁滑到一边，一道楼梯通向冰冷的光中。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:397 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:399
msgid "Forge"
msgstr "熔炉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:398
msgid ""
"The forge's coals still glow, though no smith has worked them in an age."
msgstr "熔炉的炭仍在发光，尽管已有一个时代没有铁匠使用它。"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:158
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:40 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:57 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:85
msgid ""
"Stone Block - Glowing Rock! Far off, a lamp kindles over the Iron door ({count} of six)."
msgstr "石块——发光的岩石！远处，铁门上方的一盏灯亮了起来（六盏中的第{count}盏）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:402 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:410
msgid "Home of the Iron"
msgstr "铁之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:404
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Iron"
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：铁之家"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:409
msgid ""
"A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Iron. The door is shut fast. Six lamps are set in the stone above it; {count} of them burn."
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：铁之家。门紧紧关着。门上方的石头里嵌着六盏灯，其中{count}盏亮着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:422
msgid "Six rocks glow. Far below, the Iron door grinds open."
msgstr "六块岩石发光了。远在下方，铁门磨响着打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:431
msgid ""
"Through the window ahead: the Hall of the Plaque, and six lamps over the Iron door."
msgstr "透过前方的窗户：牌匾大厅，还有铁门上方的六盏灯。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:439
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the east bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：东闩弹进大锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:446
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the east bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：东闩从大锁里抽出。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:454
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the north bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：北闩弹进大锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:461
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the north bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：北闩从大锁里抽出。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:469
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the south bolt shoots home into the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：南闩弹进大锁。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:476
msgid "Iron grinds on iron: the south bolt draws back from the great lock."
msgstr "铁磨着铁：南闩从大锁里抽出。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:485
msgid ""
"A lock as big as a door lies in the floor, three iron bolts shot into it."
msgstr "一把门一样大的锁嵌在地板里，三根铁闩插在其中。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:510
msgid ""
"You touch the statue. Deep in the north wall a bar draws back, and the Stone door grinds open."
msgstr "你们触碰雕像。北墙深处一根闩缩了回去，石门磨响着打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:514 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:520
msgid "Home of the Stone"
msgstr "石之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:516
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Stone"
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：石之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:519
msgid ""
"A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Stone. The door is shut fast; there is no ring or keyhole."
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：石之家。门紧紧关着；没有环也没有锁孔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:523 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:529 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:297
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:313
msgid "Vault door"
msgstr "金库门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:525
msgid "The vault stands open."
msgstr "金库敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:528
msgid ""
"The vault door is sealed. It will not move while the Diamond Golem stands."
msgstr "金库门封着。钻石魔像还立着时，它纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:532 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:535
msgid "Home of the Wood"
msgstr "木之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:534
msgid "A plaque over the door reads: Home of the Wood"
msgstr "门上方的牌匾写着：木之家"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:539 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:544 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:549
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:554 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:559 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:564
msgid "The glowing rock is warm under your feet."
msgstr "发光的岩石在你们脚下是温的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:568 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:570
msgid "Golem forge"
msgstr "魔像锻炉"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:569
msgid ""
"An iron pot simmers on the coals. Here the golem-makers poured the iron limbs of their golems."
msgstr "一口铁锅在炭火上炖着。魔像匠们在这里浇铸魔像的铁肢体。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd09.lua:96
msgid "The block grinds into its recess. Bare stone beneath it."
msgstr "石块磨响着落进凹槽。下面是光秃秃的石头。"

# imported from zh-cn-todo-mm9.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:111 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:114
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:118 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:121 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:125
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:128 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:132
msgid "Cave wall"
msgstr "洞壁"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:124
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:131
msgid "The mirage dissipates with your touch."
msgstr "海市蜃楼在你们一碰之下消散了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:136
msgid ""
"A board, the words scratched deep: 'THE SKULLS TAKE GEMS, NOT GOLD. THE GREAT ONE AT THE BOTTOM WANTS TEN FOR HIS KEY - KEEP TEN. THE ECHO CAVE PAST THE GUARDIANS' POST KEEPS SOME. THE PLUG IN THE SLUICE LETS THE WATER OUT, IF YOU ARE STRONG.'"
msgstr ""
"一块板，字刻得很深：“头骨要宝石，不要金子。底下那个大的要十颗换他的钥匙——留十颗。守卫哨之后的回声洞里留着一些。水闸里的塞子能把水放出去，如果你们够强壮。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:140 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:154
msgid "Bronze plug"
msgstr "青铜塞"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:142
msgid ""
"The plug hangs free on its chain. Below the window the reservoir lies empty."
msgstr "塞子悬在链子上，自由垂着。窗下，蓄水池是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:142
msgid ""
"You aren't strong enough to pull the plug. A stronger arm, or a potion of Might, might shift it."
msgstr "你们不够强壮，拔不出塞子。更强的臂力，或者一瓶力量药水，也许能挪动它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE CAVE OF ILLUSION. Warm, wet breath blows out of the ice into your faces. Artemus was plain about it: somewhere deep in this cave a talking skull sells the key to the Tower of High Magic, and skulls take gems, not gold. Mind the walls here: not all of them are there."
msgstr ""
"幻象洞穴。温暖潮湿的气息从冰里吹到你们脸上。阿尔忒弥斯说得很明白：这个洞穴深处某处，有个会说话的头骨出售高等魔法之塔的钥匙，而头骨要宝石，不要金子。当心这里的墙：不是所有的墙都真实存在。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:153
msgid ""
"You set your feet and heave on the chain. The bronze plug comes up out of its pool with a sucking roar, and through the window the black water of the reservoir begins to sink. The water roars away down the sump; somewhere below, stone gates grind open."
msgstr "你们站稳脚跟，拉动链条。青铜塞带着吸吮般的轰鸣从池里升起，透过窗户，水库的黑水开始下沉。水轰鸣着流进污水坑；下方某处，石闸磨响着打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:158
msgid "Your hand passes through the safe as though it were not there."
msgstr "你们的手穿过了保险箱，仿佛它不存在。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:201
msgid "Great skull"
msgstr "大头骨"

# machine translation (Claude), review
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:185
msgid ""
"The great skull takes ten of your gems and grins wider. +5 {stat} (permanent)."
msgstr "巨大的骷髅收下你们的十颗宝石，笑得更开了。{stat} +5（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:200
msgid "Ten gems for +5 to Might, Endurance or Accuracy?"
msgstr "十颗宝石换力量、耐力或准确 +5？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:204 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:229
msgid "Skull (Intellect)"
msgstr "头骨（智力）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:214
msgid ""
"The skull's jaw clacks shut on 5 of your gems. +3 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr "头骨的下颚咔嗒一声咬住了你们的 5 颗宝石。+3 智力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:228
msgid "5 gems for +3 Intellect?"
msgstr "5 颗宝石换智力 +3？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:257
msgid "Skull (Luck)"
msgstr "头骨（运气）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:242
msgid "The skull's jaw clacks shut on 3 of your gems. +2 Luck (permanent)."
msgstr "头骨的下颚咔嗒一声咬住了你们的 3 颗宝石。+2 运气（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:256
msgid "3 gems for +2 Luck?"
msgstr "3 颗宝石换运气 +2？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:26
msgid "Shapes stir in the silt of the drained bed."
msgstr "一些形状在排干的河床淤泥里蠕动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:260 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:285
msgid "Skull (Personality)"
msgstr "头骨（个性）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:270
msgid ""
"The skull's jaw clacks shut on 3 of your gems. +2 Personality (permanent)."
msgstr "头骨的下颚咔嗒一声咬住了你们的 3 颗宝石。+2 个性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:284
msgid "3 gems for +2 Personality?"
msgstr "3 颗宝石换个性 +2？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:313
msgid "Skull (Speed)"
msgstr "头骨（速度）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:298
msgid "The skull's jaw clacks shut on 5 of your gems. +3 Speed (permanent)."
msgstr "头骨的下颚咔嗒一声咬住了你们的 5 颗宝石。+3 速度（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:312
msgid "5 gems for +3 Speed?"
msgstr "5 颗宝石换速度 +3？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:32
msgid "A flask of red draught lies on top."
msgstr "一瓶红色药剂放在上面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:69 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:71 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:74
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:76
msgid "Leave the Cave of Illusion"
msgstr "离开幻象洞穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:85
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:88 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:94 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:97
msgid "Sluice gate"
msgstr "水闸门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:81 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd10.lua:99
msgid ""
"The stone sluice gate is shut fast. Water presses against it from the other side."
msgstr "石水闸门关得严严实实。水从另一侧压在它上面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:101 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:103
msgid "Stairway to Heaven"
msgstr "天堂阶梯"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:111 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:113
msgid "Leave the Tower of High Magic"
msgstr "离开高等魔法之塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:132
msgid "Frozen door"
msgstr "冻住的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:128
msgid ""
"The door is frozen shut: a sheet of blue ice covers it from lintel to sill, and its hinges are lost in it. A steam pipe runs cold along the wall to its frame, back toward the reagent store."
msgstr "门被冻死了：一层蓝冰从门楣盖到门槛，合页埋在里面。一根蒸汽管沿墙冰冷地通到门框，回到试剂库的方向。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:141 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:157
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:179 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:185
msgid "Lift gate"
msgstr "升降机门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:159 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:181
msgid ""
"The lift gate is bolted. The lever beside it on the wall works the bolt."
msgstr "升降机门被闩住了。墙上它旁边的拉杆控制着门闩。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:144 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:154 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:166
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:198
msgid "Gate lever"
msgstr "门拉杆"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:168 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:190
msgid "The lever is down and the gate stands open."
msgstr "拉杆已拉下，门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:15
msgid ""
"THE TOWER OF HIGH MAGIC. The Enchanted Key from the Cave of Illusion turns, and the door shuts again behind you with a sound like a held breath. Artemus was plain about it: the Skeleton Key that opens Darzog's Tower lies with the Archmage who built this place, in his study at the very top. Six laboratories climb the floors between, and their keepers will not welcome you. The stairs go up the east and west sides in turn."
msgstr ""
"高等魔法之塔。幻象洞穴的魔法钥匙转动了，门在你们身后关上，声音像屏住的呼吸。阿尔忒弥斯说得很明白：能打开达佐格之塔的万能钥匙，在建造此地的大法师手里，在最顶层他的书房里。中间的楼层往上有六间实验室，它们的看守不会欢迎你们。楼梯轮流沿着东侧和西侧上去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:153 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:197
msgid ""
"The bolt shoots back and the brass gate rises. Beyond it the cage will answer you now."
msgstr "闩弹回去，黄铜门升起。门后的吊笼现在会听你们的了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:20 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:22
msgid "The Art of Magic"
msgstr "魔法的艺术"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:201 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:207
msgid "Librarian's door"
msgstr "图书管理员的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:203
msgid ""
"The door is locked. Its keyhole is cut in the shape of an open book: the Librarian's Key, which the Head Sorceress keeps about her in the magic lab."
msgstr "门锁着。锁孔切成翻开的书的形状：图书管理员钥匙，由首席女术士带在身上，在魔法实验室里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:21
msgid ""
"THE ART OF MAGIC. 'Every spell is a door, and every door a lock. The novice forces the lock; the master learns the shape of the key. Fire wants feeding, water wants a vessel, air will go where it likes, earth will not go at all. Learn what each wants, and it will come to your hand as a dog comes to its name.' The rest is the Archmage's notes in the margins, in a hand too small to read."
msgstr ""
"魔法的艺术。“每个法术都是一扇门，每扇门都是一把锁。新手强行撬锁；大师则学习钥匙的形状。火要喂养，水要容器，风爱去哪就去哪，土根本不去。学会每样要什么，它就会像狗应声而来一样来到你手中。”其余是大法师写在页边的批注，字小得看不清。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:215 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:222 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:249
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:256 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:283 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:290
msgid "Brass cage"
msgstr "黄铜吊笼"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:217 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:239
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the first floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr "黄铜吊笼纹丝不动。一楼的它的门仍然闩着，而吊笼只听命于敞开的门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:221 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:255 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:289
msgid "The cage creaks on its chains and moves."
msgstr "吊笼在链条上吱嘎作响，动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:227
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the first floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr "吊笼挂在上方一楼，只要上面它的门还闩着，它就不会下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:233 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:267
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:279 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:301 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:313
msgid "Chains rattle in the shaft and the cage moves."
msgstr "链条在竖井里哗啦作响，吊笼动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:273
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the second floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr "黄铜吊笼纹丝不动。二楼的它的门仍然闩着，而吊笼只听命于敞开的门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:261
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the second floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr "吊笼挂在上方二楼，只要上面它的门还闩着，它就不会下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:285 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:307
msgid ""
"The brass cage will not move. Its gate on the top floor is still bolted, and the cage answers only to an open gate."
msgstr "黄铜吊笼纹丝不动。顶楼的它的门仍然闩着，而吊笼只听命于敞开的门。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:295
msgid ""
"The cage hangs at the top floor above and will not come down while its gate up there is bolted."
msgstr "吊笼挂在上方顶楼，只要上面它的门还闩着，它就不会下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:319
msgid "MYSTERIES OF LIGHT, says the brass plate on the cabinet's door."
msgstr "光明的奥秘，柜门上的黄铜牌写着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:325 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:333
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:336
msgid "Pandorian Box"
msgstr "潘多拉盒子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:335
msgid "The box is empty."
msgstr "盒子是空的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:35 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:43
msgid "Cold Brew"
msgstr "冷酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:353 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:363
msgid "Steam valve"
msgstr "蒸汽阀"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:355
msgid "The valve is open as far as it goes; steam hisses in the pipes."
msgstr "阀门已开到尽头；蒸汽在管道里嘶嘶作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:362
msgid ""
"You heave the steam valve round. The pipes knock and hiss along the walls, and from the garden beyond the still comes the crack and drip of thawing ice: the frozen door of the west stair stands open."
msgstr "你们转动蒸汽阀。管道沿着墙壁敲击嘶鸣，蒸馏器后面的花园里传来融冰的开裂声和滴水声：西楼梯的冻门敞开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:37
msgid "You have drunk the Cold Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过冷酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:42
msgid ""
"COLD BREW. Frost creeps up the ladle. It is like swallowing a winter, and afterwards the cold cannot find you: +5 Water resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "冷酿。霜沿着长柄勺爬上来。像吞下一个冬天，之后寒冷再也找不到你们：+5 水系抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:54
msgid "Electric Brew"
msgstr "电酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:48
msgid ""
"You have drunk the Electric Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过电酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:53
msgid ""
"ELECTRIC BREW. The brew crackles blue between the coils and stings your tongue like a storm: +5 Air resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "电酿。药酿在线圈之间噼啪闪着蓝光，像暴风雨一样刺痛你们的舌头：+5 风系抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:57 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:65
msgid "Energy Brew"
msgstr "能量酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:59
msgid "You have drunk the Energy Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过能量酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:64
msgid ""
"ENERGY BREW. It glows yellow in the ladle and hums in your bones for a long moment: +5 Earth resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "能量酿。它在勺里发着黄光，在你们骨头里嗡鸣了很久：+5 土系抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:76
msgid "Fire Brew"
msgstr "火酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:70
msgid "You have drunk the Fire Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过火酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:75
msgid ""
"FIRE BREW. A red brew that smokes in its cauldron by the athanor. It burns going down, and the heat stays in you: +5 Fire resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "火酿。一种红色的药酿，在炼金炉旁的大锅里冒着烟。它一路烧下去，热量留在你们体内：+5 火系抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:87
msgid "Magic Brew"
msgstr "魔法酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:81
msgid "You have drunk the Magic Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过魔法酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:86
msgid ""
"MAGIC BREW. Violet, and stranger than it looks: for a moment you hear your own thoughts from outside. Then the mind closes, stronger: +5 Mind resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "魔法酿。紫色，比看上去更古怪：有那么一刻，你们从外面听到了自己的思想。然后心智合拢，变得更强：+5 心智抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:98
msgid "Poison Brew"
msgstr "毒酿"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:92
msgid "You have drunk the Poison Brew already. It does nothing more for you."
msgstr "你们已经喝过毒酿了。它对你们没有更多作用。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd11.lua:97
msgid ""
"POISON BREW. Nightshade and hemlock, boiled down until they cure what they once caused. Bitter, and then nothing at all: +5 Body resistance (permanent)."
msgstr "毒酿。颠茄和毒芹，熬到能治它们曾经引起的病。先苦，然后什么也没有了：+5 体魄抗性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:126
msgid ""
"Seven figures in the Baron's robes turn as one. 'Which of us,' they ask together, 'will you kill first?'"
msgstr "七个穿着男爵长袍的身影齐齐转身。“你们，”他们异口同声地问，“会先杀我们哪一个？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:135 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:153
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:170 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:436 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:447
msgid "Darzog's disc"
msgstr "达佐格的圆盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:137 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:175 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:189
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:438
msgid ""
"A disc of black stone hangs in the Well behind this grille, the Baron's rune glowing on its rim. It answers to Darzog alone while he lives."
msgstr "一块黑石圆盘悬在这道栅栏后的井里，边缘上亮着男爵的符文。他活着时，它只听命于达佐格。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:149 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:169
msgid "The disc hums and glides along the Well."
msgstr "圆盘嗡鸣着沿井滑行。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:155
msgid ""
"You press the stone. Far above, at the top of the Well, a rune flares and dies: whatever it calls is bound by its master, up on his own floor."
msgstr "你们按下石头。远在上方，井顶的一枚符文亮了一下就熄灭了：被它召唤的东西，被它的主人束缚在他自己的楼层上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:173 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:184
msgid "Call the disc"
msgstr "呼叫圆盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:183
msgid "The disc rises up the Well to the landing."
msgstr "圆盘沿井升到平台。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:187 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:193
msgid "Black grille"
msgstr "黑色栅栏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:192
msgid ""
"The grille opens when the disc is here. Step onto the disc and touch it to ride down."
msgstr "圆盘在这里时栅栏会打开。踏上圆盘并触碰它就能乘它下去。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:202 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:205
msgid "Darzog's doors"
msgstr "达佐格的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:208 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:211 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:226
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:232 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:235
msgid "Study door"
msgstr "书房门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:21 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:29
msgid "Book of Accuracy"
msgstr "准确之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:217
msgid "Apprentices' door"
msgstr "学徒的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:220 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:223
msgid "Smelter door"
msgstr "熔炉门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:23
msgid "You have already learned what the book of accuracy can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了准确之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:245 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:251
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:257
msgid ""
"You fall from the tower and crash down on the island. Battered, you pick yourselves up by the tower door."
msgstr "你们从塔上摔了下来，砸在岛上。浑身是伤，你们在塔门旁爬了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:277 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:279
msgid "Darzog's journal"
msgstr "达佐格的日记"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:278
msgid ""
"DARZOG'S JOURNAL, the last page: '... The old fool Crodo sits behind my own portrait in my bedchamber, where he may admire me while he rots. Let him send his dreams to Newcastle's tinkers; no spell leaves this tower, and no spell enters it but mine. My new master in the clouds is pleased. When the King's precious \"brother\" sits the throne, I shall have Crodo's place at last.'"
msgstr ""
"达佐格的日记，最后一页：“……老傻瓜克罗多坐在我卧室里我自己的画像后面，让他在腐烂时还能欣赏我。让他把梦送给纽卡斯尔的修补匠们吧；没有法术能从这座塔出去，除了我的，也没有法术能进来。我在云中的新主人很满意。等国王宝贝的‘弟弟’登上王座，我终将得到克罗多的位置。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:28
msgid ""
"BOOK OF ACCURACY. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Accuracy (permanent)."
msgstr "准确之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 准确（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:287 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:296
msgid "The library stair door"
msgstr "图书馆楼梯门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:289
msgid ""
"Locked. The keyhole is cut as a sorcerer's sigil. The Chief Librarian keeps the key to the upper stair in his cabinet in the great library, south of the Well."
msgstr "锁着。锁孔切成术士印记的形状。首席图书管理员把上层楼梯的钥匙放在大图书馆的柜子里，在井的南边。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:295
msgid "The library key turns in the carved lock."
msgstr "图书馆钥匙在雕花锁里转动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:299 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:306
msgid "Darzog's portrait"
msgstr "达佐格的画像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:301
msgid ""
"The Baron in oils, haughty and gaunt. Behind the painted eyes something moves: an old man's face, pressed to the other side, then gone. The frame will not shift while Darzog's spell holds it."
msgstr "油画里的男爵，傲慢而憔悴。画出的眼睛后面有什么东西在动：一张老人的脸，贴在另一侧，然后消失了。只要达佐格的法术还在，画框就纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:305
msgid ""
"With Darzog dead, the portrait is only paint and wood. It slides up into the wall on a cell."
msgstr "达佐格死后，画像只是颜料和木头。它在一个滑轮上滑进了墙里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:319
msgid ""
"Wind, and the whole of Lake Darzog below. Above the roof a stair of cloud climbs into the sky."
msgstr "风，还有下方整座达佐格湖。屋顶上方，一道云梯爬向天空。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:40
msgid "Book of Endurance"
msgstr "耐力之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:336
msgid "Leave Darzog's Tower"
msgstr "离开达佐格之塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:335
msgid "You pull the tower door open on the wind off the lake."
msgstr "你们把塔门拉开，迎着湖上吹来的风。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:34
msgid "You have already learned what the book of endurance can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了耐力之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:341 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:347 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:353
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:359 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:365
msgid ""
"The cracked flags give way under you! You drop through to the works below."
msgstr "裂开的石板在你们脚下塌了！你们掉进下面的作坊。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:370
msgid ""
"A note, pinned at the head of the stair in a hurried hand: 'MIND THE CRACKED FLAGS. The Master's hatches drop you straight down to the works, and the hands down there are not friendly. Walk round them. -- Wil'"
msgstr "楼梯顶端钉着一张字条，字迹匆忙：“当心裂开的石板。主人的暗门会让你们直接掉到下面的作坊，那里的人手可不友好。绕着走。——威尔”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:374 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:378 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:381
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:385 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:388 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:392
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:395 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:399 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:402
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:406
msgid "Hatch winch"
msgstr "暗门绞盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:377 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:384 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:391
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:398 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:405
msgid "The winch clatters, and the hatch moves on its chains."
msgstr "绞盘哐当作响，暗门沿着链条移动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:39
msgid ""
"BOOK OF ENDURANCE. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Endurance (permanent)."
msgstr "耐力之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 耐力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:409 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:415
msgid "Works gate"
msgstr "作坊门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:411
msgid ""
"An iron gate bars the way to the east stair. Its chains run off along the walls toward the south: the winch that raises it must be in the assembly hall."
msgstr "一道铁门拦住了通往东楼梯的路。它的链条沿着墙通向南边：升起它的绞盘一定在装配厅里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:414
msgid "The works gate stands open."
msgstr "作坊门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:418 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:424
msgid "Works gate winch"
msgstr "作坊门绞盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:423
msgid ""
"Chains rattle: across the works, the gate to the east stair grinds up."
msgstr "链条哗啦作响：作坊对面，通往东楼梯的门磨响着升起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:43 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:51
msgid "Book of Intellect"
msgstr "智力之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:446
msgid "The disc hums and glides down the Well."
msgstr "圆盘嗡鸣着沿井滑下。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:45
msgid "You have already learned what the book of intellect can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了智力之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:450 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:453
msgid "Cell block door"
msgstr "牢房区的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:456 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:459
msgid "Crypt door"
msgstr "地穴门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:462 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:465
msgid "Guardroom door"
msgstr "警卫室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:468 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:471
msgid "Storeroom door"
msgstr "储藏室门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:50
msgid ""
"BOOK OF INTELLECT. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Intellect (permanent)."
msgstr "智力之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 智力（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:54 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:62
msgid "Book of Might"
msgstr "力量之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:56
msgid "You have already learned what the book of might can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了力量之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:61
msgid ""
"BOOK OF MIGHT. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Might (permanent)."
msgstr "力量之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 力量（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:73
msgid "Book of Personality"
msgstr "个性之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:67
msgid "You have already learned what the book of personality can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了个性之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:72
msgid ""
"BOOK OF PERSONALITY. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Personality (permanent)."
msgstr "个性之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 个性（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:76 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:84
msgid "Book of Speed"
msgstr "速度之书"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:78
msgid "You have already learned what the book of speed can teach."
msgstr "你们已经学会了速度之书能教的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:83
msgid ""
"BOOK OF SPEED. One of Darzog's own studies, written for his apprentices; whoever reads it to the end is changed by it. +5 Speed (permanent)."
msgstr "速度之书。达佐格自己的研究，为他的学徒而写；谁读到最后，就会被它改变。+5 速度（永久）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd12.lua:89
msgid ""
"The cloud gives under your foot like fog. Something holds it shut: Crodo would know what."
msgstr "云在你们脚下像雾一样塌陷。有什么东西把它封着：克罗多会知道是什么。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:100
msgid "A patch of fallen facing stone where a coat of arms once hung."
msgstr "一块掉落的饰面石，那里曾挂着纹章。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:103
msgid "A white tower on blue: the arms of Newcastle. Yours."
msgstr "蓝底上的一座白塔：纽卡斯尔的纹章。是你们的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:109
msgid "To the Newcastle site"
msgstr "前往纽卡斯尔工地"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:112 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:114
msgid "Speaking grille"
msgstr "传声栅栏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:113
msgid ""
"A brass grille in the wall beside the steel door. When you lean close, a dry voice asks: \"What is the password?\""
msgstr "钢门旁的墙上有一道黄铜栅栏。你们凑近时，一个干涩的声音问：“口令是什么？”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:119 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:151
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:153 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:173
msgid "Scratches"
msgstr "划痕"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:133
msgid "Larder"
msgstr "储藏室"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:125
msgid "You fill your packs from the larder."
msgstr "你们从储藏室里把背包装满。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:131
msgid "Food.  Fill pack?"
msgstr "食物。装满背包吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:132
msgid "Fill pack (Yes/No)?"
msgstr "装满背包（是/否）？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:136 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:138
msgid "Notebooks"
msgstr "笔记本"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:137
msgid ""
"The scientists' notebooks, swollen with damp. One page survives: 'Blade tempered. Edge holds against the undead sample. Do NOT tell the castle. Password changed to something we will all remember.'"
msgstr "科学家们的笔记本，被潮气泡胀了。只有一页幸存：“刀刃已淬火。刃口能抵住亡灵样本。切勿告诉城堡。口令改成了我们都会记住的东西。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:156 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:158
msgid "New masonry"
msgstr "新砌的石工"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:157
msgid ""
"Fresh masonry closes the old rubble slope. Emerson's men left a chalk mark: FILLED IN (KEEP)."
msgstr "新砌的石工封住了旧瓦砾坡。爱默生的人留下了粉笔记号：已填上（保留）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:162 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:167
msgid "Rubble: fallen roof stone."
msgstr "瓦砾：掉落的屋顶石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:18
msgid ""
"Emerson's diggers have been and gone: the old dungeon stair beyond the statue court is open, the chapel and the counting room have their doors, and water stands in YOUR well."
msgstr "爱默生的挖掘工来过又走了：雕像庭院外的旧地牢楼梯开了，礼拜堂和计数室装了门，你们的井里有了水。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:337 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:187
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:196 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:202
msgid "Newcastle Smithy"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔铁匠铺"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:338 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:191 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:192
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:193 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:288 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:294
msgid "Newcastle Training Hall"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔训练厅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:198
msgid ""
"A cold hearth under a missing roof. Emerson's chalk mark on the wall reads: SMITHY (KEEP)."
msgstr "一座没有屋顶的冷炉膛。墙上爱默生的粉笔记号写着：铁匠铺（保留）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:265
msgid "The way down is clear now."
msgstr "下去的路现在通了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:268
msgid ""
"A short distance down the stairs you find the way blocked with rubble. You are unable to continue down, so you come back up."
msgstr "沿着楼梯下去不远，你们发现路被瓦砾堵住了。无法继续下去，你们回到了上面。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:273
msgid ""
"A plaque at the base of the statue reads: Built in honor of Great Adventurers."
msgstr "雕像底座上的牌匾写着：为纪念伟大的冒险者而建。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:290
msgid ""
"Rubble and an old practice dummy. Emerson's chalk mark reads: TRAINING (KEEP)."
msgstr "瓦砾和一个旧练习假人。爱默生的粉笔记号写着：训练（保留）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:30
msgid ""
"Newcastle Keep. Fresh mortar, a new roof, and Newcastle's banners over the hall. The smith and the master at arms have moved in."
msgstr "纽卡斯尔主堡。新灰泥，新屋顶，大厅上方飘着纽卡斯尔的旗帜。铁匠和军事教官搬进来了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:305
msgid "Incorrect! The door hums a little louder. Nothing else happens."
msgstr "错误！门的嗡鸣声大了一点。没发生别的事。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:312
msgid "What is the password?"
msgstr "口令是什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:312
msgid "laboratory"
msgstr "laboratory"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:326 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:333 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:336
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:338
msgid "YOUR well"
msgstr "你们的井"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:328 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:337
msgid ""
"YOUR well. Dry, and choked with rubble: the diggers have not reached it yet."
msgstr "你们的井。干涸，被瓦砾堵塞：挖掘工还没挖到这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:332
msgid ""
"Even your well's water is cool and refreshing. (Armour class +20 until you rest.)"
msgstr "连你们井里的水也清凉爽口。（休息之前护甲等级 +20。）"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:342
msgid ""
"Woodpile: the old roof's beams, sawn and stacked. Some of the stack has arms."
msgstr "柴堆：旧屋顶的横梁，锯开堆起来的。有些堆里长着胳膊。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:42
msgid ""
"The ruins of Newcastle. Beyond the gate the great hall's roof has fallen in, and among the old timbers something heavy creaks and moves."
msgstr "纽卡斯尔的废墟。大门之外，大厅的屋顶塌了，旧木头堆里有什么沉重的东西在吱嘎作响、蠕动。"

# imported from packs (base v1.21)
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:46 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:48
msgid "Sack"
msgstr "麻袋"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:52
msgid "Bones: whoever stood in the hall when the bolt struck."
msgstr "骨头：雷击落下时站在大厅里的人。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:61
msgid ""
"Lagoon water has seeped into the old cellar and stands black between the walls. Something in it breathes."
msgstr "泻湖的水渗进了旧地窖，黑黑地积在墙之间。里面有什么东西在呼吸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:339 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:176 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:177
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:178 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:71
msgid "Chapel of Newcastle"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔礼拜堂"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:67
msgid ""
"An empty chapel with no altar. Emerson's chalk mark reads: CHAPEL (DUNGEON STAGE, DON'T ASK)."
msgstr "一间没有祭坛的空礼拜堂。爱默生的粉笔记号写着：礼拜堂（地牢阶段，别问）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:340 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:182
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:183 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:89 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:95
msgid "Newcastle Counting Room"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔计数室"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:91
msgid ""
"A bare room with an iron ring in the floor. Emerson's chalk mark reads: BANK (DUNGEON STAGE)."
msgstr "一间光秃秃的屋子，地板上有个铁环。爱默生的粉笔记号写着：银行（地牢阶段）。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd13.lua:98
msgid "Arms of Newcastle"
msgstr "纽卡斯尔的纹章"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:12
msgid ""
"Castle Basenji: the wizard cult's keep on its crag over the rim. Somewhere above is Arie's master's Scroll of Insight; somewhere below, the dogs that are not dogs. The gate is the way back out."
msgstr "巴森吉城堡：巫师邪教建在边缘之上峭壁上的主堡。上方某处是阿里的主人的洞察卷轴；下方某处，是那些不是狗的狗。大门是出去的路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:136
msgid "Cell row"
msgstr "牢房一排"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:139 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:142
msgid "Great hall"
msgstr "大厅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:145 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:147
msgid "Kennels"
msgstr "犬舍"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:150 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:152
msgid "Scriptorium"
msgstr "抄写室"

