msgstr "被困的农民"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:160 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:162
msgid "Study"
msgstr "书房"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:167
msgid "Roof walk"
msgstr "屋顶步道"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:173
msgid ""
"You lift the heavy bar out of its brackets, and the door swings open onto the east landing."
msgstr "你们把沉重的闩从托架里抬起，门荡开，通向东平台。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:179
msgid "The door is barred from the other side."
msgstr "门从另一侧被闩住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:191
msgid ""
"The jailers' room. Somewhere along the cells a chain rattles, and someone coughs."
msgstr "狱卒的房间。牢房那边某处，一条锁链哗啦作响，有人咳嗽了一声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:197
msgid "An empty chain hangs from the post."
msgstr "柱子上挂着一条空锁链。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:210
msgid ""
"The kennels: iron pens round a feeding pit, the straw soiled. What sleeps here is not a dog."
msgstr "犬舍：围着喂食坑的铁围栏，稻草脏污。睡在这里的不是狗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:214 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:216
msgid "Scroll of Aging"
msgstr "衰老卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:219 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:221
msgid "Scroll of Intellect"
msgstr "智力卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:224 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:226 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:244
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:246
msgid "Scroll of Magic"
msgstr "魔法卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:229 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:231
msgid "Scroll of Personality"
msgstr "个性卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:234 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:236
msgid "Scroll of Speed"
msgstr "速度卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:239 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:241
msgid "Scroll of Energy"
msgstr "能量卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:249 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:251 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:313
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:315
msgid "Scroll of Depression"
msgstr "沮丧卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:254 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:256 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:318
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:320
msgid "Scroll of Confusion"
msgstr "混乱卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:259 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:261 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:293
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:295
msgid "Scroll of Death"
msgstr "死亡卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:26
msgid ""
"The battlement walk over the gate: the desert lies white under the sun below the crag."
msgstr "大门上方的垛口步道：沙漠在峭壁下的阳光里白得耀眼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:264 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:266 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:298
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:300 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:323 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:325
msgid "Scroll of Insanity"
msgstr "疯狂卷轴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:283
msgid "STOP!  What is the password?"
msgstr "站住！口令是什么？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:284
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "口令："

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:284
msgid "There wolf"
msgstr "There wolf"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:284
msgid "There-wolf"
msgstr "There-wolf"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:284
msgid "therewolf"
msgstr "therewolf"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:30 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:38 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd14.lua:52
