#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:117
msgid ""
"The Dragon King is dead. Behind the dais the grate grinds up into the rock."
msgstr "龙王死了。高台后面，栅栏磨响着升进岩石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/house_data.txt:356 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:129 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:131
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:134 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:136
msgid "The Dragon Tax Office"
msgstr "龙税务局"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:13
msgid ""
"Sulphur and old smoke on the air. Somewhere far in, something very large is breathing."
msgstr "空气里有硫磺和陈年烟味。深处某处，有什么极其巨大的东西在呼吸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:149
msgid "Past the lip the rock drops away into the dark. Down there, wings."
msgstr "越过边缘，岩石坠入黑暗。下面有翅膀。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:158
msgid "Shelves cut to a dragon's reach, and books the size of doors."
msgstr "按龙的够得着的高度凿出的书架，还有门一样大的书。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:167
msgid ""
"Cold pours in through a gap in the north wall: stars, and nothing under them."
msgstr "冷气从北墙的缺口涌进来：星星，下面什么也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:171 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:173
msgid "The Art of Taxation"
msgstr "《税收的艺术》"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:181 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:183
msgid "Dragon Lore Volume 1"
msgstr "《龙学》第一卷"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:186 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:188
msgid "Dragon Lore Volume 2"
msgstr "《龙学》第二卷"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:191 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:193
msgid "Dragon Lore Volume 3"
