#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:77
msgid ""
"A heavy grate, set deep in the rock behind the dais. It does not move."
msgstr "一道沉重的栅栏，嵌在高台后面的岩石深处。它纹丝不动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:90 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd18.lua:95
