msgstr "一个空托盘。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:236
msgid "Green gem eyes, a whole tray of spares. You take three emeralds."
msgstr "绿色的宝石眼睛，整整一托盘备用的。你们拿走了三颗祖母绿。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:240 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:254
