#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:447
msgid "Guard Making Machine"
msgstr "守卫制造机"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:410 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:442
msgid "A broken press. Nothing comes out of it any more."
msgstr "一台坏掉的冲压机。再也出不来东西了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:413 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:445
msgid "Guard Making Machine.  Destroy?"
msgstr "守卫制造机。摧毁吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:421 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:453
msgid "The machine shudders, jams, and stops stamping."
msgstr "机器颤抖、卡死，不再冲压了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:480
msgid ""
"Both machines are still. The bays' shutters roll up, and the last guards step off the line."
msgstr "两台机器都静止了。隔间的百叶窗卷了起来，最后的守卫走下了生产线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:486
msgid "An empty frame. Silver dust and shards of glass."
msgstr "一个空框架。银粉和玻璃碎片。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:526
msgid "A press thumps. A new guard steps off the line."
msgstr "冲压机砰地一响。一个新守卫走下了生产线。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:530 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:532
msgid "Air pylon: to the south-east tower"
msgstr "风系塔柱：通往东南塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:531
msgid "The air pylon. Its conduit runs to the south-east tower."
msgstr "风系塔柱。它的导管通向东南塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:535 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:537
msgid "Earth pylon: to the gravel vault"
msgstr "土系塔柱：通往碎石库"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:536
msgid "The earth pylon. Its conduit runs to the gravel vault."
msgstr "土系塔柱。它的导管通向碎石库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:540 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:542
msgid "Fire pylon: to the south-west tower"
msgstr "火系塔柱：通往西南塔"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:541
msgid "The fire pylon. Its conduit runs to the south-west tower."
msgstr "火系塔柱。它的导管通向西南塔。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:545 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:547
msgid "Water pylon: to the cold vault"
msgstr "水系塔柱：通往冷库"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:546
msgid "The water pylon. Its conduit runs to the cold vault."
msgstr "水系塔柱。它的导管通向冷库。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:585
msgid "Take (Yes/No)?"
msgstr "拿走吗（是/否）？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:597 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:599
msgid "War table"
msgstr "作战桌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:598
msgid ""
"A map of both faces of Xeen. Darkside armies are pinned along the edge, ready to cross."
msgstr "一幅辛恩两面的地图。暗面的军队沿着边缘插着，随时准备越过。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:63 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:68 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd19.lua:73
msgid "An iron bed. It smells of sulphur."
msgstr "一张铁床。有硫磺味。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:22 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:24 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:27
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:29
msgid "The Arena Master"
msgstr "竞技场主管"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:32 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:34 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:37
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:39 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:42 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:44
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:47 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:49
msgid "Exit the Warzone"
msgstr "离开战区"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:57
msgid ""
"A passage through the cliff. Ahead, the Hall of the War Games, where the Arena Master takes challenges."
msgstr "穿过悬崖的一条通道。前方是战争游戏大厅，竞技场主管在那里接受挑战。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:61 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:63
msgid "Hall of the War Games"
msgstr "战争游戏大厅"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:13 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:18 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd20.lua:8
msgid "There is nothing amongst the bones."
msgstr "骨头堆里什么也没有。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:113
msgid "Scratched over the dicing table: NOW THIS IS A WILD TOWN."
msgstr "骰子桌上划着：这才叫狂野的镇子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:117 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:119
msgid "Dues box"
msgstr "会费箱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:118
msgid ""
"The gang's dues box. Empty. Scratched beside the slot: WHAT DID YOU EXPECT, MONEY?"
msgstr "帮派的会费箱。空的。投币口旁边划着：你指望什么，钱吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:124
msgid "Quay door"
msgstr "码头门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:127 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:135
msgid "Fence's door"
msgstr "销赃人的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:129
msgid ""
"Locked: a good lock from Rivercity Smithing. A thief who can disarm traps (skill 3) could pick it; the boss's keys would open it."
msgstr "锁着：河城锻造的一把好锁。会拆陷阱的盗贼（技能 3）可以撬开它；老大的钥匙也能打开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:134
msgid "The lock gives with a click."
msgstr "锁咔嗒一声开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:143
msgid ""
"Wet footprints lead from the drain to the north wall and stop dead at the stones. One block is cleaner than the rest, worn smooth by hands."
msgstr "湿脚印从排水口通向北墙，在石头前戛然而止。有一块石头比别的干净，被手磨得光滑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:147 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:149
msgid "Boss's ledger"
msgstr "老大的账本"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:148
msgid ""
"The Robber Boss's ledger. Takings by the week; a royal tiara, 'not to be fenced'; and at the foot, underlined twice: STRONGROOM - throw the catch by the hearth BEFORE you walk the passage. Darts for anyone who forgets. That means you, Weasel."
msgstr ""
"强盗老大的账本。按周记的收入；一顶王室头冠，“不可销赃”；最下面，划了两道线：保险库——走通道之前，务必先扳壁炉旁的卡榫。谁忘了谁吃飞镖。说的就是你，黄鼠狼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:152 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:160
msgid "Loose brick"
msgstr "松动的砖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:154
msgid "An empty hole behind a loose brick."
msgstr "松动的砖后面是个空洞。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:159
msgid "Behind the loose brick: a robber's purse. 150 gold."
msgstr "松动的砖后面：一个强盗的钱袋。150 金币。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:163 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:167
msgid "Worn block"
msgstr "磨损的石块"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:166
msgid ""
"You push the worn block: it slides aside on greased runners. A brick passage runs north into the dark."
msgstr "你们推磨损的石块：它沿涂了油的滑轨滑开。一条砖砌的通道向北通入黑暗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:181
msgid ""
"The river roars in through the grate. The old sluice wall makes a catwalk across the race."
msgstr "河水轰鸣着从栅栏涌进来。旧水闸墙架成了横跨水道的栈桥。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:190
msgid ""
"Voices above: \"...a royal tiara won't fence in Rivercity, boss. Too hot.\" \"Then it stays in the strongroom till it cools.\""
msgstr "上面传来说话声：“……王室头冠在河城可没法销赃，老大。太烫手了。”“那就留在保险库里，等它冷下来。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:200
msgid "A tripwire! A crossbow bolt whips out of the wall."
msgstr "绊线！一支弩箭从墙里嗖地射出。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:209
msgid ""
"You stand inside the great bridge. Carts rumble overhead; the race runs dark and fast beneath. The robbers' plank bridge is drawn back to the far bank."
msgstr "你们站在大桥内部。车辆在头顶隆隆驶过；水道在下面又黑又急。强盗的木板桥被拉回到了对岸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:215
msgid ""
"An iron door with three locks. The Robber Boss carries the keys on a ring at his belt."
msgstr "一道有三把锁的铁门。强盗老大把钥匙串在腰间的环上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:220
msgid "The three keys turn one after another, and the iron door grinds up."
msgstr "三把钥匙依次转动，铁门磨响着升起。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:224 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:235
msgid "Bridge winch"
msgstr "桥绞盘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:226
msgid "The bridge is out across the race."
msgstr "桥已架出，横跨水道。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:234
msgid ""
"The winch clanks round: the plank bridge rolls out across the race to the west bank."
msgstr "绞盘哐啷转动：木板桥滚出，横跨水道，通到西岸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:65 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:74
msgid "Catch"
msgstr "卡榫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:67
msgid "The catch is thrown: the passage's darts are locked."
msgstr "卡榫已扳上：通道的飞镖锁住了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:73
msgid ""
"You throw the catch. Deep in the wall of the passage something ratchets and locks."
msgstr "你们扳上卡榫。通道的墙深处有什么东西咔嗒一声锁死了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd21.lua:98
msgid "Click. Darts hiss out of the walls!"
msgstr "咔嗒。飞镖从墙里嗖嗖射出！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:107
msgid ""
"The moon gallery. Below, the frozen mere stretches away under the sky, and the wind pulls at your cloaks."
msgstr "月亮廊。下方，冰冻的湖在天空下延伸开去，风拉扯着你们的斗篷。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:112
msgid ""
"The gong booms through all five storeys, and the pagoda falls silent to listen."
msgstr "铜锣的声音传遍所有五层，宝塔静了下来倾听。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:119
msgid "Mat"
msgstr "席子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:118
msgid ""
"A draught comes up between the floorboards. The mat lifts: a trapdoor, and a ladder down into the dark."
msgstr "一股穿堂风从地板缝里升上来。席子掀起：一道活板门，和一架通向黑暗的梯子。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:122 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:124
msgid "Hearth"
msgstr "炉膛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:123
msgid "The kitchen hearth, cold. Rice is trodden into the ashes."
msgstr "厨房的炉膛，冷的。米被踩进了灰烬里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:128
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's rice jars, smashed. Whoever did it was looking for something, or for nothing."
msgstr "凯吴的米罐，被砸碎了。不管谁干的，他要么在找什么，要么什么也不找。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/data_tables/map_stats.txt:9 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:132 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:134
msgid "Winterkill Tundra"
msgstr "冬杀镇冻原"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:138 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:143 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:148
msgid ""
"Racks of blades, bows and shuriken. The best of it is locked in the chest."
msgstr "一架架刀剑、弓和手里剑。最好的锁在箱子里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:157
msgid ""
"Paper screens stand everywhere, lit from behind. Shadows move on the paper, and stop when you do."
msgstr "到处立着纸屏风，从后面点着灯。纸上的影子在动，你们一停，它们也停。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:161 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:163
msgid "Cushion"
msgstr "软垫"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:162
msgid "A worn cushion on the cellar floor, still warm."
msgstr "地窖地面上一个磨旧的软垫，还是温的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:18
msgid ""
"The barred door gives way. The pagoda smells of cold incense and lamp oil, and somewhere above a floorboard creaks."
msgstr "上闩的门开了。宝塔里有冷香和灯油的气味，上方某处，一块地板吱嘎作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:188 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:190 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:193
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:195 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:198 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:200
msgid "Straw target"
msgstr "草靶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:189 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:194 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:199
msgid "A straw target, bristling with shuriken."
msgstr "一个草靶，插满了手里剑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:203 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:205
msgid "Weapon wall"
msgstr "武器墙"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:204
msgid "Wooden practice blades, worn smooth at the grip."
msgstr "木制练习刀，握柄被磨得光滑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:23
msgid ""
"The monks' bell, green with age. Kai Wu rang it every dawn, until the Evil Ninja clan drove him from his sacred home."
msgstr "僧侣的钟，锈出了绿色。凯吴每天黎明都敲它，直到邪恶忍者氏族把他赶出圣地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:27 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:29
msgid "Broom"
msgstr "扫帚"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:28
msgid ""
"A broom, dropped where an old monk let it fall. \"There are still Ninja in my Pagoda,\" Kai Wu said. Nobody has swept since."
msgstr "一把扫帚，被一位老僧丢在原处。“我的宝塔里还有忍者，”凯吴说。从那以后没人扫过地。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:37
msgid ""
"The clan's storeroom: coils of rope, bolts of black cloth, sacks of rice."
msgstr "氏族的储藏室：成卷的绳子、成匹的黑布、一袋袋米。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:56 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:58
msgid "The clan's banner"
msgstr "氏族的旗帜"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:57
msgid ""
"A black banner with a carrion bird: the clan's mark, hung over a monk's altar."
msgstr "一面画着食腐鸟的黑旗：氏族的标记，挂在僧侣的祭坛上方。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:73 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:76
msgid "Crane screen"
msgstr "仙鹤屏风"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:75
msgid ""
"The paper tears from top to bottom, and the crane falls away. Behind it a stair climbs into the dark."
msgstr "纸从上到下撕开，仙鹤坠落了。后面一道楼梯爬进黑暗。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:84 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:87
msgid "Sliding door"
msgstr "拉门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd22.lua:9
msgid ""
"Kai Wu's altar. The clan has hung its black banner over it, and the incense bowls are full of shuriken."
msgstr "凯吴的祭坛。氏族在上面挂了他们的黑旗，香炉里装满了手里剑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:102
msgid "Ash and charred bones fill the fire pit."
msgstr "灰烬和烧焦的骨头填满了火坑。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:102
msgid "The trolls' fire burns in its pit. The Matron is near."
msgstr "巨魔的火在坑里燃烧。女族长就在附近。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:105
msgid ""
"The stench of this cave tells you that Trolls have been living in it. It is filled with things that Trolls find valuable:  Bones, straw beds, fist-sized rocks and hides.  Destroy the lair?"
msgstr "这个洞穴的恶臭告诉你们，巨魔一直住在这里。里面堆满了巨魔认为有价值的东西：骨头、稻草床、拳头大的石头和兽皮。摧毁巢穴吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:110 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:113 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:159
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:162
msgid "Hide curtain"
msgstr "兽皮帘"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:121
msgid ""
"A great hall under the mound, hot and reeking. The Troll Matron rises from her bedding by the fire."
msgstr "土丘下的一座大厅，又热又臭。巨魔女族长从火边的铺盖里站了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:136
msgid ""
"Frozen carcasses lie stacked under the hides: deer, a horse, and things you would rather not name."
msgstr "冻硬的尸体堆在兽皮下：鹿、一匹马，还有你们不愿说出名字的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:14
msgid "The stench of this cave tells you that Trolls have been living in it."
msgstr "这个洞穴的恶臭告诉你们，巨魔一直住在这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:150
msgid ""
"The Troll Matron falls. Her fire still burns in its pit under the chimney."
msgstr "巨魔女族长倒下了。她的火仍在烟囱下的坑里燃烧。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:165 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:167
msgid "Hides in the chimney"
msgstr "烟囱里的兽皮"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:166
msgid ""
"Frozen hides and gnawed poles are rammed up the chimney over the fire. The smoke seeps out round them; nothing else could."
msgstr "冻硬的兽皮和啃过的木杆被塞进火上方的烟囱。烟从它们周围渗出；别的东西做不到。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:175
msgid ""
"This hollow is filled with things that Trolls find valuable: bones, fist-sized rocks and hides. A hunter's pack lies among them."
msgstr "这个洼地堆满了巨魔认为有价值的东西：骨头、拳头大的石头和兽皮。其中有一个猎人的背包。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:18 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:20
msgid "Gnawed bark"
msgstr "啃过的树皮"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:185 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:187
msgid "The mound's crown"
msgstr "土丘顶"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:19
msgid ""
"Strips of the Troll Forest's bark, gnawed and spat out. Thickbark said it: \"They gnaw on our bark to sharpen their teeth in a most uncivilized fashion. Friends don't gnaw on friend's bark.\""
msgstr "巨魔森林的树皮条，被啃过又吐出来。厚树皮说过：“他们啃我们的树皮来磨牙，极不文明。朋友不啃朋友的树皮。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd23.lua:98 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:130
msgid "You leave the lair as it is, for now."
msgstr "你们暂且没动这个巢穴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:110
msgid ""
"Behind the dais a slab of the wall sinks into the floor: a narrow stair climbs into the dark, the Count's own way up."
msgstr "高台后面，墙上一块石板沉进了地板：一道狭窄的楼梯爬向黑暗，是伯爵自己上去的路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:116
msgid "Up to Nightshadow's square"
msgstr "上到夜影镇广场"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:122
msgid ""
"The symbol on the iron door flares once and goes dark. The door swings inward."
msgstr "铁门上的符号亮了一下，随即暗去。门向内荡开了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:126 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:128
msgid "Moon window"
msgstr "月亮窗"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:127
msgid ""
"A window painted on the stone: a full moon over Nightshadow. The chapel's congregation never wanted a real one."
msgstr "石头上画着一扇窗：夜影镇上方的一轮满月。礼拜堂的会众从来不想要真的月亮。"

# imported from terms.mm7.po
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:131 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:133
msgid "Portrait"
msgstr "画像"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:132
msgid ""
"Count Draco, painted in the fashion of one century or another. Every portrait in the gallery has the same pale face."
msgstr "德拉科伯爵，按某个世纪的风格画成。画廊里每幅肖像都是同一张苍白的脸。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:137
msgid ""
"Words are cut into the foot of the great sarcophagus: Open his coffin and bid him farewell; only then can you use the magic of the well."
msgstr "大石棺脚下刻着字：打开他的棺材，向他告别；只有这样，你才能用上水井的魔力。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:142
msgid ""
"Cut into the stone over the iron door: Only at night can you put up a fight."
msgstr "铁门上方的石头上刻着：只有夜里，你才能与他一战。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:146 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:148
msgid "Feast table"
msgstr "宴会桌"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:147
msgid ""
"A long table laid for guests who never left. The wine has dried to a black crust in the goblets."
msgstr "一张为从未离开的客人摆好的长桌。酒在高脚杯里干成了一层黑壳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:21
msgid ""
"Draco's coffin was a door: the stair under it ends in the old crypt of Nightshadow. Somewhere below, the Count waits in his vault."
msgstr "德拉科的棺材是一扇门：它下面的楼梯通向夜影镇的旧墓穴。下方某处，伯爵在他的地库里等待。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:25 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:27
msgid "Sexton's cot"
msgstr "司事的小床"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:26
msgid ""
"The sexton's cot. The blanket is folded; he went out one night and came back different."
msgstr "司事的小床。毯子叠得整整齐齐；他有天夜里出去，回来就变了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:65
msgid ""
"A narrow ramp, worn smooth by one pair of feet over many centuries, climbs toward the crypt above."
msgstr "一道狭窄的斜坡，被一双脚在许多个世纪里磨得光滑，向上通往上方的地穴。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:10 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:8
msgid "Black altar"
msgstr "黑色祭坛"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd24.lua:9
msgid ""
"A black altar under a painted moon. The candles on it burned down long ago, and nobody here needs light."
msgstr "画着月亮下的一座黑色祭坛。上面的蜡烛早就烧尽了，这里没人需要光。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:101
msgid ""
"The coloured light falters, flickers and sinks into the floor with a dying hum."
msgstr "彩光摇曳、闪烁，伴着垂死的嗡鸣沉进了地板。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:110
msgid ""
"A message appears in the stone over the wall of light: Alternate the colors around the well / Then the machine can no longer repel."
msgstr "光墙上方的石头里浮现出一条信息：围着水井交替颜色 / 那机器便再也无法抵挡。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:121
msgid "Drain grate"
msgstr "排水栅栏"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:116
msgid "An iron grate over a drain, bolted fast from the other side."
msgstr "排水口上的一道铁栅栏，从另一侧牢牢闩住。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:12
msgid ""
"Stone steps lead down from Asp's square into the dark. Sloughed snakeskins lie on every tread, and from below comes a dry hissing."
msgstr "石阶从毒蛇镇广场通向黑暗。每级台阶上都有蜕下的蛇皮，下方传来干燥的嘶嘶声。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:120
msgid "You draw the bolt and the grate swings up."
msgstr "你们拉开门闩，栅栏荡了起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:135
msgid ""
"The transformer: four bronze coils taller than a man round a chamber of bars, an empty socket shaped like a scarab in its face, and in its crown a cluster of crystals pulsing blue. The floor hums under your feet."
msgstr "变压器：四根比人还高的青铜线圈围着一间栏杆室，面板上有一个形如圣甲虫的空插槽，顶部有一簇闪着蓝光的水晶。地板在你们脚下嗡鸣。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:144
msgid ""
"Shed snakeskins hang from poles across the room like washing, grey and papery. In a corner stands a chest of things that once belonged to people."
msgstr "蜕下的蛇皮像晾晒的衣服一样挂在横穿房间的杆子上，灰色，薄如纸。角落里有一只箱子，装着曾经属于人的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:16 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:19
msgid "Door to Asp's square"
msgstr "通往毒蛇镇广场的门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:162
msgid ""
"Three barred cages stand against the west wall. The people in them are half turned: scales on their arms, eyes gone yellow. One whispers: \"Don't let them take us down to the machine.\""
msgstr "三只带栏杆的笼子靠在西墙边。里面的人变了一半：手臂上有鳞，眼睛变黄。一个人低声说：“别让他们把我们带到下面的机器那里。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:18
msgid "You climb out into Asp's square."
msgstr "你们爬出来，到了毒蛇镇广场。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:186
msgid ""
"The cages stand open. The townsfolk, their scales already flaking away, crowd round you: \"Thank you for saving us!\" Then they hurry up the stair toward the daylight."
msgstr "笼子敞开了。镇民们，鳞片已经开始脱落，围住你们：“谢谢你们救了我们！”然后他们匆匆爬上楼梯，奔向日光。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:210
msgid "You leave the machine humming. Somewhere above, someone hisses."
msgstr "你们让机器继续嗡鸣。上方某处，有人在嘶嘶作响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:217
msgid "You have found the transformer!  Do you wish to destroy it?"
msgstr "你们发现了变压器！要摧毁它吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:27
msgid ""
"Straw, shed skin and the reek of snake: the brood hall, where new snake men lie fresh from the machine below."
msgstr "稻草、蜕皮和蛇的臭味：育雏厅，新的蛇人刚从下面的机器里躺在这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:31 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:34
msgid "Loose slab"
msgstr "松动的石板"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:33
msgid "The slab grinds down into the floor. Behind it, a hiding hole."
msgstr "石板磨响着沉进地板。后面是一个藏身洞。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:37 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:43
msgid "Barred cage"
msgstr "带栏杆的笼子"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:39
msgid "The cage gates stand open."
msgstr "笼门敞开着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:42
msgid ""
"The gates are held by brass wires that run down through the floor to something below. They will not open while it works."
msgstr "笼门由黄铜线拉着，线向下穿过地板通向下方的什么东西。只要它还在运转，门就不会开。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:66
msgid ""
"Asp's old cistern, dry for years. Something long and scaled moves in the basin."
msgstr "毒蛇镇的旧蓄水池，干了多年。有什么又长又带鳞的东西在池底移动。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:81
msgid "Crystal housing"
msgstr "水晶外壳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:90
msgid ""
"The channel climbs toward a grate. On this side, a heavy bolt holds it."
msgstr "水道向上通往一道栅栏。这一侧，一根沉重的闩固定着它。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:102 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd25.lua:94
msgid "Field of light"
msgstr "光场"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:103 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:111
msgid "Hoist"
msgstr "升降机"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:105 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:116
msgid ""
"The platform hangs on its ropes at the ledge above. Its winch must be in the cave beside you."
msgstr "平台悬在上方岩架处的绳子上。它的绞盘一定在你们旁边的洞穴里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:110
msgid "The platform creaks on its ropes and moves."
msgstr "平台在绳子上吱嘎作响，动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:114 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:124 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:127
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:137
msgid "Call rope"
msgstr "呼叫绳"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:12
msgid ""
"The cave runs into the mountain and opens on a shaft so tall its top is lost in shadow. Wings beat somewhere far above."
msgstr "洞穴深入山里，通向一道高得望不见顶的竖井。远处上方有翅膀在拍打。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:123 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:136
msgid "You pull the rope; the platform creaks on its ropes and moves."
msgstr "你们拉动绳子；平台在绳子上吱嘎作响，动了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:129
msgid ""
"The rope will not run: the hoist's winch in the fence's cave below is still locked."
msgstr "绳子拉不动：下方销赃人洞穴里的升降机绞盘仍然锁着。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:41
msgid ""
"Crates and sacks stand along the walls, each with a tag on a string: \"Deliver to Asp: one silver mirror.\" \"Deliver to Asp: two candlesticks.\" Someone pays the gargoyles to steal, and keeps the goods here."
msgstr ""
"板条箱和麻袋沿墙堆放，每件上都系着一张标签：“送往毒蛇镇：银镜一面。”“送往毒蛇镇：烛台两个。”有人付钱让石像鬼去偷东西，并把赃物存放在这里。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:45 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:48
msgid "Hanging moss"
msgstr "垂挂的苔藓"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:47
msgid ""
"You push the hanging moss aside. Behind it a crack opens on a hidden ledge."
msgstr "你们把垂挂的苔藓推到一边。后面一道裂缝通向一块隐蔽的岩架。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:51 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:53
msgid "Leave the Gargoyle Eyrie"
msgstr "离开石像鬼巢崖"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:56 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:58
msgid "Great nest"
msgstr "大巢"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:66
msgid ""
"The matriarch's roost: a great nest of sticks and bones, heaped with things that glitter."
msgstr "女族长的栖所：一个巨大的巢，用树枝和骨头搭成，堆满了闪闪发光的东西。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:75
msgid ""
"Ledges climb the walls of the shaft, one above another, and a rope bridge sags across it high overhead. Grey shapes wheel between them."
msgstr "岩架沿着竖井的墙壁一层层向上，一座绳桥在高处下垂着横跨其上。灰色的身影在它们之间盘旋。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:79 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:81
msgid "Climb out through the crack"
msgstr "从裂缝里爬出去"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:86
msgid ""
"The winch is wound out; the hoist answers its deck and its call ropes now."
msgstr "绞盘已放出；升降机现在听命于它的平台和呼叫绳。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:94
msgid ""
"You crank the winch. A rope runs out through a hole in the rock, and beyond the wall a plank platform comes creaking down on its ropes from the high ledge."
msgstr "你们摇动绞盘。一根绳子从岩石上的一个洞里放出去，墙后一块木板平台吱嘎作响地沿着绳子从高处岩架降下来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:100 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:98
msgid "Tagged crates"
msgstr "带标签的板条箱"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd26.lua:99
msgid ""
"Each crate has a tag on a string. One tag is a scrap torn from a complaint to the Burlock watch, in a careful hand: \"I know not why they took it, only that gargoyles are hired to steal things for people.\" Under it someone has scrawled: \"Deliver to Asp. Quickly.\""
msgstr ""
"每只板条箱上都系着标签。其中一张是从写给伯洛克巡逻队的投诉信上撕下的碎片，字迹工整：“我不知道他们为什么拿走它，只知道雇了石像鬼给人偷东西。”下面有人潦草写着：“送往毒蛇镇。快。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:100
msgid "The bar lies across the gate in its forked posts. Lift the bar first."
msgstr "闩横在大门的叉形柱子里。先把闩抬起来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:109
msgid ""
"The log gate does not move: it is barred on the inside. A reek of old bones and rotten meat blows from a crack in the west wall of the mouth: the ogres throw their scraps down there, and what they throw down, you can climb up."
msgstr "原木门纹丝不动：它从里面闩住了。西壁洞口的一道裂缝里吹来陈年骨头和腐肉的臭味：食人妖把残渣扔到那里，而他们扔下去的东西，你们能爬上来。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:116 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:139
msgid "Ogre lair"
msgstr "食人妖巢穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:134
msgid ""
"The Chieftain's seat of boulders, hung with the trophies of Nystor's boats. Break it now and his band will only pile it up again: the Chieftain throws from the ledge beyond the quarry."
msgstr "酋长的巨石座椅，挂满了尼斯托船只的战利品。现在打碎它，他的部下只会再堆起来：酋长是从采石场之外的岩架上扔石头的。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:137
msgid "You have found an Ogre lair.  Destroy?"
msgstr "你们发现了一座食人妖巢穴。要摧毁吗？"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:144
msgid ""
"A heavy plank door with an iron lock. The Ogre Chieftain keeps its key on his belt; he directs the boulder throwing on the ledge beyond the quarry."
msgstr "一道带铁锁的厚木板门。食人妖酋长把钥匙挂在腰带上；他在采石场之外的岩架上指挥扔巨石。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:156
msgid ""
"Daylight and the roar of the river! The ledge hangs over the gorge. At its south end a heap of boulders waits on a timber rack, and the Ogre Chieftain bellows at his throwers."
msgstr "日光和河水的轰鸣！岩架悬在峡谷上。南端，一堆巨石放在木架上，食人妖酋长对他的投掷手们咆哮。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:165
msgid ""
"Bones and refuse slither under your feet: the ogres throw their scraps down this crack. Something growls above."
msgstr "骨头和垃圾在你们脚下滑动：食人妖把残渣从这条裂缝扔下来。上方有什么东西在低吼。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:169 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:180
msgid "Boulder rack"
msgstr "巨石架"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:189
msgid ""
"You went over the parapet and fell into the river below. The current tumbled you down the gorge and cast you up, half drowned, at the foot of the bluff, and you have climbed back up to the lair's mouth."
msgstr "你们翻过护墙，掉进下面的河里。水流把你们冲下峡谷，又把半溺水的你们抛在悬崖脚下，你们爬回了巢穴口。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:51
msgid ""
"The Ogre Chieftain crashes down. A heavy iron key hangs from his belt."
msgstr "食人妖酋长轰然倒下。一把沉重的铁钥匙挂在他腰带上。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:62
msgid "A boulder comes bounding down the chute behind you!"
msgstr "一块巨石沿着滑槽在你们身后蹦着滚下来！"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:66 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:68
msgid "Leave the Ogre Lair"
msgstr "离开食人妖巢穴"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:83
msgid ""
"Below, a great cauldron bubbles over the fire in the cooking pit: the ogres' supper. Best not to look in."
msgstr "下面，一口大锅在烹饪坑的火上冒泡：食人妖的晚饭。最好别往里看。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:89
msgid "The bar is up; the gate opens on the mouth."
msgstr "闩已抬起；大门通向洞口。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:94
msgid ""
"You heave the log up out of its forked posts. The gate is free: the short way out to the mouth."
msgstr "你们把原木从叉形柱子里举起。大门自由了：通向洞口的近路。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:104 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:107 assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:113
#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/events/maps/xeen_xd27.lua:98
msgid "Log gate"
msgstr "原木门"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_dd17.cinematics.yml:23
msgid ""
"Corak steps out of the Soul Box, taller than the room. Before the throne, Sheltem is there as if he had always been."
msgstr "柯拉克从灵魂盒里走出来，高得顶到了房顶。王座前，谢尔特姆就在那里，仿佛一直都在。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_dd17.cinematics.yml:26
msgid ""
"They close on each other, and the castle begins to shake itself apart."
msgstr "两人扑向对方，城堡开始自行崩塌。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_dd17.cinematics.yml:39
msgid "\"The Cube! Take it and run!\""
msgstr "“魔方！拿着它快跑！”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_p5.cinematics.yml:63
msgid "The Dragon Pharaoh: \"Let the two faces of Xeen be one world again.\""
msgstr "龙法老：“愿辛恩的两面再次合为一个世界。”"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_xd19.cinematics.yml:21
msgid ""
"Xeen's scepter gives a high whine, like a blade drawn across a whetstone. The mirror takes up the sound and throws it back, louder and louder."
msgstr "辛恩的权杖发出一声尖啸，像刀刃划过磨刀石。镜子接过这声音，反弹回来，越来越响。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_xd19.cinematics.yml:28
msgid ""
"Just as you realize that the mirror and the scepter are not compatible, the mirror shatters in a spectacular display of light, noise and violence."
msgstr "就在你们意识到镜子和权杖互不相容的时候，镜子以一场光、噪音和暴力的壮观场面碎裂了。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_xd19.cinematics.yml:39
msgid ""
"The castle gives an awful shudder and groans like a beast mortally wounded."
msgstr "城堡发出可怕的震颤，像受了致命伤的野兽一样呻吟。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/maps/xeen_xd19.cinematics.yml:42
msgid ""
"With masonry falling and dust filling the air, you all decide to remain calm and proceed to the nearest exit in an orderly fashion."
msgstr "砖石坠落，尘土弥漫，你们全体决定保持冷静，有序地前往最近的出口。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/world.yml:159
msgid ""
"Sheltem is gone, and Corak with him. At the Pharaoh's shrine the Scepter and the Cube woke the Ancients' last design: the Cloudside and the Darkside are one land under one sky. Prince Roland and Queen Kalindra are wed above the clouds, and the people of Xeen will long tell of the adventurers who made their world whole."
msgstr ""
"谢尔特姆走了，柯拉克也随他而去。在法老的神殿，权杖与魔方唤醒了远古者最后的设计：云侧和暗面合为一片土地，同在一片天空之下。罗兰王子和卡琳德拉女王在云上成婚，辛恩的人民将长久传颂那些让他们的世界重归完整的冒险者。"

#: assets_dev/worlds/xeen/world.yml:7
msgid "World of Xeen"
msgstr "辛恩世界"

#~ msgid "Xeen--9N."
#~ msgstr "辛恩——9N。"

